        "id":  "patna-delhi-darbhanga-delhi-special-trains-announced",
        "title":  "Patna–Delhi \u0026 Darbhanga–Delhi Special Trains Announced",
        "summary":  "दिल्ली जाना अब होगा आसान! पटना और दरभंगा से चलेंगी 4 नई स्पेशल ट्रेनें — सीट, सुविधा और समय का पूरा अपडेट When travel stress rises, even a single good update feels",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eWhen travel stress rises, even a single good update feels like a breath of relief — and this time, Bihar got four reasons to smile!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndian Railways has stepped in with a timely decision. It has announced four special trains between Patna–Delhi and Darbhanga–Delhi, offering smoother travel, easier seat availability, and reduced festival rush. Let’s break down every important detail so you can plan your journey wisely.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy These Special Trains Matter Right Now\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe festival season and heavy passenger load often push Bihar–Delhi routes beyond capacity. Seats vanish quickly. Platforms get crowded. Journeys turn exhausting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHowever, this new decision changes everything.These four trains will ease the load on key stations like Ara, Buxar, DDU, Muzaffarpur, Samastipur and Hajipur. Moreover, limited stoppages will help passengers reach Delhi faster and more comfortably.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePatna–Delhi Special Trains: Full Schedule \u0026 Highlights\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndian Railways will operate two pairs of special trains between Patna and Anand Vihar Terminal in the second week of December.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔹 Train 02395 (Patna → Delhi)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 9, 11, 13 December Departure: 8:30 PM from Patna Route: Danapur → Ara → Buxar → DDU Arrival: 3:00 AM next day, Anand Vihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 9, 11, 13 December\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeparture: 8:30 PM from Patna\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoute: Danapur → Ara → Buxar → DDU\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArrival: 3:00 AM next day, Anand Vihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔹 Train 02396 (Delhi → Patna)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 10, 12, 14 December Departure: 7:00 PM from Anand Vihar Arrival: 2:00 PM next day\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 10, 12, 14 December\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeparture: 7:00 PM from Anand Vihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArrival: 2:00 PM next day\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔹 Train 02309 (Patna → Delhi)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 10, 12, 14 December Follows the same timetable as 02395\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 10, 12, 14 December\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollows the same timetable as 02395\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔹 Train 02310 (Delhi → Patna)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 11, 13, 15 December\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 11, 13, 15 December\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese trains will run with minimal stoppages so passengers save time and travel comfortably.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDarbhanga–Delhi Special Trains: Full Schedule \u0026 All You Must Know\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMithila region gets its own relief too.Two pairs of special trains will run between Darbhanga and Anand Vihar Terminal.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔹 Train 05563 (Darbhanga → Delhi)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 10, 11, 13, 14 December Departure: 6:15 PM from Darbhanga Route: Samastipur → Muzaffarpur → Hajipur → other key stops Arrival: 9:15 AM next day, Delhi\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 10, 11, 13, 14 December\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeparture: 6:15 PM from Darbhanga\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoute: Samastipur → Muzaffarpur → Hajipur → other key stops\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArrival: 9:15 AM next day, Delhi\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔹 Train 05564 (Delhi → Darbhanga)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 12, 13, 15, 16 December Departure: 12:05 AM from Anand Vihar Arrival: 11:00 PM next day\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 12, 13, 15, 16 December\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeparture: 12:05 AM from Anand Vihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArrival: 11:00 PM next day\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔹 Train 05565 (Darbhanga → Delhi)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 9 and 12 December\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns on 9 and 12 December\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔹 Train 05566 (Delhi → Darbhanga)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReturns on 11 and 14 December\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReturns on 11 and 14 December\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith these trains, passengers will finally experience smoother travel and shorter waiting lists.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Move Brings Big Relief\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePassengers often struggle with last-minute travel during peak rush. However, these special trains offer:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBetter seat availability Less crowding at key stations More convenient travel timings Faster journeys due to limited stoppages\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBetter seat availability\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLess crowding at key stations\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore convenient travel timings\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFaster journeys due to limited stoppages\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn short, the decision brings stability when people need it the most.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay Updated With Bihar’s Most Trusted Digital Platform\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you love getting fast and reliable Bihar updates on trains, travel, infrastructure, culture, entrepreneurship, and grassroots stories, then you’re in the right place.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow www.biharsay.com for more such regular updates and become part of our 13k+ global community.Bihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform. We’re reshaping Bihar’s image through powerful stories on culture, business, and real change.Our flagship podcast BiharCast dives into untold narratives and rising voices from the heart of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e",
