        "id":  "extra-coaches-added-on-delhi-bound-bihar-trains-amid-indigo-crisis",
        "title":  "Extra Coaches Added on Delhi-Bound Bihar Trains amid Indigo Crisis",
        "summary":  "Indigo Crisis Impact: Bihar Steps Up With Extra Coaches on Delhi-Bound Trains | A Big Relief for Stranded Flyers When flights stop, hopes often sink. But this week, Bihar turned panic into",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eWhen flights stop, hopes often sink. But this week, Bihar turned panic into relief with quick decisions that helped thousands of travellers stuck due to the ongoing Indigo crisis. For many, trains became the lifeline they desperately needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy the Indigo Crisis Created Chaos for Travellers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe sudden wave of Indigo flight cancellations left passengers confused and stressed. Many of them had urgent plans, medical needs or office commitments in Delhi. As chaos grew, people started crowding airports and searching for alternatives.Yet, travelling by train seemed impossible due to packed waiting lists.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is where the Indian Railways stepped in.And the move changed everything.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRailways Add Extra Coaches to Key Delhi-Bound Trains\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo ease the pressure, East Central Railway (ECR) acted fast on the instructions of the Danapur Division. Their quick response restored confidence among the stranded passengers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOfficials, including Saraswati Chandra, Chief Public Relations Officer of ECR (@RailMinIndia), confirmed the steps.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExtra Coaches Added:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTejas Rajdhani Express – One extra Third AC coach Sampoorna Kranti Express – One extra Second AC coach\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTejas Rajdhani Express – One extra Third AC coach\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSampoorna Kranti Express – One extra Second AC coach\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese additions increased seat availability within hours. As a result, people finally found a reliable option to reach Delhi without panic.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecial Trains Flagged Off for Immediate Relief\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBesides adding coaches, Railways launched several special trains to handle the sudden surge in demand. These trains ensured that stranded flyers did not have to wait endlessly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHere are the key special trains running to and from Delhi:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e02309 Patna → Anand Vihar Terminal SpecialDeparts: 8 December, 20:30Arrives: Next day, 15:00 02310 Anand Vihar → Patna SpecialDeparts: 7 \u0026 9 December, 19:00Arrives: Next day, 14:00 02395 Patna → Anand Vihar SpecialDeparts: 7 December, 20:30Arrives: Next day, 15:00 02396 Anand Vihar → Patna SpecialDeparts: 8 December, 19:00Arrives: Next day, 14:00 05563 Darbhanga → Anand Vihar SpecialDeparts: 7 December, 18:15Arrives: Next day, 21:15 05564 Anand Vihar → Darbhanga SpecialDeparts: 9 December, 00:05Arrives: 23:00\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e02309 Patna → Anand Vihar Terminal SpecialDeparts: 8 December, 20:30Arrives: Next day, 15:00\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e02310 Anand Vihar → Patna SpecialDeparts: 7 \u0026 9 December, 19:00Arrives: Next day, 14:00\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e02395 Patna → Anand Vihar SpecialDeparts: 7 December, 20:30Arrives: Next day, 15:00\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e02396 Anand Vihar → Patna SpecialDeparts: 8 December, 19:00Arrives: Next day, 14:00\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e05563 Darbhanga → Anand Vihar SpecialDeparts: 7 December, 18:15Arrives: Next day, 21:15\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e05564 Anand Vihar → Darbhanga SpecialDeparts: 9 December, 00:05Arrives: 23:00\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese services created breathing room for passengers, especially those who lost their travel plans due to cancelled @IndiGo6E flights.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Move Matters for Bihar and Delhi Travelers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Indigo disruption exposed how fragile travel networks can be. Yet, the railways showed that strong systems can absorb shocks when quick actions are taken.Furthermore, this step proved that Bihar handles crises with clarity and compassion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePassengers now see a clear path forward. They have trains, seats and timely alternatives. Even though the airline crisis continues, people can still move toward safety, work and family.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay Updated With Bihar’s Fastest-Growing News Community\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more such important and timely updates that impact your travel, safety and daily life, follow:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 www.biharsay.comJoin our 13,000+ global community and be a part of Bihar’s most trusted apolitical storytelling platform.Bihar Say continues to reshape Bihar’s identity through stories of culture, development and change.Don’t miss the next update—become part of the journey today.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTags:Bihar Train News Bihar Travel Update Danapur Division Delhi Travel Bihar East Central Railway Extra Coaches Indigo Crisis Indigo Flight Cancellation Sampoorna Kranti Express Special Trains Bihar Tejas Rajdhani\u003c/p\u003e",
