        "id":  "bceceb-declares-bihar-neet-pg-2025-round-1-seat-allotment-result-declared",
        "title":  "BCECEB Declares Bihar NEET PG 2025 Round 1 Seat Allotment Result declared",
        "summary":  "“Race for Bihar NEET PG 2025 Begins: Top 4 Grab MD Radio-Diagnosis Seats in Round 1” When ambition meets opportunity, Bihar creates stories worth celebrating. Today’s update from @BCECEB has set the",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eWhen ambition meets opportunity, Bihar creates stories worth celebrating. Today’s update from @BCECEB has set the medical community buzzing with excitement, hope, and intense competition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar NEET PG 2025 Round 1: A Big Day for Medical Aspirants\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB) released the Round 1 seat allotment result for PGMAC 2025 on its official website. Thousands of candidates rushed to check their status as soon as the update went live on bceceboard.bihar.gov.in.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe rush felt emotional because every seat carries years of hard work and sacrifice. Moreover, this first round often shapes the direction of a doctor’s career.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInterestingly, the results revealed a clear trend. The top four rankers secured seats in MD Radio-Diagnosis, a speciality now preferred by many toppers nationwide. Meanwhile, six others from the top 10 opted for General Medicine and Obstetrics \u0026 Gynaecology, showing how aspirations continue to diversify.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat the Allotment Data Says About Changing Preferences\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe choices made by Bihar’s toppers say a lot about shifting goals. Students increasingly prefer specialties that offer sharper learning curves and strong clinical exposure. And Radio-Diagnosis clearly leads that list this year.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, general medicine and OBG still hold immense relevance, especially for students who want broad clinical practice. Because of this balance, Round 1 reflects both ambition and practicality.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFurthermore, candidates now show stronger clarity in personal goals, leading to more confident seat selections. Therefore, this trend could continue in upcoming rounds as well.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImportant Dates Every Candidate Must Keep in Mind\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe counselling schedule for PGMAC 2025 is tight and demands quick action.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDownload allotment order: Till December 1 Reporting at allotted institutes: November 28 to December 1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDownload allotment order: Till December 1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReporting at allotted institutes: November 28 to December 1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlthough the window is short, it gives enough time for candidates to prepare documents and complete the process smoothly. However, missing the deadline can lead to disqualification from the next rounds. Therefore, early reporting is always better.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow to Check Bihar NEET PG 2025 Round 1 Seat Allotment\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChecking the result is simple. Follow these steps:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit bceceboard.bihar.gov.in Click PGMAC Result under “Download” Open the PDF file Search your application number View your allotted seat\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit bceceboard.bihar.gov.in\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClick PGMAC Result under “Download”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen the PDF file\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSearch your application number\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eView your allotted seat\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis process takes only a minute, yet it changes the entire course of a doctor’s journey.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA New Chapter for Bihar’s Medical Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery seat in this counselling round contributes to Bihar’s growing medical strength. Moreover, with candidates choosing diverse specializations, the state is preparing for a stronger, more skilled healthcare system.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd as Round 2 approaches, thousands more will anxiously wait, prepare, and dream again. Their stories continue to reshape Bihar’s medical future — one result at a time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 For more such real-time, apolitical, deeply humanised updates, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 13k global community!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Say is Bihar’s leading storytelling and development-focused digital platform — the true voice of a rising Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTags:BCECEB Bihar Medical Counselling Bihar NEET PG 2025 Bihar news bihar say MD Radio Diagnosis Bihar Medical Education Bihar NEET PG Bihar NEET PG Seat Allotment PGMAC 2025\u003c/p\u003e",
