        "id":  "bihar-pathologist-dr-prabhat-ranjan-receives-commonwealth-medical-association-fellowship",
        "title":  "Bihar Pathologist Dr Prabhat Ranjan Receives Commonwealth Medical Association Fellowship",
        "summary":  "“From Patna to the Commonwealth: How Dr. Prabhat Ranjan Became Bihar’s New Face of Global Healthcare Leadership” A Bihar Story That Inspires the World When Bihar rises, the world watches. And today,",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003e“From Patna to the Commonwealth: How Dr. Prabhat Ranjan Became Bihar’s New Face of Global Healthcare Leadership”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Bihar Story That Inspires the World\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen Bihar rises, the world watches. And today, one name from Patna has once again proven that excellence from this land travels far. Dr. Prabhat Ranjan, a leading pathologist and director of the Diagnostic \u0026 Research Center, Patna, earned the prestigious Commonwealth Medical Association (CMA) Fellowship. His achievement has sparked pride across Bihar, India, and beyond.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Moment of Honour in Hyderabad\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe fellowship ceremony took place during a major CMA conference in Hyderabad that explored how AI and digital healthcare are reshaping medicine. During the event, Chief Justice of India, Justice Suryakant, personally handed the honour to Dr. Ranjan. This moment added even more weight to the recognition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Fellowship Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAchievements gain meaning when they grow from service. Dr. Ranjan stood out because he consistently stepped forward whenever Bihar needed him. He worked tirelessly during the Covid-19 pandemic, and his contribution strengthened public health systems across the state.Moreover, his cancer awareness campaign in rural Bihar continues to reach families who often struggle to access basic information. As CMA president Prof JA Jayalal noted, such efforts create long-term impact and inspire the entire medical fraternity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Voice Committed to Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter receiving the fellowship, Dr. Ranjan expressed deep gratitude. He dedicated the honour to the people of Bihar. His words carried hope, since he also promised to push harder for accessible and reliable healthcare across the state. Through dedication and grit, he continues to show that excellence rooted in Bihar can grow into global influence.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more inspiring, apolitical, and deeply human stories like this, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 13k global community.Bihar Say, the state’s leading storytelling platform, is reshaping Bihar’s image through culture, business, development, and grassroots change. Join us as we spotlight voices, journeys, and changemakers through BiharCast, our flagship podcast and video series.\u003c/p\u003e",
