        "id":  "bpsc-71st-prelims-results-2025-out-14261-candidates-qualify-for-mains",
        "title":  "BPSC 71st Prelims Results 2025 Out : 14,261 Candidates Qualify for Mains",
        "summary":  "BPSC 71st Prelims Results 2025 Out: A Big Day for Over 13,000 Bihar Aspirants as Journey Moves to Mains BPSC 71st Prelims Results Out: A Human Story Behind the Numbers The moment",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBPSC 71st Prelims Results 2025 Out: A Big Day for Over 13,000 Bihar Aspirants as Journey Moves to Mains\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe moment thousands waited for finally arrived, and it arrived with both relief and excitement. Today, the BPSC 71st Prelims results went live on bpsc.bihar.gov.in, unlocking the next chapter for more than 13,000 hopefuls. For every aspirant, this moment is more than a result — it is a step toward a dream that demanded long nights, constant pressure, and endless perseverance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMassive Participation, Intense Competition\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bihar Public Service Commission received an overwhelming 4,71,012 applications this year. Out of them, 3,16,762 candidates appeared for the exam on September 13 across 912 centres in 37 districts. The scale reflects one thing clearly — the hunger for opportunities in Bihar is stronger than ever.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFurthermore, the Commission announced that 13,368 candidates cleared the Integrated Combined Prelims, while 893 candidates qualified for the Financial Administrative Officer Prelims. Together, 14,261 aspirants now move to the Mains.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVacancies That Shape Bihar’s Administration\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 71st Combined Competitive Examination opens doors to key administrative posts.Here is a quick overview of the major vacancies:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSenior Deputy Collector – 100 Financial Administrative Officer – 79 Labour Superintendent – 10 Sub Registrar / Joint Sub Registrar – 3 Sugarcane Officer – 17 Block Cooperative Officer – 502 Block Panchayati Raj Officer – 22 Block SC/ST Welfare Officer – 13 Revenue Officer – 45 Block Minority Welfare Officer – 459 Deputy Superintendent of Police – 14 Total – 1,264 posts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSenior Deputy Collector – 100\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFinancial Administrative Officer – 79\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLabour Superintendent – 10\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSub Registrar / Joint Sub Registrar – 3\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSugarcane Officer – 17\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlock Cooperative Officer – 502\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlock Panchayati Raj Officer – 22\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlock SC/ST Welfare Officer – 13\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRevenue Officer – 45\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlock Minority Welfare Officer – 459\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeputy Superintendent of Police – 14\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTotal – 1,264 posts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe number increased from 1,250 after BPSC added 14 DSP posts, creating more space for aspirants chasing administrative impact.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRumours, Clarifications, and Exam-Day Chaos\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBefore the exam, several coaching institutes and social media pages spread rumours of postponement. However, the Commission quickly issued a clarification on its official X handle (@bpscpatna), confirming that the exam would be held as scheduled.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn the exam day, many centres struggled with biometric verification. Several candidates panicked, worried that their attendance might be marked invalid. Even then, BPSC responded promptly. It assured everyone that manual attendance, supported by signatures on duplicate admit cards, would count as legitimate proof. This decision helped thousands stay calm and trust the process.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow to Check Your BPSC 71st Prelims Result\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChecking your result is simple. Follow these steps:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the official website: bpsc.bihar.gov.in Click on the link titled “71st Prelims Result 2025 PDF” Download the PDF and search your roll number Save the file for future reference\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the official website: bpsc.bihar.gov.in\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClick on the link titled “71st Prelims Result 2025 PDF”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDownload the PDF and search your roll number\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSave the file for future reference\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis step takes only a moment, yet it opens the gate to the crucial Mains stage.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Road Ahead: Mains, Interviews, and New Beginnings\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs candidates prepare for the next phase, the journey becomes more demanding. The written Mains exam will test conceptual clarity, discipline, and emotional balance. However, every step from here moves an aspirant closer to transforming not just their own life but also Bihar’s administrative future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCall to Action (NO CONCLUSION)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more such timely updates, ground stories, and impactful Bihar narratives, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our growing 13,000+ global community.Bihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical storytelling platform, reshaping the state’s image through culture, development, business, and grassroots change.\u003c/p\u003e",
