        "id":  "iit-patnas-sports-fest-infinito-2025-brought-together-1200-athletes-from-55-colleges",
        "title":  "IIT Patna’s Fest ‘Infinito 2025’ brought together 1,200+ athletes from 55 colleges",
        "summary":  "Infinito 2025: When 55 Colleges Lit Up IIT Patna with Sports, Spirit, and Soul!” Infinito 2025: IIT Patna’s Grand Sports Fest Ignites Passion, Unity, and Glory When 55 colleges and over 1,200",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eInfinito 2025: When 55 Colleges Lit Up IIT Patna with Sports, Spirit, and Soul!”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInfinito 2025: IIT Patna’s Grand Sports Fest Ignites Passion, Unity, and Glory\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen 55 colleges and over 1,200 athletes come together — the result is pure magic! Infinito 2025, IIT Patna’s flagship sports festival, turned the campus into a powerhouse of grit, adrenaline, and celebration. Under the electrifying theme “Imperio Guerrero” (Empire of Warriors), the three-day spectacle became a vibrant blend of athletic excellence, youthful energy, and cultural rhythm.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Stage Where Talent Met Tenacity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHosted from October 12 to 14, 2025, the festival brought together 800 male and 400 female athletes from colleges across India. The campus echoed with cheers as players battled it out in athletics, badminton, basketball, cricket, football, kabaddi, lawn tennis, squash, table tennis, and volleyball.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe event wasn’t just about competition — it was about connection. Students from different states forged new friendships, exchanged ideas, and celebrated the unifying power of sports. With every match, IIT Patna reaffirmed its spirit of inclusivity and excellence.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInspirational Words That Moved the Arena\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Felicitation Ceremony became a highlight when academic leaders and dignitaries shared their insights. Among the distinguished guests were:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProf. Ashutosh Kumar Singh, Director, IIIT Bhopal Prof. T. N. Singh, Director, IIT Patna Prof. A. K. Thakur, Dean (Administration) and Registrar Dr. Sumanta Gupta, Sports Chairman Dr. Jimson Mathew, Dean of Student Affairs Dr. Karunesh Kumar, Sports Officer\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProf. Ashutosh Kumar Singh, Director, IIIT Bhopal\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProf. T. N. Singh, Director, IIT Patna\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProf. A. K. Thakur, Dean (Administration) and Registrar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDr. Sumanta Gupta, Sports Chairman\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDr. Jimson Mathew, Dean of Student Affairs\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDr. Karunesh Kumar, Sports Officer\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn his address, Prof. Ashutosh Kumar Singh highlighted that sports build both mind and character. Meanwhile, Prof. T. N. Singh motivated students to embrace every challenge, reminding them, “Sports teach us resilience; failures prepare us to strive harder and achieve greater success.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese words resonated deeply with young athletes, reinforcing the importance of perseverance, teamwork, and mental strength.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom Medal Glory to Musical Euphoria\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe closing ceremony was nothing short of a carnival. As medals and certificates were awarded, the air buzzed with pride and applause. Champions were celebrated not just for their victories but for their relentless spirit throughout the fest.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd just when the applause faded, DJ \u0026 Cultural Night took over — lighting up the evening with music, dance, and colors of celebration. The beats, laughter, and energy mirrored the essence of Infinito: a festival that celebrates every heart that dares to compete.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIIT Patna’s Spirit Shines Beyond the Tracks\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeyond the scoreboards, Infinito 2025 stood as a testament to IIT Patna’s growing culture of holistic education — where academics meet athletics, and leadership grows through teamwork. Events like these remind us that Bihar’s youth are not just dreamers — they’re doers, fighters, and achievers shaping India’s sporting future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e✨ Stories like these define the new Bihar — bold, vibrant, and unstoppable.👉 Follow www.biharsay.com for more such inspiring stories from Bihar’s campuses, changemakers, and communities.Be part of our 13K+ global community and witness how #Bihar is redefining excellence every day!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTags:Bihar colleges sports bihar say IIT Patna cultural fest IIT Patna news IIT Patna sports fest Imperio Guerrero Infinito 2025 sports festival India 2025 student events Bihar\u003c/p\u003e",
