        "title":  "BSEB Bihar DElEd Answer Key 2025 Released | Check Direct Link, Steps to Raise Objections",
        "summary":  "“BSEB Bihar DElEd Answer Key 2025 Out! Check Answers, Raise Objections Before Deadline — Here’s How” Bihar DElEd Answer Key 2025 Released: Check Now The wait is finally over! The Bihar School",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003e“BSEB Bihar DElEd Answer Key 2025 Out! Check Answers, Raise Objections Before Deadline — Here’s How”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar DElEd Answer Key 2025 Released: Check Now\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe wait is finally over! The Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB) has officially released the Bihar DElEd Answer Key 2025, bringing relief and excitement to thousands of aspiring teachers. Candidates who appeared for the Diploma in Elementary Education (DElEd) exam can now access their answer key and response sheets on the official website — secondary.biharboardonline.com.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis release allows candidates to cross-check their answers and estimate their scores before the final result is announced.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHere’s How to Access the Bihar DElEd 2025 Answer Key\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo view your answer key, log in using your registration number and password. Once inside the portal, you can download both the answer key and the response sheet. These will help you compare your responses and calculate your approximate marks using the official BSEB marking scheme, which awards one mark for each correct answer and deducts marks for incorrect ones.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSteps to Raise Objections — Don’t Miss the Deadline\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFound an error or discrepancy in your answer key? Don’t worry! BSEB has opened an online objection window for candidates to submit corrections until October 13, 2025.Follow these quick steps to raise an objection:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the official BSEB site: secondary.biharboardonline.com Click on “DElEd Answer Key Objection 2025” on the homepage. Log in with your credentials. Select the question you want to challenge. Upload proof and pay ₹50 per objection. Submit and download your confirmation receipt.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the official BSEB site: secondary.biharboardonline.com\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClick on “DElEd Answer Key Objection 2025” on the homepage.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLog in with your credentials.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSelect the question you want to challenge.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpload proof and pay ₹50 per objection.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubmit and download your confirmation receipt.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis process ensures every valid correction is reviewed before the final answer key is released.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Happens Next?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter reviewing all the submitted challenges, BSEB will release the final answer key followed by the DElEd 2025 results. Hence, candidates must double-check their objections with proper documents to avoid errors.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bihar DElEd Exam 2025 (Phase 1) was conducted from August 26 to September 13, 2025, in two shifts daily across various centers in the state. Thousands of aspiring teachers participated, aiming to step into Bihar’s education system through this crucial gateway exam.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay Updated — Don’t Miss Future BSEB Announcements\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe DElEd 2025 answer key release is a vital step toward transparency and fairness in Bihar’s teacher training evaluation process. Whether you’re preparing for the next phase or waiting for results, staying informed is key.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 For more such regular and reliable Bihar updates, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 13K+ global community!Bihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, reshaping the state’s image through stories of culture, business, and grassroots change.\u003c/p\u003e",
