        "id":  "bseb-bihar-board-exams-2026-registration-deadline-extended-for-class-10th-12th",
        "title":  "BSEB Bihar Board Exams 2026: Registration Deadline Extended for Class 10th \u0026 12th",
        "summary":  "BSEB Extends Registration Deadline for Bihar Board Exams 2026 — New Date Announced for Class 10th \u0026 12th! BSEB Bihar Board Exams 2026: Extended Registration Window Announced If you missed the first",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBSEB Extends Registration Deadline for Bihar Board Exams 2026 — New Date Announced for Class 10th \u0026 12th!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBSEB Bihar Board Exams 2026: Extended Registration Window Announced\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you missed the first registration deadline, here’s good news — Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB) has officially extended the registration deadline for both Class 10th (Matric) and Class 12th (Intermediate) board exams for the 2026 session. Students and schools now have more time to complete the process and pay the required fees.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs per the revised schedule, the last date to submit the application forms is October 12, 2025, while the fee payment window will remain open until October 11, 2025.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOfficial Websites and Updated Registration Links\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo make the process smooth, BSEB has provided three official websites where institutions can register students directly:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003esecondary.biharboardonline.com seniorsecondary.biharboardonline.com exam.biharboardonline.org\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003esecondary.biharboardonline.com\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eseniorsecondary.biharboardonline.com\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eexam.biharboardonline.org\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe school heads are responsible for submitting online forms and verifying all student details before the final submission.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStep-by-Step Process to Register for BSEB Exams 2026\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo ensure students don’t miss out, here’s a quick guide to completing the registration correctly:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit any of the official BSEB websites listed above. Click on the link for Class 10 or Class 12 registration. Enter the required information carefully. Fill out the application form and pay the prescribed examination fee online. Submit the form and download the confirmation copy for record-keeping.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit any of the official BSEB websites listed above.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClick on the link for Class 10 or Class 12 registration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnter the required information carefully.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFill out the application form and pay the prescribed examination fee online.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubmit the form and download the confirmation copy for record-keeping.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt’s important for schools to ensure accuracy, as incorrect data may affect students’ exam eligibility later.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy the Extension Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThousands of students across Bihar were struggling to complete their registration due to technical or institutional delays. This extension brings relief to many, especially in rural areas where digital access remains limited. Moreover, it reflects the Bihar School Examination Board’s commitment to ensuring no student is left behind.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BSEB, under the Education Department, Government of Bihar, continues to improve its online systems, making exam-related processes smoother and more transparent every year.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay Updated with Bihar Say\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEducation is transforming in Bihar, and every small policy update counts. To stay informed about such crucial deadlines and exam-related announcements, follow www.biharsay.com — Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin our 11,000+ global community of readers and changemakers who believe in a new narrative for Bihar — one built on education, culture, and real stories that matter.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTags:Bihar Board Application Bihar Board Date Extended Bihar Board Exams 2026 Bihar Education News bihar say BSEB BSEB Official Website BSEB Update Class 10 Registration Class 12 Registration\u003c/p\u003e",
