        "id":  "bihars-gov-10-day-earthquake-resistant-training-empowers-masons-for-safer-infrastructure",
        "title":  "Bihar’s Gov 10-Day Earthquake-Resistant Training Empowers Masons for Safer Infrastructure",
        "summary":  "Bihar’s 10-Day Earthquake-Resistant Training Empowers Masons for Safer Infrastructure Bihar Government Launches 10-Day Training Program The Bihar Government has launched a 10-day training program in Patna to equip local masons with earthquake-resistant",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar Government Launches 10-Day Training Program\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bihar Government has launched a 10-day training program in Patna to equip local masons with earthquake-resistant construction skills. The initiative aims to strengthen disaster-resilient infrastructure across the state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe program is organized by the Bihar State Disaster Management Authority (BSDMA) in collaboration with Astrik Computers India Pvt Ltd and the National Skill Development Corporation (NSDC).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eObjectives of the Program\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bihar Government’s training program focuses on:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeveloping technical skills for earthquake-resilient construction. Reducing the vulnerability of buildings in seismic zones. Creating a workforce that can support safe and sustainable construction across Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeveloping technical skills for earthquake-resilient construction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReducing the vulnerability of buildings in seismic zones.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCreating a workforce that can support safe and sustainable construction across Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eParticipants receive government-backed certificates, toolkits, induction kits, and a financial incentive of ₹7,000 upon completion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTrainers and Supervision\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe training is conducted by experts:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePriyanshu Ranjan Upadhyay Ankit Kumar Saurabh Kumar Deepu Kumar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePriyanshu Ranjan Upadhyay\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnkit Kumar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSaurabh Kumar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeepu Kumar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe project is supervised by Ajay Kumar Singh, with the initiative guided by Prabhat Kumar Sinha, founder of Astrik Computers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImportance of Earthquake-Resistant Skills in Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar lies in seismic zones IV and V, making it highly prone to earthquakes. Many older buildings lack proper structural safety. The Bihar Government’s initiative ensures that masons learn practical skills to construct safer structures.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis effort not only protects communities but also provides employment opportunities for skilled masons trained in disaster-resilient construction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBroader Goals and Impact\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe program is part of a broader government push to develop a disaster-ready workforce in Bihar. By training masons in earthquake-resistant techniques, the initiative strengthens both local construction standards and long-term community safety.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor regular updates on Bihar Government initiatives, disaster preparedness, and other impactful programs shaping Bihar, follow www.biharsay.com and join the 13k-strong global community.\u003c/p\u003e",
