        "id":  "bihar-hikes-stipend-for-1-2-lakh-anganwadi-workers-helpers",
        "title":  "Bihar Hikes Stipend for 1.2 Lakh Anganwadi Workers \u0026 Helpers",
        "summary":  "Big Relief for 1.2 Lakh Families: Bihar Hikes Stipend for Anganwadi Workers and Helpers They are the unsung heroes of every village—guiding children, supporting mothers, and making sure nutrition and care reach",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBig Relief for 1.2 Lakh Families: Bihar Hikes Stipend for Anganwadi Workers and Helpers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThey are the unsung heroes of every village—guiding children, supporting mothers, and making sure nutrition and care reach every home. Their hard work now receives long-awaited recognition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStipend Hike Announced for Anganwadi Workers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn September 8, 2025, the state government announced a significant stipend hike for anganwadi workers and helpers. More than 1.20 lakh sevikas and sahayikas across Bihar will directly benefit from this decision.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnder the new update, anganwadi workers (sevika) will now receive ₹9,000 per month, increased from the earlier ₹7,000. Similarly, anganwadi helpers (sahayika) will now get ₹4,500, up from ₹4,000.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters for Bihar’s Communities\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnganwadi workers are the backbone of community health and nutrition programs. They serve as frontline caregivers, helping children receive early education, proper nourishment, and guidance for mothers during pregnancy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith this stipend increase, their contribution is finally being acknowledged in a meaningful way. The hike is not just financial support—it is also a gesture of respect for their tireless service.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnganwadi’s Role in Welfare and Change\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom monitoring child nutrition to spreading awareness about health, anganwadis play a transformative role in Bihar’s villages. Over the years, they have been instrumental in shaping healthier communities and creating awareness at the grassroots level.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow, with better financial security, workers are expected to feel more valued, which could strengthen their impact on families across the state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 For more such impactful updates from Bihar, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 11,000+ global community!Bihar Say is the leading apolitical storytelling platform that highlights culture, grassroots change, and everyday heroes. Be a part of Bihar’s digital voice today.\u003c/p\u003e",
