        "id":  "mega-job-camp-in-gayaji-on-september-1",
        "title":  "Mega Job Camp in Gayaji on September 1",
        "summary":  "Bihar Youth Alert: Gayaji Job Camp on September 1 Promises Career Kickstart with Salary + Incentives Looking for your first big break in the job market?Young jobseekers in Gayaji district finally have",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eLooking for your first big break in the job market?Young jobseekers in Gayaji district finally have a chance to move forward. On September 1, the Labour Resources Department will host a special employment camp at the Sub-Regional Employment Office, Kenduyi.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis event is not just another recruitment drive. Instead, it gives the youth of Bihar an opportunity to earn, learn, and build careers with confidence.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Employment Camp is Special\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor thousands of job-hunting youngsters, waiting for a stable role often feels endless. Thankfully, this camp is designed to change that.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt the camp, V-Mart Private Limited from Manpur will recruit candidates for the post of Customer Sales Associate. A total of eight positions are open, and those selected will receive a monthly salary of up to ₹9,200. In addition, performance-based incentives will further boost their earnings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMoreover, officials have confirmed that the recruitment process will stay free, fair, and transparent. This assurance is crucial, as many jobseekers fear exploitation in similar drives.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEligibility and Requirements\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe process has been kept simple to encourage maximum participation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAge Limit: 18 to 28 years Education: Minimum qualification of Intermediate (Class 12 pass) Documents: Photocopies of certificates, updated biodata, and a recent passport-size photo\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAge Limit: 18 to 28 years\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEducation: Minimum qualification of Intermediate (Class 12 pass)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDocuments: Photocopies of certificates, updated biodata, and a recent passport-size photo\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, the camp will run from 10:30 AM to 4:00 PM. Candidates should plan to arrive early, since latecomers may miss their chance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Path Beyond Just Employment\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClearly, this initiative is more than just a job opportunity. It offers:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePractical training in customer interaction Exposure to the fast-growing retail sector A stepping stone to financial stability\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePractical training in customer interaction\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExposure to the fast-growing retail sector\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA stepping stone to financial stability\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMost importantly, it gives unemployed youth a platform to build confidence and start fresh. As a result, the camp represents hope for families who are waiting for a brighter tomorrow.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 Stay connected with www.biharsay.com for more such powerful updates. Become part of our 12k+ global community and explore stories that are reshaping Bihar’s future every day.\u003c/p\u003e",
