        "id":  "bssc-recruitment-2025-apply-for-1481-office-attendant-posts-in-bihar",
        "title":  "BSSC Recruitment 2025 – 1,481 Vacancies Announced – Check Eligibility, Age Limit, and Application Dates!",
        "summary":  "BSSC CGL 2025: 1,481 Vacancies Announced – Check Eligibility, Age Limit, and Application Dates! Government job aspirants in Bihar, here’s your big chance!The Bihar Staff Selection Commission (BSSC) has released the official",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBSSC CGL 2025: 1,481 Vacancies Announced – Check Eligibility, Age Limit, and Application Dates!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGovernment job aspirants in Bihar, here’s your big chance!The Bihar Staff Selection Commission (BSSC) has released the official notification for the 4th Graduate Level Combined Competitive Examination (CGL 2025). This recruitment drive offers 1,481 vacancies across multiple government departments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe online application window opens on August 18, 2025, and will close on September 17, 2025. Candidates eager to apply must hold a graduate degree and meet the prescribed age criteria.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePost-Wise Vacancy Details\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBSSC has announced vacancies for several important positions. Here’s the breakdown:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAssistant Branch Officer – 392 posts Planning Assistant – 125 posts Malaria Inspector – 30 posts Secretariat Assistant – 385 posts Auditor (Cooperative Dept.) – 97 posts Auditor (Directorate of Audit) – 352 posts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAssistant Branch Officer – 392 posts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlanning Assistant – 125 posts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMalaria Inspector – 30 posts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSecretariat Assistant – 385 posts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAuditor (Cooperative Dept.) – 97 posts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAuditor (Directorate of Audit) – 352 posts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, 35% of seats are reserved for women candidates across all categories, ensuring wider representation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEligibility Criteria\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo apply, candidates must fulfill the following conditions:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEducation: Graduation in any discipline from a recognized university. Some posts may require specific degrees. Age Limit (as on August 1, 2025): General (Male): 21–37 years General (Female): Up to 40 years OBC/BC (Male \u0026 Female): Up to 40 years SC/ST (Male \u0026 Female): Up to 42 years\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEducation: Graduation in any discipline from a recognized university. Some posts may require specific degrees.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAge Limit (as on August 1, 2025):\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGeneral (Male): 21–37 years General (Female): Up to 40 years OBC/BC (Male \u0026 Female): Up to 40 years SC/ST (Male \u0026 Female): Up to 42 years\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGeneral (Male): 21–37 years\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGeneral (Female): Up to 40 years\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOBC/BC (Male \u0026 Female): Up to 40 years\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSC/ST (Male \u0026 Female): Up to 42 years\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis structure ensures inclusivity for different categories of aspirants.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow to Apply Online\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe application process is simple but requires careful attention:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the official website – bssc.bihar.gov.in Click on the BSSC CGL 2025 registration link (active from August 18). Complete registration using your mobile number and email ID. Fill out the application form correctly. Upload scanned documents and pay the required fee. Submit the form and download the confirmation page.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the official website – bssc.bihar.gov.in\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClick on the BSSC CGL 2025 registration link (active from August 18).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComplete registration using your mobile number and email ID.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFill out the application form correctly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpload scanned documents and pay the required fee.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubmit the form and download the confirmation page.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSelection Process Explained\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe selection process will take place in three stages:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePreliminary Examination – Conducted only if the number of applicants exceeds 40,000. This test will be objective and serve as a screening round. Mains Examination – Candidates who qualify the prelims will appear for mains, which will test subject-specific knowledge in detail. Document Verification – Final shortlisted candidates will undergo document verification. Only after successful validation will the final selection be confirmed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePreliminary Examination – Conducted only if the number of applicants exceeds 40,000. This test will be objective and serve as a screening round.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMains Examination – Candidates who qualify the prelims will appear for mains, which will test subject-specific knowledge in detail.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDocument Verification – Final shortlisted candidates will undergo document verification. Only after successful validation will the final selection be confirmed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Exam Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor aspirants in Bihar, the BSSC CGL 2025 exam is more than just a job opportunity. It opens doors to stable careers in government service, financial security, and respect in society. With 1,481 vacancies available, the chances of securing a post are higher this year.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 Stay updated with such crucial notifications and Bihar’s transformation stories by following www.biharsay.com. Become part of our 11k+ global community that celebrates Bihar’s growth, culture, and changemakers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 Stay updated with such crucial notifications and Bihar’s transformation stories by following www.biharsay.com. Become part of our 11k+ global community that celebrates Bihar’s growth, culture, and changemakers.\u003c/p\u003e",
