        "id":  "bihar-govt-offers-free-bus-travel-to-women-on-raksha-bandhan",
        "title":  "Bihar Govt Offers Free Bus Travel to Women on Raksha Bandhan",
        "summary":  "A Festival Gift That Moves with You – Literally! This Raksha Bandhan, the Bihar government is offering something more thoughtful than just wishes — free bus rides for all women and girls",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eA Festival Gift That Moves with You – Literally!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis Raksha Bandhan, the Bihar government is offering something more thoughtful than just wishes — free bus rides for all women and girls across the state on August 9, 2025.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re heading to your brother’s home or returning from your rakhi visit, your ride will cost nothing — just bring your love and laughter.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho Can Travel Free \u0026 Where?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis special initiative will apply to all city buses operated by Bihar State Road Transport Corporation (BSRTC) and the state’s signature pink buses, known for prioritizing women’s safety and accessibility.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom early morning 6 a.m. till late evening, all women and girls can board these buses without a ticket.However, male passengers must still purchase their tickets as usual.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis thoughtful move isn’t just about saving money — it’s about empowering mobility, family bonding, and cultural pride.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNot Just Bihar – It’s a Growing Nationwide Trend\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar isn’t alone in celebrating Raksha Bandhan with meaningful actions. States like Haryana, Rajasthan, Uttar Pradesh, Uttarakhand, and even Chandigarh have rolled out similar free travel plans for women.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut in Bihar, this gesture has become an annual tradition — a symbol of the state’s growing commitment to women’s safety, rights, and independence.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy It Matters Beyond the Festival\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTransport costs, however small, often become barriers for women — especially those from underserved areas. By offering free rides, the government breaks that barrier, even if for a day.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe impact?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore girls visiting families More elderly women traveling independently Less traffic congestion And most importantly — a sense of belonging and dignity on the roads.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore girls visiting families\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore elderly women traveling independently\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLess traffic congestion\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd most importantly — a sense of belonging and dignity on the roads.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is public service with emotion — governance with empathy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat They’re Saying\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile there’s no single celebrity or brand behind the move, the BSRTC (Bihar State Road Transport Corporation) deserves recognition for seamless execution each year.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTransport officials confirm that special monitoring teams will ensure smooth operations on August 9.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you spot a pink bus that day, just hop on. Your ride, your right.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe Part of the Change – Not Just a Reader\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant more such stories that showcase Bihar in its true, progressive light?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🌐 Visit www.biharsay.com for daily updates on everything that’s changing in Bihar — from grassroots heroes to bold governance decisions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 Join the 12,000+ strong community of readers, doers, and dreamers who follow Bihar Say — Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform.We’re reshaping Bihar’s image through untold stories, bold voices, and real impact.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎙️ Don’t miss our flagship podcast and video series, BiharCast, where we dig deep into culture, changemakers, and hidden traditions from the heart of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay Updated, Stay Proud\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e➡️ Follow www.biharsay.com➡️ Be the voice. Be the change. Be part of Bihar Say’s global community.\u003c/p\u003e",
