        "id":  "dr-a-p-j-abdul-kalam-science-city-to-open-in-patna",
        "title":  "Dr A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Science City to Open in Patna",
        "summary":  "“Patna Gets a New Landmark! Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Science City Is Almost Here” Ever imagined walking into a place where science isn’t just in books, but all around you—ready to be",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003e“Patna Gets a New Landmark! Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Science City Is Almost Here”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEver imagined walking into a place where science isn’t just in books, but all around you—ready to be touched, seen, and experienced? That dream is turning real in Patna.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBy the end of this August, Bihar is all set to welcome one of its most exciting educational spaces yet — the Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Science City, a place built for curious students, passionate teachers, and every science lover out there.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt on Dreams, Inspired by Dr. Kalam\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isn’t just any building. It’s a tribute to Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam, the People’s President and one of India’s most loved scientists. The science city is coming up near Moin-ul-Haq Stadium and spreads across a huge 20.5 acres.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe idea? To make science exciting, hands-on, and real for everyone — whether you’re in Class 5 or 50 years old.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Building Construction Department, under Secretary Kumar Ravi, has already completed the civil work. Now, they’re racing to finish the final installations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Makes This Place Special?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInside, you’ll find five awesome galleries, each one made to spark your imagination:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe a Scientist Basic Science Sustainable Planet Space and Astronomy Body and Mind\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe a Scientist\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBasic Science\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSustainable Planet\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpace and Astronomy\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBody and Mind\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach gallery has exhibits that don’t just talk about science — they let you experience it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn the first phase, they’re adding 47 exhibits. You’ll see cool things like AI, machine learning, data science, and even the golden ratio come alive.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isn’t just for studying — it’s for exploring.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNot Just a Museum – It’s a Full Experience\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThink it ends with galleries? Nope. The Science City also has:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA 4D theatre for those mind-blowing science visuals A 500-seat auditorium for events and student programs A dormitory that can host 150 students and teachers A cool selfie point, cafeteria, clean washrooms, digital murals, and parking\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA 4D theatre for those mind-blowing science visuals\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA 500-seat auditorium for events and student programs\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA dormitory that can host 150 students and teachers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA cool selfie point, cafeteria, clean washrooms, digital murals, and parking\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo whether you’re there to learn or just hang out with your family on the weekend — this place will have something for you.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy It’s a Big Deal for Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor years, students in Bihar have looked to other states for big science museums and hands-on exhibits.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow, we’re getting one of our own — and it’s going to be world-class.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis science city is more than infrastructure. It’s an opportunity. A spark. A safe space where kids can fall in love with learning again. It’s also set to become a magnet for schools, colleges, tourists, and science clubs from across India.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFinal Touches Underway — It’s Almost Ready!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOfficials say most of the physical work is done. The exhibit installations are moving fast. With just weeks to go, excitement is building — not just in Patna, but across the state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar is proving once again: we’re not behind — we’re building ahead.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe the First to Know When It Opens!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant to stay updated on the launch, events, and everything exciting happening in Bihar?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 Head to www.biharsay.com and join Bihar Say — the leading apolitical storytelling platform that’s giving Bihar a new voice.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith over 12,000 followers worldwide, Bihar Say is where you’ll find real stories of change, culture, and hope from the heart of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDon’t just read about Bihar. Be part of its story.\u003c/p\u003e",
