        "content":  "\u003ch1\u003eBihar Unveils India’s 21‑ft Tallest Banana Bunch Statue \u0026 A Majestic Litchi Tribute!\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Hajipur’s 21-Foot Banana Bunch Statue Steals the Spotlight — Litchi Tribute in Muzaffarpur Follows!” Bihar’s Banana Statue That Turned Heads Can a banana put a city on the map?Absolutely! Hajipur in Vaishali\u003c/p\u003e",
