        "id":  "bihar-launches-rtps-portal-health-insurance-for-contractual-staff",
        "title":  "Bihar Launches RTPS Portal \u0026 Health Insurance for Contractual Staff",
        "summary":  "Bihar goes digital with empathy — From grievance redressal to healthcare, tech is now touching lives. A Revolution Rooted in Responsibility In a bold move that reflects Bihar’s shift towards transparent, tech-driven",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar goes digital with empathy — From grievance redressal to healthcare, tech is now touching lives.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Revolution Rooted in Responsibility\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a bold move that reflects Bihar’s shift towards transparent, tech-driven governance, the state government launched a suite of digital reforms on July 25, 2025. The flagship launch includes the RTPS Online Appeal \u0026 Review Portal, a user-first platform that empowers every citizen to raise their voice against delays or denial of government services.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeld at the Secretariat Meeting Hall in Patna, the launch was spearheaded by the Chief Secretary of Bihar, who called this moment “a promise delivered digitally.” With just a few clicks, citizens can now appeal or review their grievances under the Bihar Right to Public Services Act, 2011. No more long queues, no more paperwork. It’s time for real-time justice.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRTPS Portal – A Public Right Made Clickable\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt to reduce bureaucratic delays, the portal offers:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePaperless application \u0026 grievance process Digital signature verification Real-time dashboards for tracking\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePaperless application \u0026 grievance process\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDigital signature verification\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReal-time dashboards for tracking\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isn’t just another tech update — it’s a lifeline for thousands of common people navigating government services every day. As the Chief Secretary emphasized, “Technology must serve the people, not confuse them.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHRMS Bihar Mobile App – Simplifying Government Jobs\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso launched was the HRMS Bihar mobile app for Android users. With it, government employees can now:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApply for leave Access and update service book records Manage promotions, pensions, and even disciplinary proceedings\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApply for leave\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccess and update service book records\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eManage promotions, pensions, and even disciplinary proceedings\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis marks Phase II of the HRMS system rollout. An iOS version is also in the pipeline. To ensure smooth onboarding, handbooks for employee registration and e-services have been made available.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt’s not just digitisation. It’s dignity — for those who serve the public every day.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInsurance for Contractual Staff – Dignity, Delivered\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe emotional highlight of the event was the signing of an MoU between BPSMS and SBI General Insurance. This agreement provides group health insurance to 3,560 contractual staff across Bihar. Fully funded by the Bihar Prashasnik Sudhar Mission Society, this policy offers:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e₹5 lakh annual coverage Pre-existing diseases covered from day one Cashless treatment in 17,500+ hospitals AYUSH and maternity benefits included\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e₹5 lakh annual coverage\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePre-existing diseases covered from day one\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCashless treatment in 17,500+ hospitals\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAYUSH and maternity benefits included\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“This scheme isn’t just a policy — it’s protection with pride,” said the Development Commissioner, noting how welfare must walk alongside reform.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar’s Governance Has a Human Heart\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom tech solutions to tangible security, these reforms show that Bihar is building systems with a soul. While governance elsewhere may chase metrics, Bihar is chasing meaning — making services accessible, reliable, and humane.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf this story inspired you, imagine how many more remain untold.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 Follow www.biharsay.com for more such updates and become part of our growing 12,000-strong global community!#BiharSay is Bihar’s leading apolitical media platform, rewriting the state’s narrative with facts, stories, and grassroots action.\u003c/p\u003e",
