        "id":  "kranti-prakash-jha-neetu-chandra-become-sveep-icons-in-bihar",
        "title":  "Kranti Prakash Jha \u0026 Neetu Chandra Become SVEEP Icons in Bihar",
        "summary":  "From Reel to Real Impact: Kranti Prakash Jha \u0026 Neetu Chandra Named Bihar’s New Voter Awareness Icons Two of Bihar’s finest stars are now the torchbearers of democracy! Kranti Prakash Jha and",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eFrom Reel to Real Impact: Kranti Prakash Jha \u0026 Neetu Chandra Named Bihar’s New Voter Awareness Icons\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTwo of Bihar’s finest stars are now the torchbearers of democracy! Kranti Prakash Jha and Neetu Chandra—both celebrated actors with strong roots in Bihar—have been officially appointed as State SVEEP Icons by the Bihar Election Commission. Their mission? To raise voter awareness and inspire mass participation in the electoral process.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSVEEP Gets a Star Power Boost\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Systematic Voters’ Education and Electoral Participation (SVEEP) program is Bihar’s key initiative to ensure every citizen becomes an informed and responsible voter. By bringing in Kranti and Neetu, the campaign is taking a giant leap in outreach and relatability.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoth actors will actively engage in awareness drives across the state. From social media campaigns to grassroots events, they’ll motivate people—especially first-time voters—to understand and participate in the democratic process.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Kranti and Neetu? Because Representation Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKranti Prakash Jha, known for roles in Batla House and Raktanchal, has always highlighted Bihar’s cultural depth in his work. Neetu Chandra, a National Award-winning actress and classical dancer, has represented Bihar on national and international stages.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTheir appointment is more than just symbolism—it’s a strategy. As beloved public figures, they can cut through the noise and connect emotionally with citizens, especially the youth.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAction-Packed Plans Ahead\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTheir participation will include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePublic service announcements and voter education videos School and college outreach programs Awareness campaigns during voter list revisions Collaboration with local influencers and artists\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePublic service announcements and voter education videos\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSchool and college outreach programs\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAwareness campaigns during voter list revisions\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCollaboration with local influencers and artists\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Election Commission has already launched multiple video and audio clips featuring both stars as part of this initiative.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Steps Forward: Democracy Meets Popular Culture\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis move not only deepens civic participation but also reshapes how voter awareness is communicated—dynamic, relatable, and impactful.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo know more about this and other inspiring stories from the grassroots of Bihar, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 11k+ strong global community. We are Bihar Say—Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, reshaping the state’s narrative one powerful story at a time.\u003c/p\u003e",
