        "id":  "bihars-mega-rojgar-mela-ongoing-in-patna",
        "title":  "Bihar’s Mega Rojgar Mela Ongoing in Patna",
        "summary":  "“Over 400 Hired So Far! Bihar’s Mega Job Fair Near Dashrath Manjhi Institute – Just 3 Days Left!” “अब नौकरी के लिए भागदौड़ नहीं – सीधा जॉब पाएं!” Tired of repeated interviews,",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003e“Over 400 Hired So Far! Bihar’s Mega Job Fair Near Dashrath Manjhi Institute – Just 3 Days Left!”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“अब नौकरी के लिए भागदौड़ नहीं – सीधा जॉब पाएं!”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTired of repeated interviews, form-filling, and long waits for results? Bihar’s youth finally has a faster, fairer option. The Mega Job Fair 2025 began on July 10 near the Dashrath Manjhi Labour \u0026 Employment Study Institute, Patna. Within just two days, over 2,000 youth participated and more than 400 walked away with job offers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis life-changing event is organised by the Bihar Skill Development Mission under the Labour Resources Department. It focuses entirely on your qualifications, Experience and Interview . If you’re eligible, you’re employable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDay 2 Report: 2,000+ Attendees, 400+ Offers Made\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn Day 2 alone, the fair witnessed 2,031 participants, and over 400 candidates received job offers on the spot. With the fair continuing until July 15, there’s still time for you to land a job — without the hassle of long recruitment cycles.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVenue Update: Near Dashrath Manjhi Institute\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo clarify — the event is not at Gyan Bhawan. The correct venue is near the Dashrath Manjhi Labour \u0026 Employment Study Institute, located close to the Veterinary College Ground in Patna. The organisers have ensured easy access by arranging free transportation, including pink buses for women, so that even candidates from remote areas can attend without difficulty.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho Can Apply?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you have any of the following qualifications, you’re eligible:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10th or 12th Pass ITI / Diploma / Polytechnic Graduate (B.A., B.Com., B.Sc.) B.Tech, M.Tech, MBA, or other Master’s degrees\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10th or 12th Pass\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eITI / Diploma / Polytechnic\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGraduate (B.A., B.Com., B.Sc.)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eB.Tech, M.Tech, MBA, or other Master’s degrees\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThousands have already visited. Many returned with confirmed jobs — now it’s your turn.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e80+ Companies Hiring — Across All Sectors\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver 80 renowned companies are offering jobs in various industries, including:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eL\u0026T (Larsen \u0026 Toubro) MRF Tyres Subros Ltd. Muthoot Finance Zomato Barbeque Nation Arvind Limited Utkarsh Small Finance Bank KPR Mills Dhoot Transmission Quess Corp, and many more\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eL\u0026T (Larsen \u0026 Toubro)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMRF Tyres\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubros Ltd.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMuthoot Finance\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eZomato\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBarbeque Nation\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArvind Limited\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUtkarsh Small Finance Bank\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKPR Mills\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDhoot Transmission\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuess Corp, and many more\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese companies represent sectors like manufacturing, finance, hospitality, healthcare, technology, and BPO — offering real options for real talent.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Makes This Fair Different\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isn’t just a hiring event — it’s a shift in how youth employment is handled in Bihar. By removing interviews and exams, the process becomes inclusive and skill-based. There are also career counselling sessions to help you align your strengths with industry needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccording to department officials, this initiative is about connecting Bihar’s capable youth with India’s growing industries, in real time and without bias.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3 Days Left – What You Need to Know\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is your opportunity to change your future — no written tests, no waiting period.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e📢 Want More Updates Like This?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDon’t just scroll. Follow Bihar Say — Bihar’s fastest-growing apolitical media platform — to stay updated with life-changing stories, opportunities, and breakthroughs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin our community of 11,000+ readers worldwide at www.biharsay.com and listen to BiharCast, our podcast featuring local changemakers, hidden talent, and real voices from the heart of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 Be part of the new Bihar. Stay informed. Stay inspired.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTags:Bihar Employment Fair Bihar Rojgar Mela 2025 Bihar skill development Direct Hiring Bihar L\u0026T Patna Jobs MRF Jobs Bihar No Exam Jobs Bihar Patna Job Fair Youth Employment Bihar Zomato Bihar Hiring\u003c/p\u003e",
