        "id":  "meet-bihars-neet-2025-topper-from-sitamarhi",
        "title":  "Meet Bihar’s NEET 2025 Topper from Sitamarhi",
        "summary":  "Meet Muskan: Bihar’s NEET 2025 Star Who Aced 720 Out of 643! Bihar’s Pride: Muskan Anand Shines in NEET UG 2025 For the first time this year, Muskan Anand from Sitamarhi claimed",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eMeet Muskan: Bihar’s NEET 2025 Star Who Aced 720 Out of 643!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar’s Pride: Muskan Anand Shines in NEET UG 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the first time this year, Muskan Anand from Sitamarhi claimed the title of Bihar state topper in the NEET UG 2025 exam with an impressive All India Rank of 112. She scored 643 out of 720, ranking 26th in OBC and 20th among female aspirants . Her achievement sparked enormous pride in her family, school, and district.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSelf-Study \u0026 Mock Tests: The Winning Formula\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMuskan prepared entirely through self-study and mock tests—without external coaching or online distractions. She lived in the Narayana School, Vijayawada campus, where teachers helped her build a strong conceptual foundation. She said, “I treated every mock test as a mirror. Then, I worked to improve.” This disciplined, focused strategy drove her success.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscipline, Dedication \u0026 Deep Understanding\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMuskan’s journey highlights how discipline, dedication, and deep understanding become pillars of success. She minimized screen time and resisted social media. Instead, she:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStudied every chapter thoroughly Took weekly mock tests for feedback Strengthened weak areas after each test\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStudied every chapter thoroughly\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTook weekly mock tests for feedback\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrengthened weak areas after each test\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHer parents, teachers, and friends supported her throughout. They nurtured her calm focus, which carried her through this toughest exam.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRole Model for Girls Across Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMuskan inspired every young girl who dares to dream. She told aspiring students: “If you commit to serious self-study, you can clear any big exam.” Indeed, her result—643 marks, AIR 112, Bihar topper—shows that need for external coaching fades when the will is strong.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHer success lit up Sitamarhi ward no. 25. Local leaders and citizens praised her. This moment marks a turning point in Bihar’s educational landscape.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 Dive deeper into Muskan’s inspiring journey on BiharSay.com and join our 11 K+ global community of changemakers.Bihar Say reshapes Bihar’s image through stories that matter—on culture, business, empowerment, and grassroots transformation. Plus, catch our flagship BiharCast podcast/video series for more powerful narratives.\u003c/p\u003e",
