        "id":  "hill-station-trains-from-bihar-summer-getaway-guide-2025",
        "title":  "Hill Station Trains from Bihar: Summer Getaway Guide 2025",
        "summary":  "छुट्टी का प्लान बना लिया? These Trains from Bihar Will Take You Straight to Hill Heaven! Bihar Train News: Explore India’s Hill Stations This Summer—Boarding Starts Right Here! Who says summer in",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eछुट्टी का प्लान बना लिया? These Trains from Bihar Will Take You Straight to Hill Heaven!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Train News: Explore India’s Hill Stations This Summer—Boarding Starts Right Here!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho says summer in Bihar has to be hot and hectic? What if we told you that a cool breeze, snow-capped peaks, and pine-scented adventures are just one train ride away? Yes, you read that right. Several long-distance trains passing through Bihar can take you directly to India’s most stunning hill stations, making your summer break nothing short of magical!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re craving the serenity of Himalayan valleys or the bustling charm of hill towns, Bihar has got you covered—by rail.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters for You\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMany Biharis are currently planning trips to beat the heat. While air travel sounds tempting, nothing beats the affordability, comfort, and scenic routes offered by Indian Railways.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow, here’s a handpicked list of trains passing through Bihar that can take you straight to some of the most popular hill station gateways in India.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTrains from Bihar That Take You to the Hills\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1. Lohit Express (Train No. 15651) – For the Scenic North\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis Mail Express connects Guwahati (Assam) to Jammu Tawi (J\u0026K). It passes through Bihar and is your perfect ride to explore hill stations around Jammu, such as Patnitop, Sanasar, and Bhaderwah.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e✅ Pro Tip: Book early. Jammu-bound trains fill fast in summer!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2. Howrah-Amritsar Mail (Train No. 13005) – Himachal Beckons\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoard this train and get down at Amritsar. From here, you’re just a short ride away from famous hill destinations like Dalhousie, Kangra, Chamba, Mandi, and Dharamshala.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e➡️ Bonus: You also get to explore the Golden Temple and Wagah Border on the way!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3. Saryu Yamuna Express (Train No. 14649) – Touch the Foothills\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis express train connects Jaynagar (Bihar) to Amritsar Junction. From Jalandhar or Amritsar, you’re close to picturesque towns like Nurpur, Amb, and Palampur.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e✨ A great option if you’re traveling from North Bihar!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4. Upasana Express (Train No. 12328) – Uttarakhand’s Gateway\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRunning between Dehradun and Howrah, this train is a gem. Get down at Dehradun, the entry point to gems like Mussoorie, Rishikesh, and Dhanaulti.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🌄 Perfect for families and solo travelers alike.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e5. Bagh Express (Train No. 13019) – For the Lovers of Kumaon\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis Mail Express takes you from Howrah to Kathgodam (via Bihar). Kathgodam is the nearest railhead to Nainital, Mukteshwar, and Ranikhet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🍃 Did someone say boating in Naini Lake?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e6. Archana Express (Train No. 12355) – Patna to Jammu\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis weekly train runs between Patna and Jammu Tawi, making it an ideal option for people from Bihar wanting to explore North India’s hidden hill treasures.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e💡 Jammu’s proximity to unexplored hills makes this route a must-try!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll Aboard the Adventure Train\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith these options, your dream hill vacation is just a ticket away. And the best part? You don’t need to change multiple trains or break the bank. Indian Railways brings the mountains to your doorstep—starting right here in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReady to trade the plains for the peaks?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 Follow www.biharsay.com for more such travel hacks, updates, and smart guides.Join the #BiharSay community of 11k+ explorers across the world who trust us for authentic, apolitical stories.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe it hidden villages, changemakers, or travel tips—Bihar Say is your local-to-global bridge.\u003c/p\u003e",
