        "id":  "bihar-upsc-prelims-2025-44063-students-91-centers-in-patna",
        "title":  "Bihar UPSC Prelims 2025: 44,063 Students, 91 Centers in Patna",
        "summary":  "UPSC Prelims in Patna Tomorrow: 44,063 Aspirants, 91 Centers, and a Tight Security Net! Bihar Prepares to Witness One of Its Most Awaited Competitive Events The air in Patna is tense, yet",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eUPSC Prelims in Patna Tomorrow: 44,063 Aspirants, 91 Centers, and a Tight Security Net!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Prepares to Witness One of Its Most Awaited Competitive Events\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe air in Patna is tense, yet filled with hope. On Sunday, the UPSC Civil Services Preliminary Examination will take over the city. With 44,063 candidates appearing at 91 centers, this event is more than just an exam—it’s a collective step toward change.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePatna Steps Up with Massive Administrative Mobilization\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor a state known for its intellectual zeal, Bihar is going all out. The UPSC exam will unfold in two sessions, and Patna has been transformed into a well-guarded zone.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo ensure fairness, the district administration has issued clear directives. Notably:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e30 general magistrates are deployed 18 reserve magistrates are on standby Police officers and security personnel will remain stationed at all venues\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e30 general magistrates are deployed\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e18 reserve magistrates are on standby\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePolice officers and security personnel will remain stationed at all venues\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFurthermore, authorities met at Krishna Memorial Hall to finalize coordination. Each official was briefed about their responsibilities in detail.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrict Guidelines to Prevent Any Unfair Practices\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn an effort to maintain full integrity, authorities have issued a complete ban on communication gadgets. This includes:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMobile phones Smartwatches Bluetooth devices Digital watches and other electronic tools\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMobile phones\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSmartwatches\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBluetooth devices\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDigital watches and other electronic tools\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDivisional Commissioner Mayank Barbadekar stressed during the briefing:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Our priority is to conduct a fair, peaceful, and cheat-free examination.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Our priority is to conduct a fair, peaceful, and cheat-free examination.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, every deployed officer must report two hours before the exam begins. These preventive steps reflect the seriousness of the process.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar’s Aspirants Carry Big Dreams\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar has always produced top-tier civil servants. This year, too, thousands of students have dedicated months, even years, to crack the UPSC code. While their determination is fierce, the stakes are even higher.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInterestingly, many of these aspirants come from humble backgrounds, yet carry aspirations that stretch across the nation. This blend of struggle and hope is what makes Bihar’s UPSC story so inspiring.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters: More Than an Exam\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe UPSC prelims aren’t just a test. In Bihar, they symbolize mobility, merit, and meaning. As students walk into these centers, they’re walking with the support of families, mentors, and entire communities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis Sunday, Patna won’t just be a city—it will be the epicenter of ambition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e✅ For regular updates like this, follow www.biharsay.com and join our 11K+ global community.Bihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, reshaping the narrative with stories on culture, business, and grassroots change.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith top LinkedIn impressions and key partnerships like DailyHunt, Bihar Say is fast becoming the digital voice of Bihar. Don’t forget to check out BiharCast, our flagship podcast and video series uncovering untold stories and real changemakers from the heart of the state.\u003c/p\u003e",
