        "id":  "mega-township-and-smart-city-project-in-bihar-to-mirror-gurugrams-urban-model",
        "title":  "Mega Township and Smart City Project in Bihar to Mirror Gurugram’s Urban Model",
        "summary":  "“दरभंगा to Become ‘Mini Gurugram’: Bihar’s Mega Township Dream is Finally Taking Shape!” Bihar’s Next Big Leap: Darbhanga to Host a Mega Township Like Gurugram Imagine a city in Bihar with the",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003e“दरभंगा to Become ‘Mini Gurugram’: Bihar’s Mega Township Dream is Finally Taking Shape!”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar’s Next Big Leap: Darbhanga to Host a Mega Township Like Gurugram\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine a city in Bihar with the swanky feel of Gurugram, the planning of Noida, and the heart of Mithila — yes, it’s happening, and it’s happening in Darbhanga!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a bold and progressive move, the Bihar government is all set to develop a Mega Township in Darbhanga’s Laheriasarai, transforming this historic region into a modern, self-sufficient city.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom Legacy to Modernity: Why Darbhanga?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDarbhanga isn’t just any town — it’s Bihar’s first planned city, born from the post-1934 earthquake vision. And now, it’s back in the spotlight. Minister Jivesh Mishra, during a site visit, announced that this township will be modeled on Gurugram’s urban development blueprint — featuring skyscrapers, parks, shopping malls, schools, and sports grounds.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks to existing infrastructure like AIIMS, an airport, a planetarium, and an IT Park, Darbhanga is the perfect launchpad for Bihar’s mega urban revolution.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“We are identifying three prime locations for Phase 1,” said Minister Mishra. “These will include schools, sports fields, and lush parks. A detailed map and masterplan are already in progress.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“We are identifying three prime locations for Phase 1,” said Minister Mishra. “These will include schools, sports fields, and lush parks. A detailed map and masterplan are already in progress.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Will the Mega Township Offer?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnlike traditional urban sprawl, this township is being carefully planned to meet modern needs. Think wide roads, smart utilities, and community spaces. The goal\u0027o create a self-contained satellite city with everything — commercial complexes, residential towers, educational hubs, and recreational zones.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis development will not just beautify the region but also boost employment opportunities for local youth, thanks to the upcoming industrial townships in 12 districts of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Model for the Future: Bihar’s Urban Push\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis initiative is part of a larger movement to modernize Bihar’s cities. With Darbhanga leading the way, this is more than a construction project. It’s a cultural shift, a long-overdue update to Bihar’s urban identity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor decades, Biharis have migrated for better living conditions. Now, those same comforts — even aspirations — are returning home.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd guess what? This isn’t the end. Plans for another Satellite City in Darbhanga are already on the table, promising more parks, commercial centers, and smart facilities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay Ahead of the Curve\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar is changing. Darbhanga is leading. Are you watching it happen?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow www.biharsay.com for regular updates on Bihar’s mega developments, culture, business, and inspiring grassroots stories.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe a part of our 11k-strong global community.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso tune into our flagship BiharCast series — where we uncover Bihar’s real stories and rising voices!\u003c/p\u003e",
        "category":  "Education \u0026 Social",
        "categorySlug":  "education-social",
        "publishedDate":  "2025-05-24",
        "readingTimeMinutes":  3,
        "imageUrl":  "https://biharsay.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Bihar-Say-Website-2025-05-24T155733.355.png",
