        "id":  "bihar-rojgar-mela-2025-in-jamui-jobs-from-8th-pass-to-mba-apply-now",
        "title":  "Bihar Rojgar Mela 2025 in Jamui: Jobs from 8th Pass to MBA – Apply Now!",
        "summary":  "Naukri Ka Pitara Khul Gaya Hai! Bihar’s Mega Job Mela in Jamui Offers Golden Career Chance from 8th Pass to MBA Holders! 🔥 Bihar Rojgar Mela 2025: The Game-Changer You’ve Been Waiting",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eNaukri Ka Pitara Khul Gaya Hai! Bihar’s Mega Job Mela in Jamui Offers Golden Career Chance from 8th Pass to MBA Holders! 🔥\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Rojgar Mela 2025: The Game-Changer You’ve Been Waiting For!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAre you tired of scrolling through job portals with zero results? Here’s a life-changing opportunity for you — right in your hometown!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn 22nd May, Jamui, Bihar will witness one of the biggest Rojgar Melas of the year. Whether you’re an 8th pass or an MBA graduate, there’s something in store for you. Held at KKM College, this employment fair is set to connect youth with real jobs, in real time — from 10 AM to 4 PM.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho Can Apply? Spoiler Alert: Everyone!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe best part? This is not just for the highly qualified. Whether you’ve done KYP, ITI, Intermediate, Graduation, B.Ed, Diploma, or hold a B.Tech or MBA degree, you’re welcome. Even if you’ve studied only till Class 8, you can still get a job.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat You Need to Bring:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpdated Biodata Latest Passport-size Photo Copies of Educational Certificates Valid ID Proof\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpdated Biodata\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLatest Passport-size Photo\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCopies of Educational Certificates\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eValid ID Proof\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePro Tip: Make sure you register first on the National Career Service (NCS) Portal at www.ncs.gov.in\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJobs in Your Own City – No Relocation Needed\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWorried about leaving your family behind? You don’t have to. Before the Mela, vacancies were collected from local schools, institutions, malls, offices, and private companies. This means you’ll likely land a job right in Jamui.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a world where migration feels like the only option, this initiative by the District Employment Office, Jamui, and Bihar’s Labour Resource Department offers a solid solution. Hats off to District Employment Officer Shikha Rai for making this happen.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet Hired on the Spot – No Waiting, No Delays\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeveral private companies will conduct on-the-spot interviews and selections. That’s right — walk in and possibly walk out with a job letter in hand!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNeed more info? Contact: Toll-free: 18002696566\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bigger Picture: Bihar’s Youth is Ready for Change\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isn’t just an event. It’s a movement — to ensure that young Biharis don’t need to migrate for survival. It’s about empowering youth at the grassroots. And it’s working. Events like this are reshaping Bihar’s narrative — from struggle to strength.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo, if you’re job-hunting, dreaming big, or just want to stand on your own feet — this is your moment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay Ahead of the CurveFor regular updates on job fairs, career news, and powerful stories from Bihar, follow www.biharsay.com and become a part of our 11k+ global community.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical storytelling platform, trusted by thousands and recognized for reshaping Bihar’s image. Join the movement. Be heard. Be hired.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical storytelling platform, trusted by thousands and recognized for reshaping Bihar’s image. Join the movement. Be heard. Be hired.\u003c/p\u003e",
