        "id":  "bihar-becomes-the-new-bollywood-hotspot-over-20-films-to-shoot-by-december",
        "title":  "Bihar Becomes the New Bollywood Hotspot : Over 20 Films to Shoot by December",
        "summary":  "Lights, Camera, Bihar! Why Bollywood and Beyond Are Now Obsessed with Shooting in Patna” Bihar to Bollywood: A New Star Is Rising “Patna is the new Andheri!” No, that’s not a punchline—it’s",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eLights, Camera, Bihar! Why Bollywood and Beyond Are Now Obsessed with Shooting in Patna”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar to Bollywood: A New Star Is Rising\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Patna is the new Andheri!” No, that’s not a punchline—it’s the truth unfolding on the ground.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce known mainly for its history and politics, Bihar is rapidly transforming into India’s next cinema capital. With over 20 films scheduled to shoot in the state before December 2025, including 15+ in Patna alone, the buzz is real.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd it’s not just Bhojpuri or regional cinema—top Hindi filmmakers are now eyeing Bihar’s vibrant locales. From rustic charm to modern infrastructure, Bihar is offering what Mumbai can’t: freshness, authenticity, and now—government support.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Gamechanger: Bihar’s New Film Policy\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat sparked this cinematic shift?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt’s Bihar’s bold and progressive film policy. The state is now offering grants between ₹2 to ₹4 crore for films that shoot at least 75% of their scenes in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis incentive is massive—not just for producers but for the entire ecosystem. As a result, almost every week, a film crew is setting up cameras somewhere in the state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEconomic Boost for Locals: Not Just Glitz, But Growth\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHere’s where the story gets even more exciting.This isn’t just about glamor—it’s about grassroots change.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocal artists and actors finally have a chance to work in big projects without leaving the state. Tour guides, technicians, and young filmmakers are finding real gigs. Hotels, restaurants, and taxis across Patna and other towns are seeing rising demand. Tourism is booming as fans, bloggers, and tourists arrive to spot stars or explore film sets.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocal artists and actors finally have a chance to work in big projects without leaving the state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTour guides, technicians, and young filmmakers are finding real gigs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHotels, restaurants, and taxis across Patna and other towns are seeing rising demand.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTourism is booming as fans, bloggers, and tourists arrive to spot stars or explore film sets.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd as a cherry on top—shooting locations are being upgraded with better roads, uninterrupted power, and high-speed internet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s Being Shot and Who’s Coming?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile exact film titles are under wraps, whispers in the industry say 5 big-banner Hindi films will soon announce Bihar as their prime location.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExpect stars, crews, and directors from Mumbai to land in Patna more frequently than ever before. If you’re a student of media or a theatre artist, it’s time to look homeward—Bihar is calling!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters More Than Ever\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar’s journey from migration to attraction is nothing short of cinematic.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor decades, storytellers moved out of Bihar to chase dreams. Today, dreams are moving into Bihar. The narrative is shifting. The state isn’t just a backdrop anymore—it’s becoming the plot, the protagonist, and the purpose.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd this is only the beginning.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔔 Love stories like this? Want to stay updated with the new Bihar?Join the 11k-strong global community on www.biharsay.com – Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform.From culture and cinema to business and grassroots heroes, we bring you the most inspiring stories from the heart of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 Follow us for daily insights, real change, and voices that matter.Let’s reshape Bihar’s image together—one story at a time.\u003c/p\u003e",
