        "id":  "new-degree-colleges-to-open-in-8-districts-526-new-appointments-approved",
        "title":  "New Degree Colleges to Open in 8 Districts, 526 New Appointments Approved",
        "summary":  "Bihar’s Big Leap in Education: New Degree Colleges to Open in 8 Districts, 526 New Appointments Approved When dreams get wings, futures change! In a historic move for Bihar’s youth, the state",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eWhen dreams get wings, futures change! In a historic move for Bihar’s youth, the state government has announced the opening of new degree colleges in Bihar, across eight key districts including Madhubani. 🚀\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet’s dive into what this means for Bihar’s educational landscape!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e8 New Degree Colleges to Empower Students\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn Tuesday, under the leadership of Chief Minister Nitish Kumar, a crucial Bihar Cabinet meeting stamped approval on 34 big agendas. Among them, the decision to open new degree colleges in 8 districts is creating waves of excitement.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe chosen districts are:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMadhubani Goraul Shamho Imamganj Adhaura Katoria Asarganj Chakai\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMadhubani\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGoraul\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShamho\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImamganj\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdhaura\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKatoria\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAsarganj\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChakai\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach college will have a dedicated Principal, along with 422 teaching staff and 104 non-teaching staff, bringing the total number of new jobs to 526!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIsn’t that a massive boost for both education and employment in Bihar?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrengthening Local Education Infrastructure\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMoreover, these colleges will not only create job opportunities but also strengthen local academic frameworks.Earlier, during the April 8 cabinet meeting, the state government had already approved over 27,000 new appointments across various departments, proving its strong commitment to Bihar’s development.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis decision today will certainly uplift rural and semi-urban students, helping them access quality higher education close to their hometowns.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClearly, Bihar is setting a new example for other states to follow!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore Airports? Yes, That’s on the Horizon Too!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe same cabinet meeting also discussed the possibility of new airports in:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMadhubani Veerpur Munger Valmikinagar Bhagalpur Saharsa\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMadhubani\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVeerpur\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMunger\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eValmikinagar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBhagalpur\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSaharsa\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Airports Authority of India (AAI) will conduct a detailed feasibility study, with ₹2.43 crore sanctioned for the process.This move could soon bring Bihar even closer to the skies, making it a major growth engine in Eastern India.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEducation and Employment: The Twin Engines of Bihar’s Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe opening of new degree colleges and potential airports signals a holistic development vision.Where education will empower the youth, infrastructure will fuel dreams further.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you are a student, job aspirant, or someone who dreams of seeing Bihar shine — these updates are made for YOU.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd remember, this is just the beginning. Much more is on the way!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 Stay tuned with www.biharsay.com for more such regular updates and become a part of our growing 11K-strong global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
