        "id":  "bsnl-iftv-launch-in-bihar-350-free-channels-for-bharat-fiber-users",
        "title":  "BSNL iFTV Launch in Bihar: 350 Free Channels for Bharat Fiber Users",
        "summary":  "वो भी फ्री में! BSNL brings 350+ TV Channels to Bihar Without a Set-Top Box Yes, you read that right! Now, over 75,000 Bharat Fiber customers in Bihar can stream 350+ live",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eवो भी फ्री में! BSNL brings 350+ TV Channels to Bihar Without a Set-Top Box\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes, you read that right! Now, over 75,000 Bharat Fiber customers in Bihar can stream 350+ live TV channels absolutely free, thanks to BSNL’s newly launched iFTV service. No DTH, no dish, no set-top box — just your broadband connection is enough!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBSNL’s iFTV Service: What Makes It a Game-Changer?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBSNL (Bharat Sanchar Nigam Limited) has officially launched the iFTV (Internet Fiber Television) service in Bihar. It’s an IPTV-based innovation, providing live TV and premium content to BSNL Bharat Fiber (FTTH) users via broadband — without any set-top box.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe announcement took place at Sanchar Sadan, BSNL headquarters, in the virtual presence of CMD A. Robert J. Ravi and Board Director Vivek Banzal. On ground, the launch was led by CGM Ravindra Kumar Choudhary and PGM Shankar Prasad, who highlighted the tech and customer benefits.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s Free \u0026 What’s Paid?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHere’s the big win for BSNL users:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e350+ Free-to-Air Channels – instantly available after activation. 300+ Premium Channels – accessible with a minimal monthly fee.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e350+ Free-to-Air Channels – instantly available after activation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e300+ Premium Channels – accessible with a minimal monthly fee.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis makes the service a full entertainment package. You’re not just saving money; you’re also skipping the hassle of hardware and long installations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow It Works Without a Set-Top Box\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBSNL has built CDN (Content Delivery Network) servers across various locations in Bihar to ensure smooth, buffer-free streaming. The number of servers will also grow with increasing traffic.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs a result, users can stream live TV channels directly using a smart TV and the SkyPro app. It’s smooth, quick, and seamless.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho Gets the Benefit First?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCurrently, BSNL has over 75,000 Bharat Fiber users in Bihar. These users will be notified via calls and connected to the iFTV service first. For new users, this service will be included right from the start.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThat’s right — no extra steps or waiting!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Do You Get at ₹399/Month?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt just ₹399/month, BSNL’s Bharat Fiber customers receive:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1,000 GB of high-speed data at 30 Mbps Unlimited free calling Post-limit speed at 4 Mbps Access to iFTV service with 350+ free channels\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1,000 GB of high-speed data at 30 Mbps\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnlimited free calling\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePost-limit speed at 4 Mbps\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccess to iFTV service with 350+ free channels\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt’s an unbeatable deal for families who want both reliable internet and endless entertainment in one place.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStep-by-Step: How to Activate iFTV\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGetting started is easy. You can register in two ways:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOption 1: Web Registration\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit: https://fms.bsnl.in/iptvreg Click on “Register” Choose: Addon for Bharat Fiber → iFTV Select State: Bihar Service Addon: SkyPro Enter your FTTH number Submit and verify the OTP sent to your registered mobile number\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit: https://fms.bsnl.in/iptvreg\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClick on “Register”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoose: Addon for Bharat Fiber → iFTV\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSelect State: Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eService Addon: SkyPro\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnter your FTTH number\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubmit and verify the OTP sent to your registered mobile number\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOption 2: WhatsApp Activation\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse your Bharat Fiber registered mobile number Send a message to 1800-4444 on WhatsApp Select the iFTV option Follow the registration prompts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse your Bharat Fiber registered mobile number\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSend a message to 1800-4444 on WhatsApp\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSelect the iFTV option\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow the registration prompts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce done, download the SkyPro App on your smart TV, log in with your number and OTP, and enjoy live TV instantly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo cables. No dishes. Just broadband bliss! With BSNL iFTV, Bihar is stepping into the future of home entertainment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔗 Want regular updates like this, straight from the heart of Bihar?👉 Follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 11K+ global community that’s celebrating every bold move Bihar makes!\u003c/p\u003e",
