        "id":  "arwal-farmers-to-receive-digital-smart-ids-under-bihars-new-registry-program",
        "title":  "Arwal Farmers to Receive Digital Smart IDs Under Bihar’s New Registry Program",
        "summary":  "Digital Identity Revolution for Bihar Farmers Begins in Arwal—4,474 to Get Smart IDs! Arwal Farmers Step Into the Digital Age—Smart IDs Now a Reality!In a bold leap toward agricultural empowerment, Arwal district",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eDigital Identity Revolution for Bihar Farmers Begins in Arwal—4,474 to Get Smart IDs!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArwal Farmers Step Into the Digital Age—Smart IDs Now a Reality!In a bold leap toward agricultural empowerment, Arwal district in Bihar has launched a transformative initiative that will redefine the way farmers connect with government schemes. Through a unique pilot project, 4,474 farmers are now set to receive their very own 11-digit digital identification cards—a step that brings precision, accessibility, and dignity to the forefront of rural India.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters: A Direct Gateway to Government Benefits\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor far too long, many farmers in Bihar have struggled to access timely and direct support. This registry process—spearheaded by the Department of Agriculture—is here to change that. By creating individual digital identities, farmers will now receive benefits without the usual delays or middlemen interference.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo make this vision a reality, farmer registration camps have been set up across 10 selected revenue villages. The response? Overwhelming participation, real-time digital processing, and a renewed sense of hope in the farming community.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTech at the Roots: Face Recognition \u0026 e-KYC in Action\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGone are the days of endless paperwork. Farmers now go through face recognition technology and e-KYC verification to confirm their identities. It’s fast, secure, and eliminates duplication or fraud.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s more, Agricultural Coordinators and Revenue Officers have joined hands for this mission. While coordinators handle the e-KYC, revenue officers take care of land verification—also known as “bucketing”—to make sure everything is accurate down to the last detail.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ground Report: Numbers That Speak\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet’s take a quick look at the impressive outreach:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKochahsa: 877 farmers Aiyara: 741 farmers Kaler: 347 farmers Kamta: 351 farmers Khataangi: 288 farmers Dhamoul: 389 farmers Mali: 686 farmers Barah: 261 farmers Sakri: 264 farmers Khabaini: 276 farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKochahsa: 877 farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAiyara: 741 farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKaler: 347 farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKamta: 351 farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKhataangi: 288 farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDhamoul: 389 farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMali: 686 farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBarah: 261 farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSakri: 264 farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKhabaini: 276 farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach of these individuals will soon carry a verified identity that connects them to government benefits instantly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLeadership in Motion: What the Officers Say\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“We’ve issued strict instructions to all senior officers to actively monitor this program,” shared Manish Kumar, the Sub-Divisional Agriculture Officer (अनुमंडल कृषि पदाधिकारी). He further emphasized that no negligence will be tolerated and technical support must be available wherever required.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe process has two stages, and presence in both is mandatory for every farmer. Local advisors are being tasked with ensuring farmers attend the camp without fail. The entire campaign is under district-level surveillance to ensure complete transparency.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy It’s a Game Changer\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEmpowers farmers with verified digital identities Speeds up access to subsidies and scheme benefits Introduces cutting-edge technology at the grassroots level Reduces bureaucratic dependency and corruption Lays the foundation for future agricultural reforms\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEmpowers farmers with verified digital identities\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpeeds up access to subsidies and scheme benefits\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIntroduces cutting-edge technology at the grassroots level\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReduces bureaucratic dependency and corruption\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLays the foundation for future agricultural reforms\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s Next?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis pilot project in Arwal is just the beginning. With success here, more districts in Bihar may soon follow the model. It’s not just about data; it’s about dignity, empowerment, and future-readiness.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 Stay informed. Stay empowered.Follow www.biharsay.com for more such inspiring stories, government updates, and on-ground action.Be a part of our 11k+ strong community worldwide and witness Bihar’s transformation—one story at a time!\u003c/p\u003e",
