        "id":  "bihar-jobs-2025-682-govt-vacancies-announced-apply-now-before-april-21st",
        "title":  "Bihar Jobs 2025: 682 Govt. Vacancies Announced | Apply Now Before April 21st!",
        "summary":  "Bihar Jobs 2025: 680 Government Vacancies Announced! Apply Now Looking for a government job in Bihar? Your chance has arrived! The Bihar Staff Selection Commission (BSSC) has released a notification for 680",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar Jobs 2025: 680 Government Vacancies Announced! Apply Now\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLooking for a government job in Bihar? Your chance has arrived! The Bihar Staff Selection Commission (BSSC) has released a notification for 680 vacancies for the posts of Subordinate Statistical Officer and Block Statistical Officer. If you’re eligible, apply before April 21, 2025, through the official website bssc.bihar.gov.in.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho Can Apply?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA total of 680 vacancies have been announced, categorized as follows:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGeneral Category: 313 posts Scheduled Caste (SC): 98 posts Scheduled Tribe (ST): 7 posts Backward Classes (BC): 112 posts Economically Weaker Section (EWS): 68 posts Other Backward Classes (OBC): 62 posts Women from Backward Classes: 22 posts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake sure you check your eligibility and submit your application before the deadline!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecial Hiring Drive at Digha ITI on April 2nd\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApart from government jobs, a private company has also released job notifications. MRF, a leading company, is hiring for its Chennai and Hyderabad plants with over 2,000 job openings. A special recruitment drive is being conducted at Digha ITI on April 2nd, where candidates with 5th, 10th, or 12th-grade qualifications, along with ITI graduates, can apply. Selected candidates under the apprenticeship scheme will receive a stipend of ₹17,500 per month.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEmployment Camp at Joint Labor Building on April 3rd\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Labor Resource Department of Patna is organizing a job fair at the Joint Labor Building in Nawada on April 3rd. The recruitment is for 50 positions under HRBS India Private Limited, Ghaziabad, for the roles of Helper and Operator.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEligibility Criteria:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMinimum qualification: 10th, 12th, ITI, or Diploma Age: 18 to 40 years Required Documents: Academic certificates, ID proof, colored passport-size photos, and a resume\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMega Job Camp on April 2nd – 200 Vacancies!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Mega Job Camp is scheduled at the Joint Labor Building on April 2nd for 200 positions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho Can Apply?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMinimum qualification: 12th pass Age limit: 18 to 29 years Perks: Salary, free accommodation, incentives, and fuel allowance Requirement: Own two-wheeler and a valid driver’s license\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy You Should Apply Now\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith multiple job opportunities, both in government and private sectors, this is the right time to secure your future. Don’t wait for the last date! Apply today and take the next step in your career.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor regular job updates, visit www.biharsay.com and join our growing community of 10K+ job seekers!\u003c/p\u003e",
