        "id":  "bihar-farmers-daughter-tops-state-with-96-8-in-science-a-story-of-hard-work-success",
        "title":  "Bihar Farmer’s Daughter Tops State With 96.8% in Science – A Story of Hard Work \u0026 Success!",
        "summary":  "From Fields to Fame: Bihar Farmer’s Daughter Becomes State Topper With 96.8%! Living the Dream: Priya Jaiswal’s Remarkable Journey to the Top! Imagine going from a small village to becoming Bihar’s top",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eFrom Fields to Fame: Bihar Farmer’s Daughter Becomes State Topper With 96.8%!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLiving the Dream: Priya Jaiswal’s Remarkable Journey to the Top!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine going from a small village to becoming Bihar’s top scorer! That’s exactly what 17-year-old Priya Jaiswal has done. A farmer’s daughter from Harnatad, West Champaran, Priya has made history by topping the Bihar Board Intermediate Examination across all streams with an outstanding 96.8% in Science.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHer story is not just about marks but about resilience, hard work, and an unwavering dream. Moreover, it is a testament to how determination can change lives!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Family’s Struggles, A Daughter’s Triumph\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePriya’s parents, Santosh Jaiswal, a farmer, and Reema Devi, a homemaker, never had the chance to complete their education. Yet, they made sure their daughters received every opportunity to study. Despite financial hardships, they prioritized education, proving that determination can overcome any obstacle. As a result, Priya and her sister were able to chase their academic dreams.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHer elder sister, Preeti Jaiswal, who ranked 4th in Bihar in 2023, played a crucial role in Priya’s success. “Didi was the one who prepared me for the exam. She used to teach me all day,” Priya shared with Hindustan. Not only did she guide her, but she also motivated her to aim higher.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHard Work and Dedication: The Formula for Success\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePriya’s journey to the top wasn’t easy. In fact, she balanced online and offline studies, ensuring she grasped every concept thoroughly. Her relentless efforts paid off when she scored a perfect 100 in Chemistry! Furthermore, she consistently stayed focused on her goal, never letting distractions slow her down.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHer achievement proves that education is the ultimate equalizer, turning dreams into reality regardless of background. Additionally, it reinforces the power of persistence in achieving excellence.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDreams Beyond Academics: The Road Ahead\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePriya isn’t stopping here. Her next goal? Becoming a doctor. But that’s not all—she also dreams of becoming an IAS officer to serve the nation. Given her dedication, nothing seems impossible for her.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAbove all, her story is an inspiration for millions of students who aspire to break barriers and achieve greatness. It serves as a reminder that hard work, combined with the right support, can lead to extraordinary success.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant to stay updated with more such inspiring stories? Follow www.biharsay.com and be part of our 10K-strong global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
