        "id":  "patna-gears-up-for-a-grand-7-day-book-festival-on-bihar-diwas-2025",
        "title":  "Patna Gears Up for a Grand 7-Day Book Festival on Bihar Diwas 2025!",
        "summary":  "Patna is all set to host an extraordinary literary celebration! The Patna Book Festival 2025 will take over Gandhi Maidan from March 21 to 27, bringing together book lovers, authors, and cultural",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003ePatna is all set to host an extraordinary literary celebration! The Patna Book Festival 2025 will take over Gandhi Maidan from March 21 to 27, bringing together book lovers, authors, and cultural enthusiasts. Organized by the National Book Trust (NBT), this seven-day event promises an enriching experience filled with books, art, and entertainment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Literary Extravaganza with 300+ Book Stalls!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine walking through rows of over 300 book stalls, each offering a diverse collection of books across multiple genres and languages. Moreover, from bestsellers to rare literary gems, every book lover will find something to cherish. Leading publishers, including NBT, will showcase their finest works, making this festival a paradise for readers of all ages.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecial Attractions for Kids – A Wonderland of Creativity!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChildren have a lot to look forward to at the Children’s Corner! Not only will there be fun activities, but also engaging sessions, such as:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePuppetry Shows to spark their imagination Story \u0026 Poetry Recitals to nurture creativity Interactive Workshops for hands-on learning Theatre Performances that bring stories to life Madhubani Painting Workshop to explore Bihar’s traditional art Bihar Diwas Art Contest to encourage young talents\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese creative sessions will inspire young minds and immerse them in the magic of storytelling and art. Furthermore, they will provide an opportunity for children to express themselves in a vibrant environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e‘Nalanda Samvad’ – A Thought-Provoking Discussion!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn March 22, the festival will feature ‘Nalanda Samvad’, an exclusive interactive session where intellectuals will share their thoughts on literature, films, and cultural evolution. Notably, esteemed film critic Vinod Anupam will be one of the key speakers, making this an unmissable event for knowledge seekers. Additionally, the audience will have a chance to engage in meaningful discussions and exchange ideas with experts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEntertainment Galore – From Cultural Performances to Comedy!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeyond books, visitors can also enjoy soulful cultural performances by renowned artists. In addition to these mesmerizing acts, the festival will feature an exciting comedy act by the famous Shambhu Shikhar, adding a perfect dose of laughter to the literary celebrations. Thus, attendees can expect an all-encompassing experience that blends knowledge with entertainment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFestival Timings \u0026 Entry Details\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDates: March 21 to 27, 2025 Timings: 11 AM to 8 PM Venue: Gandhi Maidan, Patna Entry: Absolutely FREE!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e✨ Don’t miss out on this grand celebration of books, art, and culture! For more updates, visit www.biharsay.com and join our 10K+ global community today!\u003c/p\u003e",
