        "id":  "bihar-matric-scholarship-date-extended-new-deadline-application-process-2025",
        "title":  "Bihar Matric Scholarship Date Extended | New Deadline \u0026 Application Process 2025",
        "summary":  "Bihar Matric Scholarship Date Extended: Check the New Deadline! Education is the key to a brighter future, and Bihar’s government is ensuring that no student is left behind due to financial barriers.",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eEducation is the key to a brighter future, and Bihar’s government is ensuring that no student is left behind due to financial barriers. The deadline for the Post Matric Scholarship application has been extended, giving SC, ST, BC, and EBC students more time to apply and secure their future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScholarship Deadline Extended – What You Need to Know\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bihar Education Department has officially extended the last date for the Post Matric Scholarship application. Initially, students could apply from January 7, 2025, to March 10, 2025. However, to ensure maximum participation, the government has now extended the deadline to May 10, 2025.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis extension provides a great opportunity for students who missed the initial deadline. If you belong to Scheduled Caste (SC), Scheduled Tribe (ST), Backward Class (BC), or Extremely Backward Class (EBC), you can still apply online and avail the benefits of this scholarship.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhere to Apply?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSC/ST students can apply at scstpmsonline.bihar.gov.in BC/EBC students can apply at pmsonlinebihar.gov.in\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnsure you complete your application before May 10, 2025, to avoid missing out on this valuable financial support.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho is Eligible for the Scholarship?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo apply for Bihar’s Post Matric Scholarship, you must meet the following criteria: ✔ Must have passed the 10th grade (Matric) from a recognized institution ✔ Should be enrolled in an Intermediate (+2), Graduate, Postgraduate, Diploma, or Vocational course ✔ Belong to SC, ST, BC, or EBC category ✔ Possess a valid caste certificate ✔ Be studying in a recognized government or private institution in Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you fit the eligibility criteria, don’t wait—apply today and secure your educational future!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy is This Scholarship Important?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEducation should never be compromised due to financial struggles. The Bihar government launched this initiative to empower students from underprivileged backgrounds, ensuring they have access to higher education without monetary concerns.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis scholarship covers tuition fees, study materials, and other academic expenses, making it easier for students to focus on their studies rather than financial hardships.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAct Now: Don’t Miss This Chance!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThousands of students have already applied for the Bihar Post Matric Scholarship—have you? If not, this extended deadline is your golden opportunity. Visit the official portals and apply before May 10, 2025.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more real-time Bihar updates, educational news, and scholarship alerts, stay tuned to www.biharsay.com. Join our 10k+ community worldwide and never miss an important update!\u003c/p\u003e",
