        "id":  "bihar-jobs-2025-2-lakh-new-government-jobs-coming-40000-in-health-sector-are-you-ready",
        "title":  "Bihar Jobs 2025: 2 Lakh New Government Jobs Coming! 40,000 in Health Sector – Are You Ready?",
        "summary":  "Bihar Jobs 2025: Golden Opportunity for Job Seekers! Are you searching for a stable government job in Bihar? Here’s the big news! The Bihar government has announced 2 lakh new job openings",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eAre you searching for a stable government job in Bihar? Here’s the big news! The Bihar government has announced 2 lakh new job openings in 2025, with 40,000 vacancies in the health sector. If you’re a job seeker, this is your chance to secure a rewarding career.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 Lakh Jobs in 5 Years – The Government’s Big Push\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn the last five years, the Bihar government has created over 10 lakh jobs across various sectors. Now, the goal is to add 2 lakh more jobs by the end of 2025, bringing incredible opportunities for young professionals.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e40,000 Vacancies in Bihar Health Department\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHealth Minister Mangal Pandey revealed in the Legislative Council that recruitment has started for:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e17,000 nurses 3,623 specialist medical officers 667 general medical officers 808 dental surgeons\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe government has already sent recruitment proposals to the Bihar Technical Service Commission (BTSC), and advertisements are being published for various positions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBig Boost with Ayushman Bharat and Health Schemes\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar’s health sector is seeing massive investments:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1.55 crore families have received Ayushman Bharat health cards. Over ₹200 crore has been allocated to help patients with serious illnesses.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat This Means for Job Seekers?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re preparing for government exams, now is the time to gear up! With thousands of vacancies in healthcare, administration, and other departments, Bihar is opening doors for youth employment and economic growth.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with www.biharsay.com for regular job alerts, and join our 10K+ strong community worldwide!\u003c/p\u003e",
