        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar Say is rebranding Bihar-and the numbers proved it again – last 90 days, our website has witnessed a massive surge in visibility, engagement, and audience interaction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Big Picture: Search Traffic Boom 🚀 👉 With 230K total impressions, a 668.9% increase, our content is not just being seen—it’s making an impact. This sharp rise means more people are discovering Bihar’s untold stories, insightful business updates, and cultural narratives like never before.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 And what about actual engagement? Clicks have jumped 249.5% to 3.3K, indicating that readers aren’t just scrolling past—they’re clicking, exploring, and consuming content that resonates.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho’s Coming, and From Where? 👉 Over 16,000 unique visitors landed on Bihar Say through search alone, growing by a whopping 120.6%. And if you’re wondering where all this traffic is coming from, here’s a quick breakdown:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🗣️ 67.6% from Organic Search – People are actively searching for topics we cover, proving our content’s growing relevance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👥14.1% from Referral Traffic – Other platforms and websites are sending readers our way.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👤 11.9% from Direct Traffic – A loyal audience is directly typing in biharsay.com to read our content.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🫂 6.1% from Social Media – While still growing, our social presence is making a mark!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow Long Are People Staying? 👉 It’s not just about numbers; it’s about engagement. Readers spend an average of 1.12 to 1.5 minutes per visit, meaning they’re taking the time to read, absorb, and connect with the stories we bring.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s Next? 🤝 With these promising numbers, we are doubling down on engaging storytelling, deep-dive features, and insightful business coverage. Whether you’re a startup founder, an entrepreneur or changemaker , or just someone passionate about Bihar’s growth, Bihar Say is where you’ll find the pulse of change.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKeep reading, keep engaging, and let’s rebrand Bihar together!\u003c/p\u003e",
