        "id":  "pm-modis-global-push-for-bihars-rich-culture",
        "title":  "PM Modi’s Global Push for Bihar’s Rich Culture",
        "summary":  "PM Modi’s Global Push for Bihar’s Rich Culture Bihar’s heritage is gaining international recognition, and Prime Minister Narendra Modi is leading the way. PM Modi’s Visit to Mauritius: Strengthening Cultural Ties On",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar’s heritage is gaining international recognition, and Prime Minister Narendra Modi is leading the way.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePM Modi’s Visit to Mauritius: Strengthening Cultural Ties\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn March 11-12, 2025, Prime Minister Narendra Modi visited Mauritius, where 70% of the population traces its roots to India, especially Bihar. His role as Chief Guest at Mauritius’s National Day celebrations underscores the deep historical and cultural bond between the two nations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDuring his visit, he engaged with Bihari-origin communities and reinforced India’s commitment to preserving Bihar’s cultural identity on a global stage.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Grand Traditional Welcome in Mauritius\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMauritius honored PM Modi with a ‘Geet Gawai’ performance, a traditional Bihari folk art recognized by UNESCO. This warm welcome highlighted the strong emotional and cultural connection between Bihar and its diaspora.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePromoting Bihar’s Art \u0026 Heritage Worldwide\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePM Modi consistently showcases Bihar’s artistic heritage, especially Madhubani paintings, as diplomatic gifts. This initiative boosts Bihar’s global recognition and helps local artisans expand their reach.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMajor Development Projects for Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeyond cultural promotion, PM Modi announced ₹12,100 crore worth of development projects in Bihar. These projects focus on health, railways, roads, and natural gas, aiming to accelerate the state’s progress.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePM Modi’s commitment to Bihar’s global identity is a strategic effort to integrate its rich heritage into India’s diplomatic and economic future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔗 Stay updated on Bihar’s global journey. Visit www.biharsay.com and join our 10K+ worldwide community!\u003c/p\u003e",
