        "id":  "experience-the-vibrant-celebration-of-bihar-diwas-2025-in-new-york-city",
        "title":  "Experience the Vibrant Celebration of Bihar Diwas 2025 in New York City",
        "summary":  "Bihar Diwas 2025: A Grand Celebration in New York Awaits! Bihar’s rich culture is making its way to New York City! Get ready to experience an evening full of heritage, music, and",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar’s rich culture is making its way to New York City! Get ready to experience an evening full of heritage, music, and community spirit on Saturday, March 22, 2025. This exciting event, organized by Bihar Foundation of USA ETZ in partnership with Bihar Jharkhand Association of North America (BJANA) and the Consulate General of India, New York, promises an unforgettable celebration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re from Bihar or simply love its vibrant traditions, this is an event you don’t want to miss!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImmerse Yourself in Bihar’s Culture\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar’s traditions are deeply rooted in art, music, and history. At Bihar Diwas 2025, you will experience:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTraditional Music \u0026 Dance: Enjoy performances featuring Bhojpuri, Maithili, and classical music that showcase Bihar’s artistic brilliance. Madhubani Art Exhibition: Admire the intricate beauty of Mithila paintings, curated by the renowned Nupur Nishith of Creative Mithila. This is a rare opportunity to witness one of Bihar’s most treasured art forms up close. Authentic Bihari Cuisine: Taste litti chokha, thekua, and sattu drinks, bringing the flavors of Bihar straight to New York.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis celebration is more than just entertainment—it’s a tribute to Bihar’s timeless heritage and artistic legacy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Powerful Networking Opportunity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeyond cultural festivities, Bihar Diwas serves as a hub for networking and meaningful discussions. Whether you’re an entrepreneur, student, or professional, this event offers:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpportunities to connect with like-minded individuals in the Bihar diaspora. Discussions on Bihar’s economic and social growth, fostering innovative ideas. Recognition of distinguished community members, inspiring future leaders.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt’s a chance to celebrate our roots, achievements, and shared aspirations in a setting that brings Bihar closer to home.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvent Details \u0026 RSVP\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDate \u0026 Time: Saturday, March 22, 2025 | 5:00 PM – 8:00 PMVenue: Consulate General of India – New York, 3 East 64th Street, NY 10065RSVP: Secure your spot by emailing admin@biharfoundationamerica.org\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake sure to register early and be part of this incredible evening.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the Global Bihar Community\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar’s spirit thrives across the world, and you can be part of it too. Stay updated on events, inspiring stories, and community initiatives by joining our 10,000+ global members.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit BiharSay.com now to stay connected and celebrate Bihar’s legacy—wherever you are.\u003c/p\u003e",
