        "id":  "pmch-100-year-celebration-president-murmu-leads-grand-centenary-event-in-patna",
        "title":  "PMCH 100-Year Celebration: President Murmu Leads Grand Centenary Event in Patna",
        "summary":  "PMCH Turns 100: A Historic Milestone in Bihar’s Medical Legacy A Grand Celebration with President Droupadi Murmu Patna Medical College and Hospital (PMCH) celebrated its centenary with a grand event. Honorable President",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eA Grand Celebration with President Droupadi Murmu\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePatna Medical College and Hospital (PMCH) celebrated its centenary with a grand event. Honorable President Droupadi Murmu, Bihar Governor Arif Mohammad Khan, Union Health Minister JP Nadda, Bihar Chief Minister Nitish Kumar, and Bihar Health Minister Mangal Pandey attended the occasion. This event marked a significant achievement for Bihar’s healthcare sector, as PMCH now stands as the second-largest hospital in the world in terms of bed capacity, offering 5,000 beds.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePMCH’s Illustrious Legacy and Contributions\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEstablished in 1925, PMCH has consistently shaped India’s medical landscape by producing top-tier doctors and advancing healthcare. This 100-year celebration honored the dedication, hard work, and contributions of countless medical professionals who have served here.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKey Highlights from the Centenary Event\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePresident Droupadi Murmu’s Address: She emphasized PMCH’s vital role in shaping India’s healthcare sector and urged young doctors to uphold ethical medical practices. Felicitation of Eminent Doctors: The event recognized senior doctors and alumni for their exceptional contributions to medicine. Medical Exhibition: A showcase of PMCH’s journey included rare photographs, medical advancements, and groundbreaking research. Cultural and Academic Programs: Various performances and discussions celebrated Bihar’s rich medical heritage while focusing on the future of healthcare. Expansion Plans Announced: Chief Minister Nitish Kumar revealed that 14 hospitals are under construction, and the government aims to build hospitals in every district in the near future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePresident Murmu’s Call to Action\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePresident Droupadi Murmu praised PMCH for its commitment to medical education and healthcare. She encouraged young professionals to contribute to the nation’s well-being by maintaining high ethical standards in medicine.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePMCH’s Future: Transforming Bihar’s Healthcare\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith significant expansion plans, PMCH is set to enhance its infrastructure, integrate cutting-edge medical technologies, and strengthen its research capabilities. The government has committed to providing continued support to elevate the institution’s national and global standing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePMCH’s centenary celebration not only honored its past but also laid the foundation for a transformative future in healthcare.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e📢 Stay updated with the latest news from Bihar! Visit www.biharsay.com and become part of our 10K+ global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
