        "id":  "bihars-project-teacher-sathi-digitizes-government-schools-with-free-websites",
        "title":  "Bihar’s ‘Project Teacher Sathi’ Digitizes Government Schools with Free Websites",
        "summary":  "Revolutionizing Education: Bihar’s ‘Project Teacher Sathi’ Empowers Government Schools with Free Digital Websites In a groundbreaking move to digitize education, Bihar’s professional learning community, Teachers of Bihar, has launched ‘Project Teacher Sathi’.",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eRevolutionizing Education: Bihar’s ‘Project Teacher Sathi’ Empowers Government Schools with Free Digital Websites\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a groundbreaking move to digitize education, Bihar’s professional learning community, Teachers of Bihar, has launched ‘Project Teacher Sathi’. This initiative aims to provide every government school in the state with a free digital website, enhancing transparency and accessibility for students and parents alike.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEmpowering Schools Through Digital Platforms\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnder ‘Project Teacher Sathi’, each government school will receive a dedicated website. These platforms will display:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSchool Information: Offering insights into school history and infrastructure. Curriculum Details: Providing comprehensive overviews of courses and syllabi. Activity Updates: Highlighting extracurricular events and achievements. Educational Resources: Sharing study materials and learning aids.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis digital transformation aims to bridge the communication gap between schools, students, and parents, fostering a more connected educational environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInnovations Enhancing Educational Management\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeyond individual school websites, the project introduces the Pradhan Mantri Poshan Yojana Calculator Portal. This tool assists schools in accurately managing data related to the mid-day meal scheme, ensuring efficient resource allocation and transparency.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilding Digital Proficiency Among Educators\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRecognizing the importance of tech-savvy educators, ‘Project Teacher Sathi’ offers online training programs named ‘Drona’. These sessions aim to:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquip teachers with digital skills. Enhance the integration of technology in classrooms. Promote innovative teaching methodologies.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach district will have a dedicated technical team of government school teachers to support the development and maintenance of these websites, ensuring sustainability and continuous improvement.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the Digital Education Movement\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay informed about such transformative initiatives and become part of a global community of over 10,000 members. Follow BiharSay for regular updates and insights into Bihar’s evolving educational landscape.\u003c/p\u003e",
