        "id":  "dream-big-study-free-bihar-board-launches-free-iit-jee-neet-coaching",
        "title":  "Unlock Your IIT-JEE and NEET Dreams with Bihar Board’s Free Coaching Initiative!",
        "summary":  "Bihar Board’s Free IIT-JEE \u0026 NEET Coaching: New Session Applications Open Are you dreaming of cracking IIT-JEE or NEET but worried about expensive coaching fees? Bihar Board’s free coaching program has already",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eAre you dreaming of cracking IIT-JEE or NEET but worried about expensive coaching fees? Bihar Board’s free coaching program has already helped many students achieve their goals, and now it’s time for you to grab this golden opportunity. Applications for the 2025-2027 batch are now open. Don’t miss your chance to study under the guidance of India’s top educators—completely free.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOutstanding Results from the Previous Batch\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe last session was a huge success, proving that Bihar’s students have the talent and potential to excel at the highest level.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4 students scored above 99 percentile with scores of 99.20, 99.18, 99.1, and 99.0. 23 students secured more than 95 percentile. 61 students surpassed last year’s cutoff based on category-wise percentile.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith the right guidance and support, Bihar’s students can achieve even greater heights.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNew Session (2025-2027) – Application Details\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApplications are now open for the next batch. If you are serious about cracking IIT-JEE or NEET, this is your chance to get free, high-quality coaching.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApplication Start Date: 22 February 2025 Application Deadline: 12 March 2025 Coaching Centers: 9 Districts – Patna, Muzaffarpur, Chhapra, Darbhanga, Saharsa, Purnia, Bhagalpur, Gaya, and Munger Fully Residential Coaching: Students will get free accommodation, food, study materials, and expert mentorship.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow to Apply for Bihar Board’s Free Coaching\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the Official Website – https://coaching.biharboardonline.com Fill in the Application Form with your personal details. Upload Required Documents (Class 10 admit card, domicile certificate, ID proof). Submit Your Application before the deadline. Download Your Admit Card on the scheduled date. Appear for the Entrance Test and secure your place in this prestigious program.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Choose This Free Coaching\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTop Faculty: Renowned teachers from across India will guide students. Free Education \u0026 Accommodation: No cost for coaching, food, or stay. Proven Success Rate: More than 60 students cleared previous cutoffs. Focused Training: Special preparation for IIT-JEE \u0026 NEET exams.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the 10K+ BiharSay Community for More Updates\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDon’t miss this life-changing opportunity. Apply now and start your journey towards IIT \u0026 AIIMS success.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow www.biharsay.com for regular updates and become part of our 10K+ global student community.\u003c/p\u003e",
