        "id":  "cyber-crime-in-bihar-stay-safe-with-these-must-know-tips",
        "title":  "Cybercrime in Bihar: Are You the Next Target? Stay Alert \u0026 Stay Safe!",
        "summary":  "Cybercrime in Bihar: Are You the Next Target? Stay Alert \u0026 Stay Safe! The digital world is a double-edged sword. While technology brings convenience, it also opens doors to cyber threats. Every",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eThe digital world is a double-edged sword. While technology brings convenience, it also opens doors to cyber threats. Every day, countless people in Bihar fall prey to cybercrime. So, are you prepared to protect yourself?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Rising Threat of Cybercrime in Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCyber fraud, phishing scams, and identity theft are increasing at an alarming rate. In fact, criminals are finding new ways to deceive innocent users. From fake job offers to UPI fraud, no one is safe unless they stay informed. Therefore, awareness is the first step toward protection.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCommon Cyber Crimes You Need to Know\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1. Online Banking Frauds\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCybercriminals use fake calls and phishing links to steal banking details. Consequently, never share OTPs or passwords.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2. Social Media Scams\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHackers access accounts and demand ransom. Thus, always enable two-factor authentication.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3. Fake Shopping Websites\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFraudsters create fake e-commerce sites to trap buyers. Hence, always check for HTTPS and reviews before purchasing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4. Job Scams\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMany job seekers fall for fake employment opportunities. As a result, verify companies before making any payments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e5. Lottery and Gift Frauds\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you get a message about winning a lottery you never entered, it’s a scam. So, ignore and report it immediately.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow to Protect Yourself?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse Strong Passwords – A mix of letters, numbers, and symbols makes accounts safer. Verify Sources – Don’t click on unknown links or download files from untrusted sources. Update Software – Regular updates fix security vulnerabilities. Thus, keeping your system updated is crucial. Educate Your Family – Teach them about cyber threats to prevent future scams. After all, awareness can save them from fraud.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhere to Report Cyber Crimes?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you become a victim, act fast. You can report cyber fraud at:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Cyber Crime Portal: https://biharpolice.bih.nic.in National Cyber Crime Portal: https://cybercrime.gov.in Cyber Helpline: Dial 1930 for immediate help\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo sum up, staying aware can make a huge difference. So, for more updates on cyber security and safety tips, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our growing 10K+ global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
