        "id":  "nine-bihar-officials-awarded-presidents-medal-for-distinguished-service",
        "title":  "Nine Bihar Officials Awarded President’s Medal for Distinguished Service",
        "summary":  "Bihar’s Exceptional Talent Honored with the President’s Medal Patna: Bihar shines as the state celebrates the honor of Kassey Suhita Anupam (IPS), Special Secretary of the Home Department, and Anil Kumar, Deputy",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar’s Exceptional Talent Honored with the President’s Medal\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePatna: Bihar shines as the state celebrates the honor of Kassey Suhita Anupam (IPS), Special Secretary of the Home Department, and Anil Kumar, Deputy Superintendent of Police in Patna. They received the prestigious President’s Medal for Distinguished Services (PSM) just before Republic Day. This award recognizes individuals for their exceptional service over a long period.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAwardees Recognized for Meritorious Service\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeven other officials, including police officers and members of fire services, Home Guard \u0026 Civil Defence (HG\u0026CD), and correctional services, also received the President’s Medal for Meritorious Service (MSM). This prestigious award highlights their dedication to service, but this year, no one was selected for the Medal for Gallantry (MG).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNotable Awardees\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmong the awardees for MSM were Superintendents of Police Sanjay Kumar and Manoj Kumar. Commandant Hari Mohan Shukla, Sub-inspectors Sanjit Kumar, Shashikant, and Jai Prakash, and Assistant Sub-Inspector Atimesh Kumar Upadhyay also earned the recognition. Their efforts have significantly strengthened Bihar’s security system.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCivilian Heroes Recognized\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Sarvottam Jeevan Raksha Padak was posthumously awarded to Pintu Kumar Sahni for saving lives. Vikash Yadav earned the Jeevan Raksha Padak for his heroic act in a life-saving rescue. These civilians showed immense bravery in protecting lives.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe President’s Medal for Distinguished Service (PSM)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe PSM is the highest award for police officers. It honors individuals who have completed 25 years or more of service in the police or security organizations. This year, Kassey Suhita Anupam and Anil Kumar received the PSM for their outstanding leadership and contributions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Day of Pride for Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs India celebrates Republic Day, Bihar joins in to honor these remarkable individuals. Their commitment to serving the state and its people sets an inspiring example for future generations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with more such stories and join our 10k-strong community at www.biharsay.com for regular updates!\u003c/p\u003e",
        "category":  "Education \u0026 Social",
        "categorySlug":  "education-social",
        "publishedDate":  "2025-01-27",
        "readingTimeMinutes":  2,
        "imageUrl":  "https://biharsay.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Bihar-Say-Website-48.png",
