        "id":  "padma-awards-2025-full-list-of-padma-vibhushan-bhushan-and-shri-recipients-indias-76th-republic-day",
        "title":  "Padma Awards 2025: Full List of Padma Vibhushan, Bhushan, and Shri Recipients | India’s 76th Republic Day",
        "summary":  "India’s 76th Republic Day: Full List of Padma Vibhushan, Padma Bhushan, and Padma Shri Awardees for 2025 On the glorious occasion of India’s 76th Republic Day, we honor individuals who have significantly",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eIndia’s 76th Republic Day: Full List of Padma Vibhushan, Padma Bhushan, and Padma Shri Awardees for 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn the glorious occasion of India’s 76th Republic Day, we honor individuals who have significantly impacted society. The prestigious Padma Awards 2025—announced annually on the eve of Republic Day—shine a spotlight on exceptional achievements across diverse fields, celebrating dedication, innovation, and service.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePresident Droupadi Murmu conferred 139 Padma Awards this year, including 7 Padma Vibhushan, 19 Padma Bhushan, and 113 Padma Shri awards. These accolades reflect the nation’s gratitude toward trailblazers in arts, medicine, public affairs, science, and more.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet’s dive into the complete list of 2025 awardees and their remarkable contributions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePadma Vibhushan Awardees 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Padma Vibhushan is the highest honor, awarded for exceptional and distinguished service in any field. It is presented to individuals whose contributions have significantly influenced national and international progress. Padma Vibhushan awardees often include luminaries in fields like arts, medicine, education, public affairs, and science. This prestigious award reflects unparalleled excellence in one’s chosen domain.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePadma Bhushan Awardees 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Padma Bhushan is awarded for distinguished service of a higher order. While still an elite honor, it recognizes substantial contributions in various fields, including public affairs, arts, sports, and science. The Padma Bhushan serves as a symbol of national pride, celebrating individuals who have displayed extraordinary commitment to their work and have made a lasting impact on society.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePadma Shri Awardees 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Padma Shri is awarded for distinguished service in any field, honoring individuals who have made significant contributions to society. This award recognizes a wide spectrum of achievements, including arts, sports, medicine, literature, public affairs, and social work. It celebrates those who have demonstrated dedication to the betterment of the nation and its citizens.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpotlight: Women, NRI, and Posthumous Honorees\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis year, 23 women, 10 NRIs, and 13 posthumous recipients earned Padma Awards, reflecting diversity and global recognition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar’s Padma Awardees 2025: Celebrating Exceptional Contributions\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn 2025, Bihar’s rich cultural and intellectual heritage shines through with several prestigious Padma Awards. Here’s a look at the distinguished individuals from Bihar who have been honored this year:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePadma Vibhushan (2025)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSharda Sinha (Posthumous) – Art: Known as the “Nightingale of Bihar,” Sharda Sinha made immense contributions to Bihari folk music and is widely regarded as an icon of the region’s cultural landscape.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePadma Bhushan (2025)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSushil Kumar Modi (Posthumous) – Public Affairs: A key figure in Bihar’s political scene, Sushil Kumar Modi was instrumental in shaping the state’s economic policies and governance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePadma Shri (2025)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBhim Singh Bhavesh – Social Work: An influential figure in community welfare, Bhavesh’s tireless efforts in rural education and social development earned him recognition at the national level. Kishore Kunal (Posthumous) – Civil Service: An esteemed officer in the Indian Administrative Service, Kishore Kunal’s leadership in the Bihar Police and his contribution to maintaining law and order in the state are unforgettable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Padma Awards Matter\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndia’s Padma Awards inspire millions. From legendary artists like Kumudini Lakhia to healthcare pioneers such as Duvvur Nageshwar Reddy, these honors encourage the nation to aim higher.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRead the Full List\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the complete list, visit www.biharsay.com and join a growing community of 10,000+ readers who stay informed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow @biharsay for real-time updates, inspiring stories, and more!\u003c/p\u003e",
