        "title":  "Bihar D.El.Ed. Entrance Exam 2025 – Last Day to Register",
        "summary":  "Are you ready to take the next big step in your teaching career? The Bihar D.El.Ed. entrance exam 2025 registration closes today, January 27. Don’t miss this final opportunity to secure your",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eAre you ready to take the next big step in your teaching career? The Bihar D.El.Ed. entrance exam 2025 registration closes today, January 27. Don’t miss this final opportunity to secure your spot in the state’s prestigious Diploma in Elementary Education program.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho Can Apply?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEligibility is straightforward and inclusive:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCandidates must have scored 50% or more marks in their Class 12 final examination. If you’re appearing for the Class 12 exam this year, you’re also eligible to apply. Age criteria: You must be 17 years or older as of January 1, 2025.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKey Dates to Remember\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApplication Deadline: Today, January 27, 2025. Fee Payment Deadline: January 28, 2025.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow to Apply in Simple Steps\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the official website: deledbihar.com. Click on the registration link available on the home page. Fill out the required information and submit. Log in to your account to complete the form. Upload the necessary documents. Review all details carefully. Pay the application fee. Download the confirmation page for future reference.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExam Overview\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe entrance exam is designed to test your teaching aptitude with a total of 120 questions across these subjects:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGeneral Hindi or Urdu Mathematics Science Social Studies General English Logical and Analytical Reasoning\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach question carries one mark, making the total exam worth 120 marks. You’ll have 2.5 hours (150 minutes) to complete the test.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Act Now?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe application process, which began on January 11, had an initial deadline of January 22 but was extended to give aspiring teachers one last chance. With limited time left, this is your moment to shine!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDon’t Wait – Register Now!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit deledbihar.com to complete your registration today.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with the latest education news and become part of a thriving global community of 10,000+ aspirants by following www.biharsay.com.\u003c/p\u003e",
