        "id":  "chandan-kumar-pride-of-bakhri-and-bihars-atomic-energy-success",
        "title":  "Begusarai’s Chandan shines as an Assistant Scientist in India’s Atomic Energy Department!",
        "summary":  "Bakhri, a block in Bihar’s Begusarai district, now shines brighter, thanks to Chandan Kumar’s incredible achievement. Hailing from the small village of Jaylakh Seemana Shakarpura, Chandan has become an Assistant Scientific Officer",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBakhri, a block in Bihar’s Begusarai district, now shines brighter, thanks to Chandan Kumar’s incredible achievement. Hailing from the small village of Jaylakh Seemana Shakarpura, Chandan has become an Assistant Scientific Officer in India’s prestigious Department of Atomic Energy. His success is a proud moment for his family, village, and the entire region, proving that dedication and hard work lead to extraordinary outcomes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChandan comes from a humble background. His father, Vishwanath Prasad, is a government school teacher, and his mother, Mamta Kumari, is a homemaker. He began his education at the Government Middle School in Jaylakh Seemana under his father’s guidance. Later, he pursued Mechanical Engineering at Naveen Government Polytechnic, Patna.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn 2023, Chandan cleared the national-level exam for the Department of Atomic Energy. Among the 19 reserved OBC category seats, he secured his place with determination. Additionally, he passed the written exam for the Bhabha Atomic Research Centre in 2024. However, after being selected for NPCIL (Nuclear Power Corporation of India Limited), he chose to focus solely on this prestigious opportunity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Testament to Support and Perseverance\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChandan credits his parents, teachers, and well-wishers for his success. He emphasizes the importance of setting clear goals and working relentlessly to achieve them. “Obstacles will always come, but don’t let them deter you. Honest efforts lead to success, especially when your goal is to serve the nation,” Chandan says.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Celebration of Pride in Bakhri\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChandan’s accomplishment has brought immense joy and pride to his family and the community in Bakhri. His story is a source of inspiration for the youth in the region, showing them that talent, combined with hard work, can lead to exceptional achievements.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more such inspiring stories, visit www.biharsay.com and join our growing community of 10,000 readers worldwide!\u003c/p\u003e",
        "category":  "Education \u0026 Social",
        "categorySlug":  "education-social",
        "publishedDate":  "2025-01-16",
        "readingTimeMinutes":  2,
        "imageUrl":  "https://biharsay.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Bihar-Say-Website-29.png",
