        "id":  "madhubani-airport-to-open-soon-fulhar-to-be-a-tourism-hub",
        "title":  "Madhubani Airport to Open Soon; Fulhar to Transform into a Tourism Hub",
        "summary":  "Dreams of Madhubani residents are about to take flight as the much-awaited Madhubani Airport is set to commence operations soon! This exciting announcement was made by the Chief Minister during his visit",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eDreams of Madhubani residents are about to take flight as the much-awaited Madhubani Airport is set to commence operations soon! This exciting announcement was made by the Chief Minister during his visit to Jhajharpur’s Pragati Yatra on Sunday. The transformation doesn’t stop there—Fulhar, the historic site of Sita and Lord Ram’s first meeting, will soon be developed as a vibrant tourism destination.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdding to the excitement, 140 projects worth ₹1,100 crore were inaugurated or initiated during this event. The Chief Minister also revealed plans for a ring road to ease traffic congestion in Madhubani city, alongside the construction of an inter-state bus terminal for smoother connectivity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Boost for Tourism and Infrastructure\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFulhar’s upcoming development as a tourism hub marks a significant step in celebrating Mithila’s rich cultural heritage. The iconic Mithila Haat at Araria Sangram will undergo further expansion, offering visitors a glimpse of the region’s unique art and crafts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo address flooding and irrigation concerns, the interlinking of Kamla, Purani Kamla, and Jeevach rivers is on the agenda, ensuring better water management. Strengthening the Bidheswar Sthan and Ugranath canal systems under the Western Koshi Canal project is also in progress.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndustrial Growth and Modernization\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA sprawling 500-acre industrial zone near Banagama in Laukahi Block is set to emerge, creating jobs and spurring economic growth. Additionally, key road and bridge projects, including an RoB at Jaynagar and the much-needed ring road connecting Kanakpur to Jagatpur, are in the works.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Brighter Future for Mithila\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Chief Minister’s ambitious plans highlight his commitment to holistic development across Bihar. Whether it’s the construction of modern infrastructure, improved transportation facilities, or preserving the region’s heritage, the path ahead looks promising.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re eager to stay updated on Madhubani’s remarkable transformation and Bihar’s development journey, don’t miss out!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 Follow www.biharsay.com for regular updates and join our 10k+ strong global community today!\u003c/p\u003e",
