        "id":  "bharatnet-to-bring-fiber-internet-to-bihar-villages",
        "title":  "BharatNet to Bring Fiber Internet to Bihar Villages",
        "summary":  "What if the next big change in a Bihar village does not arrive on a new highway, but through a fiber cable running quietly into homes? That is the promise behind the revised BharatNet plan for Bihar, which aims to take high-speed internet beyond panchayat buildings and closer to ordinary rural households with direct fiber links and Fiber to the Home (FTTH).",
        "content":  "\u003ch1\u003eBihar’s Villages Are Getting a Digital Lifeline: BharatNet Plans to Take Fiber Internet to Every Home\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat if the next big change in a Bihar village does not arrive on a new highway, but through a fiber cable running quietly into homes?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThat is the promise behind the revised \u003cstrong\u003eBharatNet plan for Bihar\u003c/strong\u003e, which aims to take high-speed internet beyond panchayat buildings and closer to ordinary rural households. The plan focuses on stronger village connectivity, direct fiber links for government institutions, and \u003cstrong\u003eFiber to the Home (FTTH)\u003c/strong\u003e connections for families.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccording to reports, the Bihar government’s Information Technology Department has started work on necessary changes to its existing agreement with the Centre. The network expansion is expected to begin by the end of the year.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhat is changing with BharatNet in Bihar?\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUntil now, BharatNet connectivity in many villages has largely focused on reaching the \u003cstrong\u003egram panchayat level\u003c/strong\u003e. The revised approach aims to take that network further into schools, health centres, and households.\u003c/p\u003e",
