        "id":  "pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-how-digital-reform-can-empower-every-farmer",
        "title":  "PM-Kisan Samman Nidhi: How Digital Reform Can Empower Every Farmer",
        "summary":  "# PM-Kisan Samman Nidhi: How Digital Reforms Can Unlock Benefits for Every Farmer   ### When policy intent meets ground realities, meaningful change becomes possible.   For India’s small and marginal...",
        "content":  "\u003ch1\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePM-Kisan Samman Nidhi: How Digital Reforms Can Unlock Benefits for Every Farmer\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cem\u003eWhen policy intent meets ground realities, meaningful change becomes possible.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor India’s small and marginal farmers, the \u003cstrong\u003ePM-Kisan Samman Nidhi Yojana\u003c/strong\u003e continues to be a strong pillar of financial support.\u003cbr /\u003eEvery instalment brings stability, confidence, and dignity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHowever, as India accelerates toward digital governance, a new opportunity has emerged.\u003cbr /\u003eBy aligning old land records with modern systems, the scheme can reach \u003cstrong\u003eevery eligible farmer without delay\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePM-Kisan Samman Nidhi: A Strong Scheme with Growing Reach\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003ePradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi\u003c/strong\u003e scheme already supports crores of farmers nationwide.\u003cbr /\u003eIt delivers direct income support and reduces dependency on informal credit.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImportantly, the government has strengthened transparency through digital verification.\u003cbr /\u003eAs a result, leakages have reduced and delivery has improved.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow, the next step is inclusion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBridging the Gap Between Old Land Records and New Technology\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAcross rural India, many farmers hold land recorded in \u003cstrong\u003etraditional registers such as Gunj-Bahis and measurement books\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003cbr /\u003eThese records reflect genuine ownership passed down through generations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHowever, many of them are not yet digitised.\u003cbr /\u003eTherefore, online systems sometimes fail to capture this reality.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce these records enter digital databases, thousands of farmers will benefit instantly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy the ‘Fard’ Requirement Can Become a Gateway, Not a Barrier\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe mandatory \u003cstrong\u003eland fard\u003c/strong\u003e aims to ensure accuracy and fairness.\u003cbr /\u003eThat intent is positive and necessary.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt the same time, many farmers need support to obtain this document.\u003cbr /\u003eWith faster processing and flexible verification, the same rule can empower farmers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThus, reform—not rollback—is the real solution.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLocal Leadership Showing the Way Forward\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn \u003cstrong\u003eBiraul block of Darbhanga, Bihar\u003c/strong\u003e, constructive dialogue has already begun.\u003cbr /\u003eBlock Chief \u003cstrong\u003eMamta Devi\u003c/strong\u003e has highlighted practical solutions to state authorities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOut of \u003cstrong\u003e12,566 PM-Kisan beneficiaries\u003c/strong\u003e, nearly \u003cstrong\u003e1,200 farmers\u003c/strong\u003e rely on legacy land records.\u003cbr /\u003eTheir cases are genuine and verifiable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith targeted drives, their inclusion can happen smoothly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Solutions That Can Strengthen PM-Kisan Further\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeveral positive steps can accelerate impact:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDigitising old registries through special campaigns\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccepting verified legacy documents temporarily\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpeeding up mutation and fard issuance\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnabling alternative farmer verification methods\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTogether, these measures can make PM-Kisan more inclusive.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA Moment to Strengthen Trust Between Farmers and the System\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDigital India works best when technology adapts to people—not the other way around.\u003cbr /\u003eBy integrating history with innovation, governance becomes humane.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePM-Kisan already has the foundation.\u003cbr /\u003eNow, thoughtful execution can complete the vision.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStay Updated with Stories That Drive Positive Change\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor stories that highlight \u003cstrong\u003esolutions, progress, and grassroots voices\u003c/strong\u003e, stay connected.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e👉 \u003cstrong\u003eFollow \u003ca href=\"http://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003ewww.biharsay.com\u003c/a\u003e for regular updates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e🌍 \u003cstrong\u003eJoin 13,000+ readers worldwide\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBihar Say\u003c/strong\u003e is Bihar’s leading \u003cstrong\u003eapolitical media and storytelling platform\u003c/strong\u003e, reshaping perceptions through impactful narratives on culture, business, governance, and change.\u003cbr /\u003eWith partnerships like \u003cstrong\u003eDailyHunt\u003c/strong\u003e and the flagship \u003cstrong\u003eBiharCast podcast\u003c/strong\u003e, Bihar Say continues to amplify Bihar’s real stories—responsibly and positively.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eViral Positive Headlines (Options)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003ePM-Kisan and the Path Forward: Turning Digital Challenges into Farmer Opportunity\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eStrengthening PM-Kisan: Why Updating Land Records Can Transform Rural India\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e",
