        "id":  "bihar-bhumi-live-land-verification-see-your-property-before-registry",
        "title":  "Bihar Bhumi Live Land Verification: See Your Property Before Registry",
        "summary":  "**Bihar Bhumi Revolution: See Your Land Live Before Registry, Ending Fraud and Fake Deals!**   **Catch the Land Before You Buy: Bihar Bhumi Goes Live!** Bihar is stepping into the future of land regis...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBihar Bhumi Revolution: See Your Land Live Before Registry, Ending Fraud and Fake Deals!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCatch the Land Before You Buy: Bihar Bhumi Goes Live!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBihar is stepping into the future of land registration with a revolutionary move. Now, before any land, flat, or commercial property registry, buyers can see a \u003cstrong\u003elive image of the property\u003c/strong\u003e, complete with location and ownership details. This innovation aims to clamp down on fraudulent sales and empower citizens like never before.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eReal-Time Land Verification to Stop Fraud\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bihar government has introduced a \u003cstrong\u003etechnology-based system\u003c/strong\u003e to make land registration fully transparent. Under the new framework, every property must have an actual photograph uploaded to the government portal before registration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis photograph, linked with exact \u003cstrong\u003eGPS coordinates\u003c/strong\u003e, ensures buyers know exactly what they are purchasing. The system also verifies the rightful owner automatically. Consequently, if a land mafia or unauthorized seller tries to resell the same property, the registration will stop immediately.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFixing the Current System’s Loopholes\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEarlier, GPS cameras were used for verification, but inaccuracies often arose, especially in rural areas. Locations could be off by up to a kilometer, leaving room for disputes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith this \u003cstrong\u003enew software\u003c/strong\u003e, on-spot photographs and precise coordinates remove ambiguities. Buyers will see the \u003cstrong\u003etrue condition of their property\u003c/strong\u003e, avoiding disputes and reducing delays significantly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eInstant Updates on Your Mobile\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce a registry is completed, buyers will receive an \u003cstrong\u003eSMS containing the property’s complete details\u003c/strong\u003e, including the uploaded photograph. This serves as a legal record and eliminates the need to visit offices repeatedly for documents.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEasier Property Transactions Online\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe system also streamlines the \u003cstrong\u003eDakhil-Kharij process\u003c/strong\u003e. Nearly 60% of property filings can now be processed online. Trials across districts like Darbhanga have proven successful, and the government is preparing for full-scale implementation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis change ensures buyers get exactly the property they paid for. Using Google Maps, they can verify the location quickly, reducing the chance of fraud drastically.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEmpowering Bihar’s Citizens\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis innovative technology makes \u003cstrong\u003eproperty buying safer and more reliable\u003c/strong\u003e. Fraudsters will face tougher scrutiny, and citizens will gain confidence in every transaction. The Bihar Bhumi initiative is not just about technology—it’s about giving power back to the people and ensuring fairness in land dealings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStay updated with Bihar’s latest governance and technology initiatives! Follow \u003ca href=\"https://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003ewww.biharsay.com\u003c/a\u003e for more regular updates and become part of the 13k+ global community of Bihar enthusiasts. Bihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical media platform, reshaping the state’s image through stories on culture, business, and grassroots change.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
        "categorySlug":  "industry-innovation",
        "categoryName":  "Industry \u0026 Innovation",
        "publishedDate":  "Jan 1, 2026",
        "readingTimeMinutes":  4,
        "imageUrl":  "/legacy-images/5513_Bihar-Say-Website-66.png",
        "authorName":  "Amrita",
