        "id":  "muzaffarpurs-%e2%82%b9213-25-crore-marine-drive-style-lake-front-to-open-this-new-year",
        "title":  "Muzaffarpur’s ₹213.25-Crore Marine Drive-Style Lake Front to Open This New Year",
        "summary":  "### “Muzaffarpur’s ₹213.25-Crore Marine Drive-Style Lake Front Nears Completion—A New Year Glow Is Coming!”   ## A New Year Buzz in Muzaffarpur: Sikandarpur Lake Front Almost Ready to Shine   Muzaffar...",
        "content":  "\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e“Muzaffarpur’s ₹213.25-Crore Marine Drive-Style Lake Front Nears Completion—A New Year Glow Is Coming!”\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA New Year Buzz in Muzaffarpur: Sikandarpur Lake Front Almost Ready to Shine\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMuzaffarpur is buzzing with excitement as the city inches closer to unveiling one of its most ambitious urban projects ever—the \u003cstrong\u003eSikandarpur Lake Front\u003c/strong\u003e, inspired by Marine Drive aesthetics. Although the project is \u003cem\u003enot fully completed yet\u003c/em\u003e, work has moved into its final phase, and the city is already feeling the vibe of something big on the way.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA Transformative Vision for North Bihar\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeveloped under \u003cstrong\u003eMuzaffarpur Smart City\u003c/strong\u003e, this ₹213.25-crore mega development aims to change how people experience public spaces. The lake, once ignored, is evolving into a clean, vibrant, and modern recreational zone. Moreover, its location within the city makes it accessible to families, students, morning walkers, tourists, and nature lovers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEven in its incomplete state, people are stopping by to take a look. The improved pathways, fresh plantations, and glowing lights hint at the beauty that is about to unfold.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat’s Coming Soon: Features That Will Redefine Urban Leisure\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile finishing touches continue, many elements of the project already reflect the scale of transformation. The idea is simple—create a space where people can relax, walk, breathe, and enjoy the city in a new way.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e✨ \u003cstrong\u003eHighlights You Will Soon See\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA spacious \u003cstrong\u003eCommunity Hall\u003c/strong\u003e for cultural, social, and creative events\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA smooth \u003cstrong\u003ewalking track\u003c/strong\u003e ideal for morning and evening fitness\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA modern \u003cstrong\u003eBoating Club\u003c/strong\u003e, expected to attract youth and families\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eColourful \u003cstrong\u003eselfie points\u003c/strong\u003e, decorative \u003cstrong\u003efountains\u003c/strong\u003e, and stylish ambient lights\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA beautiful \u003cstrong\u003enight lighting setup\u003c/strong\u003e that will eventually give the lake a glowing skyline\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWaste-to-art installations inspired by \u003cstrong\u003ePinjore Garden\u003c/strong\u003e, adding an eco-creative touch\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese features, once fully ready, will give Muzaffarpur a new identity. And, importantly, they will offer residents a refreshing escape within the city.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA Green Heart in the Middle of the City\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnvironmental care sits at the centre of the project. The Smart City team has planted trees along the lake edges, which already attract birds and bring freshness to the space. Additionally, modern ecological techniques are being used to improve water quality and protect biodiversity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe efforts of the Smart City team, led by \u003cstrong\u003eMunicipal Commissioner Vikram Virkar (@VikramVirkar)\u003c/strong\u003e, deserve recognition for pushing the project ahead despite earlier delays.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExpected to Become North Bihar’s New Destination\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEven before completion, Sikandarpur Lake Front has become a talking point across North Bihar. Locals expect the place to become a prime venue for events, cultural festivals, morning routines, and tourism.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThough the project is not finished yet, the team is working steadily to make the lakefront accessible soon. The city now waits eagerly, hoping for its grand opening in the coming months.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWant More Inspiring Bihar Development Stories?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003ewww.biharsay.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e for regular updates and join our growing \u003cstrong\u003e13k+ community worldwide\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBihar Say\u003c/strong\u003e, the state’s leading apolitical storytelling platform, continues to reshape Bihar’s image through powerful stories on culture, business, and grassroots changemakers. Its flagship video-podcast series, \u003cstrong\u003eBiharCast\u003c/strong\u003e, brings untold stories from the heart of Bihar.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJoin the movement—stay connected!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
