        "id":  "aiims-patna-doctors-remove-3-1-kg-spleen-from-six-year-old-in-rare-surgery",
        "title":  "AIIMS Patna Doctors Remove 3.1 Kg Spleen From Six-Year-Old in Rare Surgery",
        "summary":  "## Miracle in Patna: AIIMS Doctors Remove 3.1 Kg Spleen From Six-Year-Old Boy in Record Surgery   **Patna, November 4, 2025** — A six-year-old boy weighing just 18 kilograms carried a 3.1 kg spleen in...",
        "content":  "\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMiracle in Patna: AIIMS Doctors Remove 3.1 Kg Spleen From Six-Year-Old Boy in Record Surgery\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePatna, November 4, 2025\u003c/strong\u003e — A six-year-old boy weighing just 18 kilograms carried a 3.1 kg spleen inside his tiny body. It sounds unbelievable, yet doctors at \u003cstrong\u003eAIIMS Patna\u003c/strong\u003e turned this medical crisis into a \u003cstrong\u003estory of strength, skill, and hope\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhen a Rare Disease Meets Unbreakable Spirit\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe boy arrived at AIIMS Patna with a swollen abdomen and constant infections. After several tests, doctors found he had \u003cstrong\u003eGaucher’s disease\u003c/strong\u003e, a \u003cstrong\u003erare genetic disorder\u003c/strong\u003e. This condition occurs when the body lacks an enzyme called \u003cem\u003eglucocerebrosidase\u003c/em\u003e, causing fatty deposits in organs such as the spleen and liver.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver time, his spleen expanded to a shocking \u003cstrong\u003e30 by 20 centimetres\u003c/strong\u003e, weighing \u003cstrong\u003e3.1 kilograms\u003c/strong\u003e. It began pressing on other organs, threatening his life. At that point, \u003cstrong\u003esurgery became the only option\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHowever, operating on a young child with such an enlarged spleen posed a massive challenge. Still, the \u003cstrong\u003eAIIMS Patna team stepped up fearlessly\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Expert Team Behind the Record-Breaking Surgery\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe complex procedure was led by \u003cstrong\u003eDr. Amit Kumar\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eDr. Amit Kumar Sinha\u003c/strong\u003e from the \u003cstrong\u003eDepartment of Paediatric Surgery\u003c/strong\u003e. They were joined by \u003cstrong\u003eDr. Rashi\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eDr. Digamber\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eDr. Gaurav\u003c/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003eDr. Saurav\u003c/strong\u003e, who worked tirelessly to ensure precision at every step.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMeanwhile, \u003cstrong\u003eDr. Neeraj Kumar\u003c/strong\u003e guided the anaesthesia team with steady expertise. \u003cstrong\u003eDr. Pratap Patra\u003c/strong\u003e, a senior paediatrician, monitored the boy’s pre- and post-surgery condition carefully.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTogether, these doctors turned an impossible case into a \u003cstrong\u003emilestone in Indian paediatric surgery\u003c/strong\u003e. The \u003cstrong\u003e3.1 kg spleen removal\u003c/strong\u003e from a child of this age now stands as a record across the country.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFrom Pain to Recovery: A Turning Point for Bihar’s Healthcare\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe surgery lasted several hours, but every second was worth it. The boy recovered smoothly and was discharged in a stable condition. His parents, once worried beyond measure, now call it a \u003cstrong\u003esecond chance at life\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis operation proves that \u003cstrong\u003eBihar’s healthcare system is evolving rapidly\u003c/strong\u003e. Families no longer need to travel outside the state for high-risk surgeries. With experts like these, \u003cstrong\u003eAIIMS Patna\u003c/strong\u003e continues to strengthen \u003cstrong\u003efaith in Bihar’s medical excellence\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAIIMS Patna: Shaping the Future of Child Healthcare\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAIIMS Patna has become a \u003cstrong\u003esymbol of hope and progress\u003c/strong\u003e in eastern India. Each breakthrough reminds us that world-class care is possible right here in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis surgery is not just a medical success — it’s a \u003cstrong\u003emessage of confidence\u003c/strong\u003e to every family seeking advanced treatment locally. As Bihar’s healthcare infrastructure grows stronger, stories like these redefine how the world views the state’s capabilities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e✨ \u003cstrong\u003eWant more inspiring stories like this?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eVisit 👉 \u003ca href=\"https://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ewww.biharsay.com\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e and join our \u003cstrong\u003e13K+ global community\u003c/strong\u003e!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBihar Say\u003c/strong\u003e is Bihar’s leading \u003cstrong\u003eapolitical media and storytelling platform\u003c/strong\u003e, reshaping the state’s image through powerful stories on \u003cstrong\u003eculture, business, and grassroots change\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003cbr /\u003eListen to our \u003cstrong\u003eflagship podcast – BiharCast\u003c/strong\u003e, where we uncover \u003cstrong\u003ereal stories of changemakers and traditions from the heart of Bihar\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
