        "summary":  "Can the fragrance of rural innovation reach London? Amar Deep from Samastipur proves it canâ€”and much more. In a small village in Ujiarpur, Samastipur, Amar Deep Kumar turned waste into opportunity. Using temple flowers and sugar...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eCan the fragrance of rural innovation reach London? Amar Deep from Samastipur proves it canâ€”and much more.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a small village in Ujiarpur, Samastipur, Amar Deep Kumar turned waste into opportunity. Using temple flowers and sugarcane residue, he created carbon-free incense sticks. Today, his company Morang Desh Ventures Pvt. Ltd. is spreading its unique fragrance across India and even to London, Singapore, Nigeria, and Abu Dhabi.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis journey is not just about businessâ€”itâ€™s about hope, sustainability, and transforming lives.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Dream That Started Small\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmar Deepâ€™s entrepreneurial journey began with a vision to bring change. Despite limited resources, he refused to give up. In 2021, he founded Morang Desh Ventures, inspired by Nepalâ€™s Morang district, an industrial hub symbolizing progress.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe name reflects Amar Deepâ€™s goal: to connect his local roots with global aspirations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTurning Waste into Opportunity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmar Deepâ€™s innovation lies in using waste materials like temple flowers and sugarcane byproducts to create eco-friendly incense sticks. These sticks are completely carbon-free, making them an environmentally sustainable product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat started with a small investment of â‚¹6 lakhs has grown into a â‚¹3.5 crore business. His factory now produces an impressive 5 tons of incense sticks every day, all while addressing waste management issues.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEmpowering Rural Communities\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmar Deepâ€™s success is not just his ownâ€”it belongs to the 110 people whose lives he has transformed. His factory provides stable employment to local men and women, many of whom previously had no source of income.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBy offering work to both husbands and wives, Amar Deep ensures financial stability for entire families. This initiative has also helped reduce rural-to-urban migration by creating opportunities within the village itself.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTaking Biharâ€™s Fragrance to the World\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat began in a small village has now made its way to international markets. Amar Deepâ€™s incense sticks carry the essence of Biharâ€™s innovation and resilience to global audiences.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHis journey inspires others to dream big and take bold steps toward creating positive change in their communities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe Part of This Transformation\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmar Deepâ€™s story is proof that determination and innovation can create magic. Want to explore more such inspiring stories?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Visit www.biharsay.com for regular updates and join our thriving community of 10,000+ changemakers worldwide!\u003c/p\u003e",
