        "title":  "Reviving the Spirit of Hockey in Bihar: A New Dawn with Hockey Indiaâ€™s Recognition",
        "summary":  "Hockey in Bihar is finally turning a corner! Hockey India has officially recognized the Hockey Association of Bihar as its member unit. This move has sparked hope for the sportâ€™s future across the state. This decision comes afte...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eHockey in Bihar is finally turning a corner! Hockey India has officially recognized the Hockey Association of Bihar as its member unit. This move has sparked hope for the sportâ€™s future across the state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis decision comes after Hockey Bihar, the previous governing body, was disaffiliated due to its lack of accountability and inactivity. The Hockey Association of Bihar, backed by the Bihar State Sports Authority, stepped in to fill the void. After a thorough review, Hockey India approved their candidature, marking a new chapter for hockey in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Much-Needed Change\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œYes, there is a new body in Bihar that has approached Hockey India, and the approval has come. They just need to submit the documents to complete the formality,â€ confirmed an official. This development has thrilled players and fans who have long wanted a committed governing body to promote grassroots hockey.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Promising Leadership\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnder the leadership of Rana Pratap Singh as Secretary and Bihar Government Minister Shravan Kumar as President, the Hockey Association of Bihar is poised to usher in a transformative era. Recent events, such as the successful hosting of the Womenâ€™s Asian Champions Trophy, highlight Biharâ€™s potential to become a hockey hub. The state is also preparing for the Menâ€™s Asia Cup later this year, adding to the excitement.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Road Ahead\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Womenâ€™s Asian Champions Trophy showcased Biharâ€™s ability to host international tournaments. Despite the absence of Hockey Bihar officials during the event, the Bihar State Sports Authority ensured its success. This collaboration sets the stage for a promising future under new leadership.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFormer players are optimistic about the change. â€œWe wanted the previous body to go for a very long time. There was no accountability, and they did nothing for the sport. Iâ€™m eager to see how the new body fosters grassroots development,â€ shared a former Bihar hockey player.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the Movement\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe recognition of the Hockey Association of Bihar marks more than a governance change. Itâ€™s a fresh start for hockeyâ€™s revival in the state. Stay updated on this journey and more! Visit www.biharsay.com to join over 10,000 hockey enthusiasts worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e",
