        "id":  "new-patna-airport-terminal-bigger-better-and-globally-connected",
        "title":  "Patna Airportâ€™s New Terminal: A Leap Towards Global Connectivity",
        "summary":  "Patna Airport is set to redefine its identity with the grand opening of its new terminal building. Imagine peak-hour passenger capacity skyrocketing from 1,300 to an impressive 4,500! Starting April, flights will operate from this...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003ePatna Airport is set to redefine its identity with the grand opening of its new terminal building. Imagine peak-hour passenger capacity skyrocketing from 1,300 to an impressive 4,500! Starting April, flights will operate from this state-of-the-art terminal, a project nearly seven years in the making since its inception in 2018.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe revamped Jayprakash Narayan International Airport isnâ€™t just about expansion; itâ€™s about evolution. Annual capacity will surge from 23 lakh to 1 crore, paving the way for enhanced connectivity, employment opportunities, and a boost to tourism in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith an investment of â‚¹1,400 crore, the terminal offers world-class amenities. It boasts two VIP halls each in arrival and departure areas, five aerobridges for seamless boarding, and parking for 11 aircraft, doubling the current capacity. Furthermore, international flights from Patna will soon become a reality, fulfilling a long-awaited aspiration for the region.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRunway Expansion: A Game Changer\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEfforts are underway to extend the 6,800-feet runway to 12,000 feet, enabling operations of larger aircraft like Airbus 120 and Boeing 737. This upgrade will not only enhance safety but also ensure smoother takeoffs and landings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDirect Flights: Connecting Cities and Hearts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe demand for direct flights to Jaipur, Bhopal, and Raipur remains high, especially with the significant population of Biharis residing there. Direct connectivity would save time, reduce costs, and cater to the large student population in Kota and wedding tourism in Rajasthan.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRefrigerated Cargo: Empowering Farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo empower local farmers and boost agri-exports, the terminal will include refrigerated storage for flowers, fruits, seeds, and vegetables. This initiative will open new markets for produce from Nalanda, Fatuha, and nearby areas, benefiting both farmers and airlines.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Culture on Display\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdding a touch of regional pride, the terminal will showcase Biharâ€™s traditional art and craft, offering a cultural treat to travelers. This feature promises to make every journey through Patna Airport a memorable experience.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe new terminal embodies a vision of progress and global aspirations while staying deeply rooted in Biharâ€™s cultural identity. For more updates on Biharâ€™s transformational projects, visit www.biharsay.com and join our growing community of 10,000+ worldwide!\u003c/p\u003e",
