        "summary":  "Biharâ€™s Daughters Make History in Kabaddi Tournament Biharâ€™s women athletes have once again proven their strength and determination on a national stage. The Bihar womenâ€™s kabaddi team triumphed at the Civil Services Kabaddi ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Daughters Make History in Kabaddi Tournament\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s women athletes have once again proven their strength and determination on a national stage. The Bihar womenâ€™s kabaddi team triumphed at the Civil Services Kabaddi Tournament, held in New Delhi from January 3 to January 8, 2025. The team claimed the All India Championship with a spectacular 45-23 victory over Himachal Pradesh in the final, marking a historic achievement for Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRashmi Kumari: A Leader and Key Player\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRashmi Kumari, a star player from the Department of Information and Public Relations, led the team with skill and determination. Her leadership played a crucial role in their victory, securing the gold medal and bringing pride to both her department and the entire state of Bihar. Her exceptional performance on the field showcased the talent and resilience of women athletes from Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSupport from Department Officials\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRashmiâ€™s success received recognition from top officials, including Vaibhav Srivastava, Director of the Information and Public Relations Department, Additional Secretary Sanjay Krishna, and Joint Director Ravi Bhushan Sahay. They all congratulated her for her outstanding achievement, acknowledging her contribution to Biharâ€™s success in the tournament.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe National Stage: A Fierce Competition\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe tournament, held at the Thyagaraj Sports Complex in New Delhi, attracted 20 teams from across the country. Despite the fierce competition, Biharâ€™s women emerged victorious, proving that they can take on the best teams in the nation. This victory stands as a shining example of what Bihar women can achieve when given the opportunity to compete on equal footing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Message of Empowerment\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRashmi Kumari and her teammates have not only claimed a championship but have also empowered countless young girls in Bihar. Their victory sends a clear message: dreams are achievable with hard work and perseverance. It also highlights the growing importance of women in sports and the need for continued support and recognition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay Connected for More Updates\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDo you want to stay updated on more inspiring stories and achievements from Bihar? Follow us at BiharSay and become part of our 10k-strong community worldwide. Get regular updates and join the movement celebrating Biharâ€™s talent, success, and pride!\u003c/p\u003e",
