        "title":  "Bihar\u0027s EV Revolution: 8x Growth in 5 Years!",
        "summary":  "Bihar is racing towards an electric future, and the numbers speak louder than wordsâ€”demand for electric vehicles (EVs) has skyrocketed by 8x in just five years! The state has witnessed an unprecedented transformation. Back in 20...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar is racing towards an electric future, and the numbers speak louder than wordsâ€”demand for electric vehicles (EVs) has skyrocketed by 8x in just five years!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe state has witnessed an unprecedented transformation. Back in 2020, only 12,000 EVs found homes in Bihar. Fast forward to 2024, and this figure has surged past 97,000. The year isnâ€™t over yet, and experts predict sales will cross the one-lakh mark, signaling a tectonic shift in how Biharis view personal mobility.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Shift Fueled by Rising Awareness and Practical Benefits\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eElectric vehicles have captured the imagination of the masses, thanks to their lower operating costs, minimal pollution, and stylish designs. With government subsidies making EVs more affordable, the appeal is undeniable. In contrast, the demand for petrol and diesel vehicles has stagnated. Rising fuel prices and hefty maintenance costs are driving buyers away from traditional options.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEven CNG vehicles, which have seen a spike in interest, canâ€™t match the EV boom. Todayâ€™s EVs arenâ€™t just economical; theyâ€™re packed with advanced features that rival their traditional counterparts. Leading automakers are diving headfirst into this electric revolution, rolling out cutting-edge models that blend efficiency with aesthetics.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOvercoming Early Challenges\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInitial concerns about limited charging infrastructure are rapidly becoming a thing of the past. With more charging stations cropping up, including at restaurants and public spaces, long-distance EV travel is now a reality. Innovations in battery technology and a reduction in their costs have further boosted consumer confidence.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJust last year, January saw the sale of 5,022 EVs. This January, sales surpassed that mark by the 15th. By January 18, Bihar recorded a staggering 8,377 EV sales. These numbers tell a story of exponential growth, and the momentum shows no signs of slowing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe Part of Biharâ€™s EV Revolution\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s journey into the EV era is just beginning, and the future promises even more exciting developments. Donâ€™t miss out on staying updated with the latest trends and news about electric vehicles in Bihar and beyond.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Follow www.biharsay.com for regular updates and become part of our growing 10k-strong global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
        "category":  "Industry \u0026 Innovation",
