        "id":  "bihar-farmers-special-subsidy-on-seeds-for-summer-crops-apply-now",
        "title":  "Bihar Farmers: Unmissable Subsidy on Summer Crop Seeds â€“ Find Out How to Apply Before March 5th!",
        "summary":  "In a groundbreaking move, the Bihar government has announced a Special Seed Subsidy Scheme for farmers to support summer crops like maize, mung bean, urad, groundnut, sesame, and sunflower. This initiative aims to empower the agri...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eIn a groundbreaking move, the Bihar government has announced a Special Seed Subsidy Scheme for farmers to support summer crops like maize, mung bean, urad, groundnut, sesame, and sunflower. This initiative aims to empower the agricultural community with high-quality seeds at subsidized rates ranging from 50% to 80%.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnder this scheme, a total of 2,307 quintals of seeds will be distributed to farmers across Bihar. The distribution will include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMaize: 760 quintals Mung Bean: 1,292 quintals Urad: 225 quintals Groundnut: 20 quintals Sunflower: 10 quintals\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFarmers will enjoy subsidies like â‚¹117.20/kg for mung seeds, â‚¹144/kg for urad, â‚¹103.60/kg for groundnuts, â‚¹204/kg for sesame, and â‚¹519.52/kg for sunflower. With these savings, they can focus on maximizing their yield and ensuring financial stability.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeeds Delivered to Your Doorstep!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo make it even more convenient, farmers can now opt for home delivery of seeds by paying a nominal charge of â‚¹5 per kilogram. According to Nalanda District Agriculture Officer Rajiv Kumar, the application process has already started. Farmers can apply online at brbn.bihar.gov.in until March 5th, 2025.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis scheme also includes 100% subsidies under the National Food Security Mission and the National Agriculture Development Plan for demonstration plots, covering 1,988 acres of farmland.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTake Action Today!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf youâ€™re a farmer in Bihar, donâ€™t miss this golden opportunity. The government has set district-level targets, ensuring widespread benefits. But act fastâ€”applications close on March 5th!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApply now at brbn.bihar.gov.in and secure your seeds at a subsidized price.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more such timely updates, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 10,000-strong global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
