        "id":  "patna-to-host-historic-sportstar-sports-conclave-meet-top-indian-sporting-icons",
        "title":  "Patna to Host Historic Sportstar Sports Conclave: Meet Top Indian Sporting Icons",
        "summary":  "Patna is set to host an exciting event that will bring together Indiaâ€™s brightest sports stars! The Sportstar Sports Conclave â€“ Focus Bihar will take place on January 26, 2025, in Patna. This day-long event will feature Olympi...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003ePatna is set to host an exciting event that will bring together Indiaâ€™s brightest sports stars! The Sportstar Sports Conclave â€“ Focus Bihar will take place on January 26, 2025, in Patna. This day-long event will feature Olympic champions, Paralympians, and leading sports figures who will share their experiences and discuss the future of sports in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSporting Icons at the Conclave\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVijender Singh, the Olympic bronze medal-winning boxer, will headline the event. Joining him will be Sharad Kumar, a double-Paralympic medalist, and Deepa Malik, former PCI chief. Harendra Singh, the head coach of the Indian womenâ€™s hockey team, and Kalyan Chaubey, president of AIFF, will also share their insights on shaping the future of Indian sports.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese sports legends will inspire and motivate attendees, offering valuable lessons on their journey to success.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGovernment Leaders and Sports Development\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Sportstar Conclave â€“ Focus Bihar will also feature key government figures. B. Rajender, Additional Chief Secretary of the Department of Sports, Government of Bihar, will join the discussions. Raveendran Sankaran, the Director General and CEO of the Bihar State Sports Authority, will also be part of the event. Their presence highlights the stateâ€™s growing focus on sports development.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eE-Sports Revolution in Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe conclave will shine a light on Biharâ€™s role in Indiaâ€™s booming e-sports sector. Nishi Kant (Chief Design \u0026 Product at JetSynthesys) and Akshat Rathee (Co-Founder, NODWIN Gaming) will engage in a conversation with Abhishek Issar (Founder, UNIV Sportatech \u0026 Co-Founder, Federation of Esports India). This panel will explore how e-sports can further grow in the region.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOther Sporting Icons to Share Insights\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition to these key figures, many other prominent sports personalities will share their experiences. Shiva Keshavan, a veteran Winter Olympian, and Adille Sumariwalla, former president of AFI, will also take the stage. Aditi Mutatkar, a well-known shuttler, will contribute to the discussions too.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHonoring Sporting Excellence\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe conclave will recognize two exceptional athletes. The Unsung Champion Award will honor a lifetime achievement in sports. Meanwhile, the Young Achiever Award will celebrate a promising under-18 athlete.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Big Day in Patna\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe event will kick off with an inaugural address from Samrat Chaudhary, Biharâ€™s Deputy Chief Minister. Later, Nitish Kumar, the Honourable Chief Minister of Bihar, will deliver the closing remarks.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePartners Supporting the Event\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Sportstar Focus Bihar Conclave is presented by the Bihar State Sports Authority and the Department of Sports, Government of Bihar. It has strong support from Indian Oil Corporation Limited, State Bank of India, Great SportsTech (Technology Partner), and KPMG (Knowledge Partner).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the Conversation\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDonâ€™t miss out on this incredible opportunity to be part of a game-changing event. Engage with the leaders shaping Biharâ€™s sports ecosystem. For more regular updates, follow www.biharsay.com and become a part of our 10k-strong community worldwide!\u003c/p\u003e",
