        "title":  "Travel Smarter in Bihar with These New Train Services!",
        "summary":  "Bihar Welcomes a New Era of Rail Connectivity Railways just made commuting in Bihar smoother than ever! With the launch of new passenger trains on key routesâ€”Patna-Gaya, Gaya-DDU, and Raxaul-Jayanagarâ€”the East Central Railway ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar Welcomes a New Era of Rail Connectivity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRailways just made commuting in Bihar smoother than ever! With the launch of new passenger trains on key routesâ€”Patna-Gaya, Gaya-DDU, and Raxaul-Jayanagarâ€”the East Central Railway (ECR) has stepped up to ease travel woes for thousands of daily passengers. Whether youâ€™re commuting for work, visiting family, or exploring the region, these new services promise to make your journey more efficient and reliable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnhanced Connectivity on Key Routes\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStarting January 23, the Gaya-Patna special (03667/03668) is operational every Monday, Tuesday, Thursday, and Saturday. This new addition to the busy Patna-Gaya corridor will be a huge relief for commuters seeking timely and comfortable travel options.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor those traveling on the Gaya-DDU route, the one-way special train (03699) now runs every Wednesday, Friday, and Saturday, offering increased frequency until March 5. This vital route connects two crucial towns and supports seamless connectivity for residents.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMeanwhile, the Raxaul-Jayanagar DEMU passenger service (75215/75216), starting from January 26, adds more convenience for travelers. Departing Raxaul at 7:35 PM and reaching Jayanagar by 3:10 AM, the return journey begins at 3:35 AM, ensuring passengers have options for overnight travel.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRestored Train Services\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition to the newly launched trains, the railways have restored several passenger services. Commuters can now benefit from the Gaya-Patna MEMU (63242/63245), the Gaya-Patna special (03667/03668), and the Gaya-Kuil passenger (53634/53635). These services are perfect for those relying on consistent and affordable rail travel.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Move Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s rail infrastructure plays a critical role in connecting cities, towns, and villages. By launching these new trains and restoring services, ECR is not just reducing travel time but also ensuring that passengers have more flexible schedules. This move is expected to ease congestion on some of the most crowded routes, making daily travel more convenient.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHop Aboard the Change!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether youâ€™re heading to Gaya for business, Patna for leisure, or Jayanagar for family, these new trains are here to redefine your journey. Donâ€™t miss out on staying updated with the latest changes in Biharâ€™s transportation scene.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Visit www.biharsay.com to stay informed about railway updates and more. Join our 10k-strong global community today for regular insights into Biharâ€™s development!\u003c/p\u003e",
