        "summary":  "Bihar Divas 2025 is not just another event; itâ€™s a grand stage to exhibit your expertise at the heart of Patna. The Information and Public Relations Department, Government of Bihar, invites renowned firms and institutions to be ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar Divas 2025 is not just another event; itâ€™s a grand stage to exhibit your expertise at the heart of Patna. The Information and Public Relations Department, Government of Bihar, invites renowned firms and institutions to be part of this prestigious exhibition at Gandhi Maidan under the theme â€œUnnat Bihar, Viksit Bihar.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is your chance to participate in one of Biharâ€™s most high-profile events. If your firm specializes in event management, exhibition design, and large-scale infrastructure, this is the perfect business opportunity for you.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Should You Apply?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe exhibition will serve as a platform to highlight Biharâ€™s progress and development initiatives. Selected firms will have the responsibility of designing and executing an attractive, secure, and informative exhibition space that aligns with the vision of the Bihar government.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScope of Work and Responsibilities\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1. Exhibition Design \u0026 Setup\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA 60Ã—40 feet pandal with a visually appealing front fascia, designed under the supervision of the nodal officer. A 10Ã—10 feet book sales stall adjacent to the main exhibition. A VIP lounge with sofa sets, center tables, curtains, VIP chairs, and cooling systems.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2. Security \u0026 Maintenance\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe selected firm will be responsible for ensuring full security of the exhibition throughout the event. Any damage or failure will result in a proportionate deduction from the payment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3. High-Quality Digital \u0026 Print Installations\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA 12â€™x8â€™ LED wall with premium-quality visuals and sound for continuous promotion. Installation of 60 exhibition panels featuring themes like Jal-Jeevan-Hariyali, social reform, education, and eco-tourism using vinyl-printed sunboards.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4. Infrastructure \u0026 Logistics\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArrangements for lighting, fans, generators, seating, carpets, and floral decorations under departmental supervision. Transportation and safe return of department-issued exhibition panels.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEligibility \u0026 Application Guidelines\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFirms must be GST-registered and submit relevant documents with the quotation. A self-declaration confirming that the firm is not blacklisted and has no pending legal cases. A clear quotation covering all taxes and expenses is required. Post-event, firms must provide photographs, a CD, and an exhibition completion certificate approved by the authorities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubmission Deadline\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInterested firms must submit their quotations by 27th February 2025, 3:00 PM at the Information and Public Relations Department, Patna.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeize This Opportunity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is more than just an exhibitionâ€”it is a gateway to connect with Biharâ€™s growth story. If your firm has the capability and vision to create an impactful experience, now is the time to take action.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit www.biharsay.com for more regular updates and become part of our 10K+ community worldwide!\u003c/p\u003e",
