        "summary":  "Biharâ€™s Grand Entry on the Global Sports Stage! For the first time ever, Bihar is set to host the prestigious Sepak Takraw World Cup 2025 in Patna from March 20-25, 2025. This landmark event, made possible through a historic agr...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Grand Entry on the Global Sports Stage!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the first time ever, Bihar is set to host the prestigious Sepak Takraw World Cup 2025 in Patna from March 20-25, 2025. This landmark event, made possible through a historic agreement between the Bihar State Sports Authority and the Sepak Takraw Federation of India, marks a new dawn for sports in Bihar. Over 300+ players and officials from 20+ countries will participate, making it a spectacle of international significance! âœ¨\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Golden Opportunity for Biharâ€™s Sports Talent\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s sporting landscape is about to experience a major boost. Hosting such a high-profile tournament not only elevates the stateâ€™s reputation but also inspires countless young athletes. The impact of this event will be long-lasting, as Bihar will take center stage in the world of Sepak Takraw.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar on the Indian Teamâ€™s Jersey!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn another proud moment, Biharâ€™s name will shine on the Indian Sepak Takraw teamâ€™s jersey for the next one year! This branding move will keep Bihar in the global sports conversation, promoting its rich legacy and bright future in athletics.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Event Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGlobal Recognition: Bihar will be in the international spotlight as a host of this grand event. Opportunities for Local Talent: Young athletes will witness top-tier sports action, motivating them to excel. Economic Growth: Tourism, hospitality, and local businesses will benefit immensely.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the Movement!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with exclusive news and behind-the-scenes coverage of the Sepak Takraw World Cup 2025. Follow www.biharsay.com for regular updates and become part of our growing 10K+ global sports community!\u003c/p\u003e",
