        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Para Athletes Triumph with 10 Medals at National Championship\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn an inspiring display of determination and skill, Biharâ€™s para-athletes have clinched an impressive 10 medals at the 23rd National Para Athletics Championship held in Chennai from February 17 to 20, 2025.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Decade of Dedication: Biharâ€™s Medal Haul\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bihar Para Athletics team showcased exceptional talent, securing:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGold Medals: 2 Silver Medals: 2 Bronze Medals: 6\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis remarkable achievement underscores the athletesâ€™ unwavering commitment and the stateâ€™s growing prominence in para-athletics.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCelebrating the Champions\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKey contributors to this success include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGold Medalists: Somn Rana and Himanshu Yadav Silver Medalists: Shailesh Kumar and Ram Prasad Bronze Medalists: Archana Kumari, Shailesh Kumar, Ramanuj Kumar, and Santanu Kumar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTheir relentless pursuit of excellence has brought pride to Bihar and serves as an inspiration to aspiring athletes nationwide.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLeadership and Support\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDr. Shivaji Kumar, President of the Bihar Para Sports Association, lauded the athletes, stating they have elevated Biharâ€™s stature on the national stage. Secretary Sandeep Kumar extended congratulations to the team and coach Kundan Kumar Pandey for their dedication, announcing plans to honor the medalists upon their return.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Road Ahead\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCoach Kundan Kumar Pandey emphasized the importance of continued training and support, noting that while talent abounds, financial constraints often hinder potential. He advocates for increased governmental assistance to ensure all athletes have the resources to excel.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the Community\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated on inspiring stories like this and become part of a global community of over 10,000 members. Follow BiharSay for regular updates and insights into Biharâ€™s vibrant sports scene.\u003c/p\u003e",
