        "title":  "Revolutionizing Land Management: Bihar\u0027s New Online Server for Land Records",
        "summary":  "Bihar Goes Digital: Now Access Your Land Records Online in Minutes! Bihar has taken a major step toward digital governance. A new online server now makes land records easily accessible, bringing transparency and efficiency to the ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar Goes Digital: Now Access Your Land Records Online in Minutes!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar has taken a major step toward digital governance. A new online server now makes land records easily accessible, bringing transparency and efficiency to the process. This initiative aims to eliminate delays, reduce fraud, and simplify land-related services for residents.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow This Digital Shift Benefits You\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1. Instant Access to Land Records\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou no longer need to visit government offices multiple times. Now, land records are available online with just a few clicks. This saves time and effort.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2. Online Mutation Services\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApplying for land mutation is now hassle-free. You can submit and track your requests online, ensuring a quicker and more transparent process.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3. Digital Maps and Surveys\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpdated maps and survey data are now accessible online. This helps in resolving land disputes and ensuring accurate property demarcation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSteps to Check Your Land Records Online\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the Official Portal: Go to land.bihar.gov.in. Select the â€˜Record of Rightâ€™ Section: Click on the option to view your land records. Enter Your Details: Fill in your district, block, and plot number to retrieve the records.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters for Biharâ€™s Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis platform ensures greater accountability and reduces corruption. It also empowers citizens by providing real-time access to land data. More importantly, it aligns with Indiaâ€™s vision of a fully digital governance system.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant to stay updated on Biharâ€™s latest digital developments? Follow www.biharsay.com and be part of our 10K+ global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
