        "title":  "Experience the Vibrancy of Bihar at the Umangeshwari Mahotsav 2025",
        "summary":  "The much-anticipated Umangeshwari Mahotsav 2025 is set to captivate audiences on February 26 and 27 at the scenic Umga Maidan in Madanpur, Aurangabad. This two-day cultural extravaganza, organized by the Tourism Department, Bihar ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eThe much-anticipated Umangeshwari Mahotsav 2025 is set to captivate audiences on February 26 and 27 at the scenic Umga Maidan in Madanpur, Aurangabad. This two-day cultural extravaganza, organized by the Tourism Department, Bihar Government, promises an unforgettable blend of art, music, and tradition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Grand Celebration of Art and Culture\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe festival begins on February 26 at 10:30 AM with an inaugural session led by top dignitaries, including Bihar Legislative Council Chairman Awadhesh Narayan Singh, District In-charge Minister Dr. Santosh Kumar Suman, and Industries and Tourism Minister Nitish Mishra.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom 12:30 PM to 1:00 PM, the air will fill with pride as performers present the Bihar Gaurav Gaan. The stage then opens for local artists from 1:00 PM to 2:00 PM, leading up to a spectacular performance by renowned singer Hemant Brijwasi from 2:00 PM to 5:00 PM.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNon-Stop Entertainment on February 27\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDay two begins at 11:00 AM with mesmerizing acts by Shanti Kala Kendra, Patna, setting the perfect mood for the day. By 12:30 PM, local talents will take over, showcasing their art until 5:00 PM. With a grand pavilion and an artistic stage setup, the venue promises a visual treat for all attendees.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe a Part of the Celebration!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUmangeshwari Mahotsav isnâ€™t just an eventâ€”itâ€™s a tribute to Biharâ€™s rich heritage and artistic brilliance. Whether youâ€™re a local or a visitor, this festival offers an incredible chance to witness Biharâ€™s finest cultural performances.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDonâ€™t miss out! Stay updated with more such events by following Bihar Say and join our 10,000+ strong global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
