        "summary":  "Begusaraiâ€™s Daughter: Riya Kumari Gears Up for the Indian Kabaddi Team Training Camp! A Dream Turns into Reality! Begusaraiâ€™s very own Riya Kumari has scripted history! Selected for the Indian Kabaddi Team Training Camp, she i...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBegusaraiâ€™s Daughter: Riya Kumari Gears Up for the Indian Kabaddi Team Training Camp!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Dream Turns into Reality!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBegusaraiâ€™s very own Riya Kumari has scripted history! Selected for the Indian Kabaddi Team Training Camp, she is now training at the Indian Sports Authority Training Center, Sonipat. Her exceptional performance at the Senior National Womenâ€™s Kabaddi Championship in Karnal, Haryana, has earned her this prestigious opportunity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAsian Kabaddi Championship â€“ The Road to Glory ðŸ‡®ðŸ‡³\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis training camp is crucial for forming the team that will represent India at the Asian Kabaddi Championships in Iran from March 5 to 9. Riya, currently working with the Bihar State Sports Authority, has showcased incredible dedication and talent. Her journey is an inspiration for aspiring kabaddi players across Bihar and beyond!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Rise of a Champion\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRiyaâ€™s journey reflects her unwavering commitment. From rigorous training sessions to excelling at national-level championships, she has proved her mettle. Now, with training at the SAI Center in Sonipat, she is sharpening her skills to take on the international stage.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Emerging Sports Stars\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar has been making headlines in Indian sports, and Riya Kumariâ€™s selection further strengthens its sporting legacy. Young athletes from the state now have a role model to look up to, proving that hard work and passion can lead to national recognition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCongratulations, Riya! The entire state is cheering for you!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more such inspiring updates, follow ðŸ‘‰ www.biharsay.com and be part of our growing 10K-strong community worldwide!\u003c/p\u003e",
