        "summary":  "Bihar is on the brink of a massive infrastructure overhaul! In 2025, the state will witness rapid developments in its road and bridge networks. These projects aim to boost connectivity, cut travel time, and create new economic opp...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar is on the brink of a massive infrastructure overhaul! In 2025, the state will witness rapid developments in its road and bridge networks. These projects aim to boost connectivity, cut travel time, and create new economic opportunities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKey Road Projects in 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar is set to complete several crucial road projects this year:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMuzaffarpur Bypass â€“ Expected to open by February 2025, this bypass will ease traffic congestion in the city. Bakhtiyarpur-Mokama National Highway â€“ The four-lane highway, featuring a Road Over Bridge (ROB), will improve regional connectivity. Six-Lane Ganga Bridge (Aunta-Simarai) â€“ This bridge, scheduled for completion in February 2025, will enhance cross-river transportation. Ashok Rajpath Double-Decker Flyover, Patna â€“ Set to open in March 2025, this project will help decongest urban traffic. Saristabad-Nathupur 4-Lane Road â€“ Expected by June 2025, this road will further boost intra-state travel.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMassive Investments in Biharâ€™s Infrastructure\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe central government has allocated â‚¹60,000 crore in the 2024 budget for Biharâ€™s infrastructure. This fund will support expressways, airports, power plants, heritage corridors, and sports complexes. Additionally, the Bihar State Road Development Corporation Limited (BSRDCL) is working on five major road projects covering 225 kilometers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBridging Biharâ€™s Connectivity Gap\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Kacchi Dargahâ€“Bidupur Bridge, under construction, will be Indiaâ€™s longest bridge at 9.76 km. Slated for completion by July 2025, it will connect Patna with Hajipur, reducing travel time significantly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith these ambitious projects, Bihar is gearing up for a brighter, more connected future! Stay updated with all the latest infrastructure developments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ”— Follow www.biharsay.com and join our 10,000+ global community today!\u003c/p\u003e",
