        "id":  "empowering-women-in-bihar-the-poshan-vatika-revolution",
        "title":  "Empowering Women in Bihar: The \u0027Poshan Vatika\u0027 Revolution",
        "summary":  "In Muzaffarpur, Bihar, a quiet revolution is taking root. The women of Samarpan Jeevika Women Agri Producer Company Limited are not just earning livelihoodsâ€”they are nourishing communities. By packaging and selling â€˜Poshan Vat...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eIn Muzaffarpur, Bihar, a quiet revolution is taking root. The women of Samarpan Jeevika Women Agri Producer Company Limited are not just earning livelihoodsâ€”they are nourishing communities. By packaging and selling â€˜Poshan Vatikaâ€™ vegetable seed kits, these Jeevika Didis are driving both economic empowerment and food security.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Makes â€˜Poshan Vatikaâ€™ Special?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach â€˜Poshan Vatikaâ€™ kit is packed with 8 to 10 varieties of high-quality vegetable seeds, specially curated to enhance nutritional security. These seeds empower rural families to grow fresh vegetables in their backyards, ensuring access to healthier food without relying on external sources.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePartnering for Greater Impact\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis initiative has received support from NTPC Foundation, World Vision, Better World Foundation, and HelpAge India. Their collaboration has significantly expanded the reach of these seed kits, making them available to a wider network. Additionally, multiple Farmer Producer Companies and Cluster Level Federations under Jeevika are ensuring their effective distribution across Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWomenâ€™s Economic Empowerment Through Agriculture\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the Jeevika Didis, this initiative is more than just about selling seedsâ€”itâ€™s about building financial independence. By engaging in packaging and distribution, these women are acquiring entrepreneurial skills, securing a stable income, and paving the way for a better future for their families. With this economic boost, they can invest in education, healthcare, and a better standard of living.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Stronger, Healthier Rural Society\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith the success of the â€˜Poshan Vatikaâ€™ initiative, rural households are now growing their own nutritious food. This not only improves their diet but also reduces dependence on market-purchased vegetables, making their lives more self-sufficient and sustainable. Ultimately, this project is strengthening communities, fostering resilience, and building a healthier future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the Movement!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant to stay updated on such inspiring stories? Follow www.biharsay.com for regular updates and become part of our 10K+ global community making a difference every day!\u003c/p\u003e",
