        "title":  "Revitalizing Madhubani: From Defunct Paper Mill to Thriving Green Industrial Hub",
        "summary":  "Madhubani is witnessing a remarkable transformation. The abandoned Jhanjharpur paper mill will soon become a modern green industrial hub. This initiative will revive the local economy, create thousands of jobs, and attract investo...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eMadhubani is witnessing a remarkable transformation. The abandoned Jhanjharpur paper mill will soon become a modern green industrial hub. This initiative will revive the local economy, create thousands of jobs, and attract investors.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Major Step Towards Industrial Growth\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bihar Industrial Area Development Authority (BIADA) is leading this ambitious project. With an investment of â‚¹27.35 crore, the first phase will develop 56,586 square feet of industrial space. Moreover, the Plug and Play model ensures that businesses can start operations immediately. As a result, industries will flourish, and employment will rise.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExpanding for More Opportunities\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo meet growing demands, the Bihar government has approved the acquisition of 252.23 acres in Lohana. Consequently, this expansion will provide more space for industries while boosting economic activity. Additionally, with new opportunities, youth will no longer have to migrate for jobs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Dream Turning Into Reality\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe idea of a paper mill in Jhanjharpur began in the 1980s, yet it never materialized. Now, this land will finally serve a greater purposeâ€”an eco-friendly industrial hub. Not only will this initiative drive industrial growth, but it will also promote sustainability.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe Part of the Change!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMadhubani is on the rise! Follow www.biharsay.com for regular updates and join our thriving 10K+ global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
