        "title":  "Bihar Budget 2025: 7 New Airports, Better Healthcare \u0026 Womenâ€™s Empowerment Set to Transform the State!",
        "summary":  "The Bihar Budget 2025 focuses on women, farmers, and youth while boosting infrastructure, healthcare, and education. With new airports, better hospitals, and women-friendly initiatives, the state is moving toward a brighter future...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eThe Bihar Budget 2025 focuses on women, farmers, and youth while boosting infrastructure, healthcare, and education. With new airports, better hospitals, and women-friendly initiatives, the state is moving toward a brighter future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBetter Air Travel for Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe government is improving air connectivity to make travel easier and faster.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePurnia Airport will start flights in the next three months. Rajgir, Sultanpur, and Raxaul will get Greenfield Airports. Small aircraft services will begin in Valmikinagar, Munger, Saharsa, and Muzaffarpur.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese changes will help business and tourism grow in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImproved Healthcare for All\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe budget brings better hospitals and medical facilities across the state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBegusarai will get a new cancer hospital. All divisional headquarters will have cancer hospitals. Major sub-divisions will get referral hospitals. The state will open 108 new urban medical centers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese facilities will give people faster and better treatment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore Colleges for Students\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEducation is a key focus in this budget. The government plans to build more colleges and hostels.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e358 new degree colleges will open across Bihar. Hostels for working women will be set up to provide a safe stay.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese steps will help more students, especially girls, continue their education.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNew Initiatives for Women\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe budget introduces several programs to support women.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePink buses will run in major cities, with women drivers and conductors. The Home Stay Scheme will help women start tourism-related businesses. The government will hire female tour guides.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese efforts will create jobs and improve safety for women.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBetter Support for Farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe government is helping farmers by introducing better irrigation and market access.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore investment in agriculture will create new opportunities. Improved irrigation systems will increase crop production.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese steps will increase farmersâ€™ income and boost rural development.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar is taking big steps toward progress. Stay updated on these exciting changes!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ”— For more updates, visit www.biharsay.com and join our growing community!\u003c/p\u003e",
