        "title":  "Bihar\u0027s Leap in Weather Forecasting: Hybrid Doppler Radars in West Champaran and Bhagalpur",
        "summary":  "A New Era of Weather Prediction in Bihar Imagine a Bihar where sudden rain or cold waves never catch you off guard. With the state governmentâ€™s latest initiative, this vision is becoming a reality. Finance Minister Samrat Choudh...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eA New Era of Weather Prediction in Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine a Bihar where sudden rain or cold waves never catch you off guard. With the state governmentâ€™s latest initiative, this vision is becoming a reality. Finance Minister Samrat Choudhary recently announced the installation of Hybrid Doppler Weather Radar Networks in West Champaran and Bhagalpur. These advanced radars will provide weather updates up to 24 hours in advance, helping residents, farmers, and disaster management teams prepare better.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow Will This Technology Benefit Bihar?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bhagalpur radar will have an impressive 250 km range, covering the Kosi region, Patna, and even parts of Bangladesh. This wide coverage will allow authorities to track storms forming over the Bay of Bengal. On the other hand, the West Champaran radar will monitor cold winds from Nepal, covering a 100 km radius. With these upgrades, Bihar will receive real-time alerts for storms, rainfall, and cold waves.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHelping Farmers and Disaster Management Teams\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor farmers, timely weather information is critical. With these radars, they can receive localized and accurate forecasts instead of relying on outdated predictions. This ensures they can plan their harvests, irrigation, and crop protection with confidence.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSimilarly, disaster response teams will benefit from early warnings about heavy rainfall, storms, and cold waves. This will allow authorities to take preventive measures, saving lives and property in vulnerable areas.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExpanding Biharâ€™s Weather Radar Network\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCurrently, Doppler Weather Radars are operational in Patna and Purnia, with one set to be installed in Darbhanga. The addition of West Champaran and Bhagalpur will strengthen Biharâ€™s weather monitoring network, ensuring better coverage and timely updates for all major regions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay Ahead of the Weather â€“ Join Our Community!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDonâ€™t let the weather take you by surprise! Follow www.biharsay.com for regular updates on Biharâ€™s latest developments. Join our 10,000+ strong global community and stay informed about everything that matters.\u003c/p\u003e",
