        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar is set for a massive transformation! From economic growth to social welfare, this yearâ€™s budget focuses on development that will directly impact lives. So, whatâ€™s in store for you? Letâ€™s dive in!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMajor Infrastructure Developments\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAirports for Better Connectivity: The government is developing new airports in Purnia, Rajgir, Sultanpur, and Raxaul to improve accessibility and boost local economies. Modernized Bus Stands: Bihar will soon have a well-structured and advanced bus terminal network, enhancing transportation facilities across the state. Faster Road Connectivity: The administration has set a goal to ensure that all district headquarters can be reached from Patna within just four hours.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGame-Changing Announcements\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€˜Tarakaari Sudhaâ€™ Booths: The Bihar government is launching special outlets to give farmers direct access to bigger markets for their vegetable produce. Gym on Wheels: This innovative mobile fitness initiative will bring health and wellness to every corner of Bihar. Paperless Registration System: The state is embracing digital governance by eliminating paperwork, making processes faster and more transparent. Center of Excellence: New research and training centers dedicated to Makhana and Poultry Farming will empower farmers and entrepreneurs. Kanya Vivah Mandap: To support the weddings of underprivileged girls, the government will construct special community halls in every panchayat, promoting social welfare.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Economic Progress\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGSDP to reach â‚¹10.97 lakh crore! The economy is expanding rapidly, setting the stage for long-term growth. Total Budget: â‚¹3,16,859.02 crore Government Revenue: â‚¹2,60,831.44 crore Central Tax Share: Bihar will receive â‚¹67,740.57 crore from central taxes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClearly, Biharâ€™s future is brighter than ever! These projects will not only improve daily life but also create countless opportunities across various sectors. If you want to stay informed about Biharâ€™s growth and policies, visit www.biharsay.com and join our 10K+ global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
