        "summary":  "A Game-Changer for Biharâ€™s Rail Connectivity The much-awaited New Delhi-Patna Vande Bharat Express is set to revolutionize travel between the two capital cities. Covering nearly 1,000 km in less than 12 hours, this semi-high-spe...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eA Game-Changer for Biharâ€™s Rail Connectivity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe much-awaited New Delhi-Patna Vande Bharat Express is set to revolutionize travel between the two capital cities. Covering nearly 1,000 km in less than 12 hours, this semi-high-speed train will be Indiaâ€™s longest-running Vande Bharat service yet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor thousands of passengers traveling between Delhi and Patna, especially during peak seasons like Holi, this train offers a fast, safe, and comfortable alternative to conventional express trains. Here are all the details.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNew Delhi-Patna Vande Bharat Express: Route and Schedule\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis express service is designed for maximum efficiency, reducing travel time while connecting key railway stations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeparture from New Delhi: 8:30 AM Arrival in Patna: 8:00 PM Total Duration: Less than 12 hours Major Stops: Ara, Buxar, DDU (Deen Dayal Upadhyay), Prayagraj, and Kanpur\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReturn Journey:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeparture from Patna: 7:00 PM Arrival in New Delhi: 7:30 AM (Next Day)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis schedule makes it an ideal choice for business travelers, students, and families seeking a quick and comfortable journey between these two major cities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Makes This Vande Bharat Special?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFastest Travel Option: Cuts down travel time significantly compared to regular express trains. World-Class Comfort: Offers ergonomic seating, modern interiors, and premium catering. Eco-Friendly Technology: Designed with energy-efficient features and enhanced safety measures. Convenience for Bihar Residents: Ideal for those returning home for festivals, business, or family visits.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe launch of this train reinforces the governmentâ€™s commitment to modernizing rail transport and enhancing passenger convenience.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e200 More Vande Bharat Trains Coming Soon\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnion Railways Minister Ashwini Vaishnaw recently announced a massive expansion of Indiaâ€™s railway network. The government plans to introduce:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e200 new Vande Bharat trains 100 Amrit Bharat trains 50 Namo Bharat rapid rail services 17,500 new non-AC general coaches\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a â‚¹2.52 lakh crore budget allocated for railways in 2025-26, passengers can expect safer, faster, and more modern train services across India.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet Ready to Travel in Style\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe New Delhi-Patna Vande Bharat Express is all set to redefine train travel between Bihar and the national capital. Whether you are heading home for Holi or planning a business trip, this high-speed train promises efficiency, comfort, and world-class service.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated on Biharâ€™s latest news and developments by following www.biharsay.com. Become a part of our 10K+ global community and never miss an update.\u003c/p\u003e",
