        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s most exciting sports knowledge showdown is here! The Bihar Sports Quiz Competition 2025 will take place on March 30, bringing students from across the state together to test their sports expertise. This initiative aims to promote awareness, encourage participation, and strengthen the sporting culture in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eParticipation Details\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho Can Participate?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe competition is open to all students from recognized schools and colleges in Bihar. Schools and colleges must register their students by March 25 to secure their participation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow to Register?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStudents can sign up through their institutions, which will submit participant lists to the organizing committee. For additional details, visit the District Education Office, Gopalganj, or check the Bihar Sports Departmentâ€™s official website.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvent Venue and Schedule\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ“ Venue: Gopalganj District Sports Complexâ° Date \u0026 Time: March 30, 2025 | 10:00 AM onwards\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow to Prepare for the Quiz?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStudy Sports History: Focus on national and international sports, famous athletes, and historic events. Take Mock Quizzes: Practice with sample questions to improve speed and accuracy. Stay Updated: Follow recent sports news to gain an edge over competitors. Team Coordination: If participating as a team, schedule regular discussions and quizzes to boost collective knowledge.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy You Should Participate?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis competition is more than just a quizâ€”itâ€™s an opportunity to learn, compete, and showcase your sports knowledge on a big stage. Students will gain confidence, recognition, and a deeper understanding of the world of sports.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDonâ€™t Miss Out! Register Now and Be a Part of Biharâ€™s Biggest Sports Quiz Event!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more such updates, visit www.biharsay.com and join our 10K-strong global community!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTags:Bihar Education Events Bihar Sports Quiz 2025 Gopalganj Sports Event Sports Awareness Bihar Student Quiz Competition\u003c/p\u003e",
