        "summary":  "Biharâ€™s cricketing enthusiasm is about to reach new heights. The Menâ€™s Senior One-Day Trophy, organized by the Bihar Cricket Association (BCA), is set to commence on March 2, 2025. This tournament is a golden opportunity for l...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s cricketing enthusiasm is about to reach new heights. The Menâ€™s Senior One-Day Trophy, organized by the Bihar Cricket Association (BCA), is set to commence on March 2, 2025. This tournament is a golden opportunity for local cricketers to prove their mettle on a competitive stage.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Tournament Designed to Boost Biharâ€™s Cricket\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo ensure fair representation and maximum participation, the BCA has divided Bihar into eight zones:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWestern Zone Mithila Zone Shahabad Zone Magadh Zone Patliputra Zone Angika Zone Central Zone Seemanchal Zone\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach zone will send a team, making this a battle of the best talents from across the state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMatch Schedule and Format\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe tournament is structured in a league-cum-knockout format, ensuring a competitive contest from start to finish.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLeague Stage: March 2 â€“ March 13, 2025 (72 matches) Knockout Rounds: Quarter-finals, Semi-finals, and Final\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery match will be a stepping stone for players aiming for state and national selection.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBCAâ€™s Commitment to Talent Development\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBCA President Rakesh Tiwari has assured that selectors will closely monitor performances throughout the tournament. Exceptional players will stand a chance to represent Bihar in national competitions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis initiative is more than just a tournamentâ€”it is a pathway for Biharâ€™s young cricketers to shine.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Tournament Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Platform for Rising Talent â€“ A great opportunity for Biharâ€™s cricketers to make a mark. Boosts Competitive Spirit â€“ The tournament enhances cricketing standards across the state. Opens Doors to Bigger Stages â€“ A stepping stone for national and professional cricket careers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe a Part of Biharâ€™s Cricketing Journey\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow the latest match updates, exclusive insights, and player performances at www.biharsay.com.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin our 10K+ community of cricket lovers worldwide and be part of Biharâ€™s cricket revolution.\u003c/p\u003e",
