        "summary":  "Patnaâ€™s traffic is set for a massive transformation! A new road and bridge will soon connect Bans Ghat to JP Ganga Path, making travel smoother and reducing congestion. This long-awaited development will enhance connectivity bet...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003ePatnaâ€™s traffic is set for a massive transformation! A new road and bridge will soon connect Bans Ghat to JP Ganga Path, making travel smoother and reducing congestion. This long-awaited development will enhance connectivity between Ashok Rajpath, Bailey Road, PMCH, AIIMS, and key city routes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeamless Access from Bans Ghat to JP Ganga Path\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Direct Project Report (DPR) is in progress to link Bans Ghat with JP Ganga Path. The Bihar State Road Development Corporation (BSRDC) has assigned consultants to design the new bridge and road network. With an estimated cost of â‚¹52.28 crore, this initiative will provide an alternate route to avoid city traffic and ensure faster travel.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrategic Road Construction at Mandiri Nala\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Mandiri Nala road project is a crucial part of this plan. It will connect Mandiri, Income Tax Golambar, and Bailey Road directly to JP Ganga Path. Once complete, this road will significantly ease travel to PMCH and AIIMS, cutting down travel time and traffic bottlenecks.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNew U-Turn for Better Traffic Flow\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA dedicated U-turn near Bans Ghat will allow smooth access to JP Ganga Path. Vehicles approaching from Ashok Rajpath will take this U-turn, connecting directly to the newly built road at Kali Mandir. Similar to the connectivity at LCT Ghat, this development will streamline entry and exit points, making daily commutes hassle-free.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Project Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸš— Faster travel to major city hubs ðŸ¥ Quick access to PMCH \u0026 AIIMS ðŸ”„ Better traffic flow with new U-turns ðŸ’° â‚¹52.28 crore investment for improved city infrastructure\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay Updated with Patnaâ€™s Biggest Infrastructure Developments!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant to stay ahead of Patnaâ€™s urban transformation? Follow www.biharsay.com for exclusive updates and join our 10k-strong community worldwide!\u003c/p\u003e",
