        "summary":  "Biharâ€™s Daughters Shine in Andhra Pradesh: A Historic Victory in Carrom Championship Biharâ€™s pride soars as three daughters from Chanpatia make history in Andhra Pradesh! Their exceptional talent in the 27th All India Postal C...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Daughters Shine in Andhra Pradesh: A Historic Victory in Carrom Championship\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s pride soars as three daughters from Chanpatia make history in Andhra Pradesh! Their exceptional talent in the 27th All India Postal Carrom Tournament has captured national attention.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Champions in Andhra Pradesh\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 27th All India Postal Carrom Tournament in Tirupati witnessed an incredible performance by Biharâ€™s daughters. Competing under the Maharashtra Postal Circle team, Neha Kumari, Nisha Kumari, and Rinki Kumari secured the championship title. Their victory brought immense pride to Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Maharashtra team, including Neha, Nisha, Rinki, and Neelam Godke, clinched the top position. The final match against West Bengal was intense, but the Bihar-born players dominated, securing the win. The champions received certificates and medals for their achievement.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Journey of Dedication and Hard Work\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCurrently, Neha, Nisha, and Rinki work as Postal Assistants in Mumbaiâ€™s Postal Department. Their success in carrom paved the way for their professional careers. This victory adds another milestone to their already impressive track record in national and international carrom championships.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNeha and Nisha are daughters of Shyam Kishore Prasad, while Rinki is the daughter of late Shambhu Prasad. They hail from Chanpatia, West Champaran, and have consistently excelled in the sport. Their achievements have sparked celebrations across their hometown.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Celebrates Its Daughters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTheir victory has ignited joy across the district. Prominent personalities, including MLA Umakant Singh, Municipal Councillor Rajni Devi, Vice Councillor Sunil Kumar, and Police Officer Samrat Singh, have extended their heartfelt congratulations. Political leaders like Prateek Edwin Sharma, Rajkishore Prasad, Amit Kumar Gupta, Dr. Vatan Kesari, Anil Gupta, Rizwan Ansari, and Ashok Kumar Ojha also praised their success.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe remarkable feat of these talented players reflects Biharâ€™s sporting potential. Their journey inspires aspiring athletes to pursue their dreams, proving that dedication and perseverance lead to success.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with more inspiring stories! Follow www.biharsay.com and join our 10K+ strong global community! ðŸš€\u003c/p\u003e",
