        "id":  "bhagalpur-to-get-a-7-floor-marketing-complex-a-game-changer-for-local-businesses",
        "title":  "Bhagalpur to Get a 7-Floor Marketing Complex: A Game-Changer for Local Businesses",
        "summary":  "The commercial landscape of Bhagalpur is set for a transformation. The cityâ€™s first seven-floor marketing complex is coming up at Dipnagar Chowk, marking a significant leap in infrastructure development. With construction alread...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eThe commercial landscape of Bhagalpur is set for a transformation. The cityâ€™s first seven-floor marketing complex is coming up at Dipnagar Chowk, marking a significant leap in infrastructure development. With construction already underway, this project promises to redefine urban commerce and provide businesses with new opportunities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstruction Begins: What to Expect?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bhagalpur Municipal Corporation (BMC) has given the green light for the development of this modern complex on its vacant land. The proposal was first introduced in a municipal meeting, received cabinet approval, and was later finalized in proceedings. Now, the corporation has started the process of appointing a consultant agency to prepare the Detailed Project Report (DPR). The bidding process for selecting this agency will take place on April 8 and 9, following a pre-bid meeting scheduled for March 27.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStructure and Facilities\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe upcoming marketing complex will feature:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeven floors, including a G+5 structure with a basement Modern retail and office spaces Ample parking for visitors and businesses Strategic location at Dipnagar Chowk, enhancing accessibility and footfall\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBusiness Expansion and Economic Growth\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis initiative is expected to ease congestion in the cityâ€™s main market areas while boosting economic activity. Entrepreneurs and traders will benefit from additional commercial spaces, while the municipal corporation will generate revenue by renting out these units. The additional funds will help strengthen the corporationâ€™s internal resources, enabling further urban development projects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore Complexes in the Pipeline\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBhagalpur isnâ€™t stopping here. Similar marketing complexes are planned at:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSikandarpur Water Tank Premises Kanji House in Nathnagar Jawahar Cinema Road (Arghara land)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese projects will decentralize commercial activity, reducing pressure on traditional business hubs and promoting economic expansion across the city.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOfficial Statement\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccording to Aditya Jaiswal, the Planning Officer of Bhagalpur Municipal Corporation, a tender has already been issued for selecting the consultant agency. Once finalized, work on the DPR will commence immediately. This move underscores the corporationâ€™s commitment to structured urban development and efficient resource management.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay Updated on Biharâ€™s Development\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor regular updates on major projects like this, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of a 10,000+ strong global community. Stay ahead with real-time Bihar news!\u003c/p\u003e",
