        "content":  "\u003cp\u003ePatna Gears Up for Sepak Takraw World Cup â€“ A Historic First for Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet ready, sports lovers! For the first time ever, Bihar is hosting the Sepak Takraw World Cup, and the excitement is through the roof! The high-energy tournament will take place from March 20 to March 25 at the Pataliputra Sports Complex, Patna. With 19 nations competing, including powerhouses like Japan, USA, France, Brazil, and Thailand, this global event promises non-stop action.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrand Inauguration by CM Nitish Kumar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMark your calendar! On March 20 at 3:30 PM, Chief Minister Nitish Kumar will inaugurate the tournament at the Pataliputra Sports Complex Indoor Stadium. Before that, matches will kick off at 10 AM, setting the stage for six thrilling days of Sepak Takraw battles. Moreover, this event marks a significant moment for Biharâ€™s sporting history.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA New Era for Biharâ€™s Sports Scene\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar is making waves in the sports world, and this event is a giant leap forward. State Sports Minister Surendra Mehta recently unveiled the official jersey for Team India, featuring â€œBiharâ€ on it. Notably, this branding move, secured through a partnership between the Sepak Takraw Federation of India and the Bihar State Sports Authority, will continue for a year, significantly boosting Biharâ€™s sporting identity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTop Nations, Elite Athletes, and High-Octane Matches\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver 300 athletes and coaches have arrived in Patna, representing top-tier teams from Japan, Myanmar, Thailand, Malaysia, Iran, Vietnam, India, Brazil, Poland, France, Nepal, Sri Lanka, New Zealand, USA, Singapore, Switzerland, Indonesia, Italy, and Chinese Taipei. With 150+ matches lined up, expect electrifying encounters between the worldâ€™s best Sepak Takraw teams. Furthermore, each match is set to bring an intense display of skill and determination.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eState-of-the-Art Venue Ready for Action\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Pataliputra Sports Complex Indoor Stadium is all set, boasting cutting-edge LED lighting and world-class facilities. Every match will showcase breathtaking skills, speed, and strategy, keeping fans on the edge of their seats. Additionally, the venueâ€™s upgraded infrastructure ensures a seamless experience for players and spectators alike.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters for Bihar?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis tournament isnâ€™t just about sportsâ€”itâ€™s about putting Bihar on the global sports map. From local talents gaining exposure to international teams experiencing Biharâ€™s hospitality, this event is a game-changer. Moreover, this platform will inspire young athletes across the state to aim for excellence.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ’¥ Be Part of the Action! Stay updated with live scores, exclusive insights, and behind-the-scenes momentsâ€”follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 10k+ strong sports community worldwide!\u003c/p\u003e",
