        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar is making history! For the first time, the state is hosting the Sepaktakraw World Cup. India has already made a bold statement by defeating defending champions New Zealand 2-0. The thrilling tournament, running from March 20-25 at Patnaâ€™s Pataliputra Sports Complex, has brought together 20 countries. This has ignited excitement among sports enthusiasts worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Welcomes the World to Sepaktakraw 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe grand event kicked off as Biharâ€™s Chief Minister, Nitish Kumar, inaugurated the tournament. He expressed immense pride in Bihar for hosting such a prestigious international competition. The opening match had an electric atmosphere. Team India showcased exceptional skill and dominated New Zealand, securing a stunning victory.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Game-Changer for Biharâ€™s Sports Scene\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Sports Minister highlighted the governmentâ€™s commitment to promoting sports across the state. With initiatives reaching grassroots levels, young talents from villages are now being trained for national and international platforms. Hosting the Sepaktakraw World Cup in Bihar is a great honor. It is also a major boost for the stateâ€™s sporting future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Clash of Titans: 20 Countries, One Title\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver 300 players and coaches are participating in the tournament. Top teams from Japan, Thailand, Malaysia, Iran, Vietnam, Brazil, Poland, France, Nepal, Sri Lanka, and more are competing. This global event is set to deliver non-stop action and intense competition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters for Biharâ€™s Athletes\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis historic event is a golden opportunity for Biharâ€™s emerging players. The exposure to world-class teams and techniques will inspire them. It will also elevate local talent, positioning Bihar as a hub for international sports events in the future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the Action! Stay updated with every thrilling match, exclusive insights, and behind-the-scenes moments. Follow www.biharsay.com for regular updates. Become part of our 10k+ global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
