        "summary":  "Bihar Diwas 2025: A Grand Celebration of Culture, Development, and Innovation! Patnaâ€™s Gandhi Maidan Comes Alive with Festivities, Technology, and Cultural Heritage The air is electric at Patnaâ€™s historic Gandhi Maidan as Biha...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar Diwas 2025: A Grand Celebration of Culture, Development, and Innovation!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePatnaâ€™s Gandhi Maidan Comes Alive with Festivities, Technology, and Cultural Heritage\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe air is electric at Patnaâ€™s historic Gandhi Maidan as Bihar Diwas 2025 kicks off with a five-day celebration. Chief Minister Nitish Kumar, along with Deputy CMs Samrat Choudhary and Vijay Kumar Sinha, set the event in motion. They released balloons, officially marking the beginning of a grand spectacle.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis yearâ€™s theme, â€˜Unnat Bihar, Viksit Biharâ€™ (Advanced Bihar, Developed Bihar), reflects the stateâ€™s commitment to progress and innovation. With immersive exhibitions, high-tech displays, and a showcase of Biharâ€™s past and future, this event is a must-visit!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Spectacle of Heritage and Technology\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisitors are in for a treat as 3D replicas of Biharâ€™s most iconic landmarks create an immersive experience. These include Mahabodhi Temple, Nalanda University, Vishwa Shanti Stupa, and Takht Sri Harimandir Patna Sahib. Moreover, the Department of Art, Culture, and Youth Affairs has set up an engaging stall. It details achievements and future plans to boost Biharâ€™s cultural influence worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGovernment Schemes \u0026 Employment Opportunities\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNumerous government departments have installed stalls to provide firsthand information about ongoing schemes. Among them, the Labour Resources Department is drawing significant attention. It features a live model of the Centre of Excellence (CoE), developed in collaboration with Tata Tech. This high-tech hub showcases robotics, IoT, electric vehicles, 3D printing, and AR/VR technology. Notably, the goal is to equip Biharâ€™s youth with future-ready skills and job opportunities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTransport Departmentâ€™s Big Move\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Transport Department has taken an innovative approach. It has organized free vehicle check-ups, awareness programs, and an exhibition featuring electric vehicles, CNG models, and cutting-edge auto tech. Additionally, AI-driven demonstrations, puppet shows, and interactive exhibits emphasize road safety and accident prevention.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor students, thereâ€™s an exclusive bus pass offer to make travel more accessible and affordable. Furthermore, a painting and slogan-writing competition on road safety promises exciting rewards. Winners will receive helmets, keychains, and reflective bands!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Celebration That Inspires\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBefore the formal inauguration, CM Nitish Kumar explored the grand exhibition, which highlighted Biharâ€™s remarkable development journey. Additional Chief Secretary of the Education Department, Dr. S. Siddharth, welcomed him with a book. This moment symbolized Biharâ€™s commitment to knowledge and growth.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether youâ€™re passionate about Biharâ€™s culture, eager to explore its technological advancements, or simply looking for an enriching experience, Bihar Diwas 2025 offers something for everyone.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDonâ€™t miss out on the action! Stay updated with Biharâ€™s biggest events at www.biharsay.com. Join our thriving 10K+ community worldwide!\u003c/p\u003e",
