        "title":  "Ishan Kishanâ€™s Rise: From Patna to IPL Stardom!",
        "summary":  "Ishan Kishan 2.0: The Bihari Powerhouse Taking IPL 2024 by Storm! Born in Patna, raised with dreams bigger than boundariesâ€”Ishan Kishanâ€™s journey was never meant to be easy. Bihar didnâ€™t even have a recognized cricket associ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eIshan Kishan 2.0: The Bihari Powerhouse Taking IPL 2024 by Storm!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBorn in Patna, raised with dreams bigger than boundariesâ€”Ishan Kishanâ€™s journey was never meant to be easy. Bihar didnâ€™t even have a recognized cricket association when he was growing up. But raw talent always finds its way.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Journey of Grit and Glory\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIshan moved to Jharkhand, where he sharpened his skills. His relentless dedication soon made him the captain of Indiaâ€™s U-19 team in the 2016 World Cup. That was just the beginning.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIPL scouts quickly recognized his potential. Mumbai Indians believed in him, backing him as a rising star. With each passing season, he evolvedâ€”his fearless power-hitting, electrifying wicketkeeping, and fearless approach turned heads. Playing alongside legends, he mastered the art of finishing games.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStepping Up to the Big League\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHis performances didnâ€™t go unnoticed. Soon, he made his way into Team India. The cricketing world started talking about this young powerhouse from Bihar. His aggressive gameplay and never-say-die attitude made him a fan favorite.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA New Chapter: IPL 2024\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis season, Ishan Kishan found himself with a new franchise. And in his very first match, he made a bold statement.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs he walked in, the crowd roared. His intent was clear. The opposition had no answers to his brutal stroke play. Pulls, drives, lofted shotsâ€”each one was a declaration of dominance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIshan Kishan 2.0 is Here!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen he reached his milestone, he leaped in celebrationâ€”bat in one hand, helmet in the other. It was a sight to behold. Once an underdog from Bihar, he is now an IPL sensation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ”¥ Want to stay updated on Biharâ€™s rising sports stars? Follow www.biharsay.com and be part of our 10k+ global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
