        "title":  "Kundan Kumar Rai: The Color-Blind Artist Redefining Art",
        "summary":  "A Painter Who Couldnâ€™t See Colors Yet Created a Vivid World Imagine stepping into a world where colors blur into uncertainty. Now, imagine mastering the very art that depends on them. This is the story of Kundan Kumar Rai, a gif...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eA Painter Who Couldnâ€™t See Colors Yet Created a Vivid World\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine stepping into a world where colors blur into uncertainty. Now, imagine mastering the very art that depends on them. This is the story of Kundan Kumar Rai, a gifted artist from Magardahi, Samastipur, who turned his color blindness into a powerful artistic statement. Despite being unable to distinguish between shades like red, green, pink, brown, maroon, and blue, he has crafted a name in the world of art.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom His Motherâ€™s Feet to the Canvas\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKundanâ€™s artistic journey began in the most unusual wayâ€”by drawing designs on his motherâ€™s feet. As a child, he would create intricate patterns without realizing that he was setting the foundation for a lifelong passion. Over time, he honed his skills, painting not just festival-themed art but also deeply meaningful pieces, including one inspired by Indian-American astronaut Sunita Williamsâ€™ return capsule, depicted in the famous Madhubani painting style.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEducation, Corporate Life, and a Bold Return\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKundan completed his MBA from Nagpur and took up a private job. But when the COVID-19 pandemic struck and his mother fell ill, he returned home to care for her. After her passing, he decided against seeking another job and instead chose to follow his passion for art and motivation. Today, with relentless effort, he has carved out a niche in the art world.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSupport System \u0026 Vision for the Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo journey is ever truly alone. Whenever Kundan struggles with colors, his wife and sister step in to assist him, ensuring his vision translates flawlessly onto the canvas. His dream is to place Samastipur on the global art map, bringing international recognition to his hometown.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow Kundanâ€™s Story \u0026 Stay Inspired\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKundanâ€™s story is a testament to resilience, passion, and the power of belief. If he can paint his destiny against all odds, so can you!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin our 10K+ community for inspiring stories like these! Follow www.biharsay.com for regular updates.\u003c/p\u003e",
