        "title":  "\"Mera Joota Hai Bihari!\" â€“ How Biharâ€™s Shoes Marched Into Russiaâ€™s Army",
        "summary":  "Indiaâ€™s journey towards self-reliance in defense manufacturing has taken an exciting turn. From being an import-dependent nation, the country is now producing 65% of its defense equipment domestically. But the latest buzz? â€˜Ma...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eIndiaâ€™s journey towards self-reliance in defense manufacturing has taken an exciting turn. From being an import-dependent nation, the country is now producing 65% of its defense equipment domestically. But the latest buzz? â€˜Made in Biharâ€™ shoes are now marching with the Russian army! This is not just a win for Bihar but a testament to Indiaâ€™s growing dominance in global defense manufacturing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndiaâ€™s Defense Revolution: From Imports to Self-Reliance\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor years, India relied heavily on foreign suppliers for military gear. However, the â€˜Make in Indiaâ€™ initiative has transformed the landscape. According to a recent fact sheet from the Ministry of Defense, India recorded a staggering â‚¹1.27 lakh crore in defense production in 2023-24. By 2029, the country aims to reach â‚¹3 lakh crore, making India a global defense manufacturing powerhouse.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Footprint in Global Defense\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmong Indiaâ€™s growing defense exports, Bihar has emerged as an unexpected but significant player. â€˜Made in Biharâ€™ shoes have now found their place in the Russian armyâ€™s inventory. This shift highlights not only Biharâ€™s high-quality manufacturing standards but also Indiaâ€™s capability to compete globally.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Makes Biharâ€™s Shoes Special?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSuperior quality \u0026 durability fit for extreme conditions Affordable pricing compared to international brands Advanced manufacturing processes ensuring top performance\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndia-Russia Defense Collaboration\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndia and Russia share a long-standing defense partnership. From Sukhoi fighter jets to BrahMos missiles, the two nations have worked together on critical military projects. The inclusion of Bihar-made shoes in the Russian armyâ€™s supplies further strengthens this bond.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Else is India Exporting?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBulletproof jackets Chetak helicopters Dornier (DO-228) aircraft Light torpedoes \u0026 naval interceptors\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMassive Growth in Defense Investments\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo fuel this self-reliance, India has also opened up foreign direct investment (FDI) in the defense sector. Since 2020, up to 74% FDI is allowed through the automatic route, attracting â‚¹5,516.16 crore in investments so far.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe defense budget is also growing rapidly. From â‚¹2.53 lakh crore in 2013-14 to â‚¹6.81 lakh crore for 2025-26, the increase underscores Indiaâ€™s commitment to a robust military infrastructure.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Road Ahead for Biharâ€™s Manufacturing Industry\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith Bihar now on the global defense map, the potential for further growth is immense. Industries in the state can capitalize on this momentum by investing in:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdvanced manufacturing technologies Skilled labor training programs Government-backed export incentives\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis success story proves that Bihar is not just about history and cultureâ€”itâ€™s about innovation, resilience, and a powerful manufacturing future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant more such exciting updates? Follow www.biharsay.com and be a part of our 10K+ global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
