        "id":  "spreading-warmth-how-roti-bank-chhapra-ensures-no-one-sleeps-hungry",
        "title":  "This Bihar Teacher\u0027s \u0027Roti Bank\u0027 Ensures 200 People Get A Free Meal Daily",
        "summary":  "Spreading Warmth, One Meal at a Time: The Story of Roti Bank Chhapra Every night at 9 PM, when the city slows down, a team in Chhapra sets out on a missionâ€”to ensure no one sleeps hungry. What began as a simple act of kindness h...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eSpreading Warmth, One Meal at a Time: The Story of Roti Bank Chhapra\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery night at 9 PM, when the city slows down, a team in Chhapra sets out on a missionâ€”to ensure no one sleeps hungry. What began as a simple act of kindness has now become a beacon of hope for the homeless and hungry.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow One Teacherâ€™s Vision Turned into a Movement\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn April 2018, Ravi Shankar Upadhyay, a dedicated government school teacher, saw people going to bed hungry at railway stations and bus stops. The sight disturbed him, but instead of feeling helpless, he chose to act. Encouraged by his friend Abhay Pandey, he decided to make a difference.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn the first night, Ravi and his friends cooked food at home and walked 3 km to distribute just seven meal packets. Nervous yet determined, they feared how people might react. However, as soon as they handed out the food, all doubts vanishedâ€”their efforts brought instant gratitude. That moment sparked something bigger.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoti Bank Chhapra: More Than Just Food\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat started as a small initiative quickly grew into a full-fledged movement. Today, Roti Bank Chhapra runs a kitchen in Mohan Nagar, where volunteers cook, package, and distribute 200 meals daily. Every evening, they visit railway stations, bus stands, and hospitals, ensuring no one is left behind.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCommunity Kindness: How Locals Make a Difference\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe impact of Roti Bank Chhapra goes beyond the volunteers. The local community has embraced this mission wholeheartedly. Many residents donate food on special occasions, turning birthdays and anniversaries into opportunities for generosity. Their support proves that when kindness spreads, it multiplies.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the Movementâ€”Be the Change!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoti Bank Chhapra is not just about meals; itâ€™s about humanity. If you believe in the power of small acts of kindness, take action today. Visit www.biharsay.com for more inspiring stories and become part of our growing community of 10,000 changemakers worldwide!\u003c/p\u003e",
