        "summary":  "Gaya Gears Up for Khelo India Youth Games 2025: Grand Preparations Underway! The countdown has begun! Gaya is all set to host the much-anticipated Khelo India Youth Games (KIYG) 2025, a landmark event in Indiaâ€™s sports calendar....",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eGaya Gears Up for Khelo India Youth Games 2025: Grand Preparations Underway!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe countdown has begun! Gaya is all set to host the much-anticipated Khelo India Youth Games (KIYG) 2025, a landmark event in Indiaâ€™s sports calendar. With world-class preparations and meticulous planning, the city is ready to welcome athletes, coaches, and officials from across the nation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMajor Sporting Action in Gaya\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom May 5 to 11, 2025, Gaya will be one of the five host cities, alongside Patna, Nalanda (Rajgir), Bhagalpur, and Begusarai. The sporting events in Gaya will take place at the Indian Institute of Management-Bodh Gaya (IIM-BG) and the Bihar Institute of Public Administration and Rural Development. This prestigious event will bring together 1,074 athletes, 321 support staff, and 154 technical officials, making it one of the biggest sporting gatherings in the region.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHigh-Level Review Meeting Ensures Seamless Execution\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo ensure smooth operations, B Rajendra, Additional Chief Secretary of the Sports Department, reviewed the preparations. Ravindran Shankaran, Director General of Bihar State Sports Authority, Gaya District Magistrate Thiyagarajan S M, and IIM-BG Director Vinita S Sahay joined him in a crucial meeting. They discussed logistics, athlete accommodation, transport, security, and venue readiness.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWell-Structured Planning for Athletes \u0026 Officials\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAuthorities have formed 17 specialized working committees to handle essential aspects like lodging, food, transportation, sanitation, security, and event management. Each committee has assigned a nodal officer, ensuring accountability and efficiency. Senior district officials lead these teams, executing every arrangement with precision.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Gayaâ€™s Hosting of KIYG 2025 is Special\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoost to Local Sports Culture: Hosting a national event will inspire budding athletes from Bihar to pursue sports professionally. Economic Upliftment: The surge in visitors will drive growth for local businesses, hotels, and transport sectors. Enhanced Infrastructure: The cityâ€™s sports and public facilities are undergoing upgrades, ensuring long-term benefits for the local community.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhatâ€™s Next? Stay Updated!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAre you excited about KIYG 2025 in Gaya? Stay informed with exclusive insights, schedules, and behind-the-scenes action. Follow www.biharsay.com to be part of our 10k+ global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
