        "id":  "chaiti-chhath-the-festival-of-faith-healing-miracles",
        "title":  "Chaiti Chhath: The Festival of Faith, Healing \u0026 Miracles",
        "summary":  "Chaiti Chhath might not have the grandeur of Kartik Chhath, but its significance runs just as deep. This festival of faith, healing, and gratitude binds Biharis in unwavering devotion to the Sun God (Surya Dev). While Kartik Chhat...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eChaiti Chhath might not have the grandeur of Kartik Chhath, but its significance runs just as deep. This festival of faith, healing, and gratitude binds Biharis in unwavering devotion to the Sun God (Surya Dev). While Kartik Chhath in October-November steals the spotlight, Chaiti Chhath in March-April offers a more intimate and personal spiritual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSame Rituals, Different Essence\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoth Chhath festivals follow identical ritualsâ€”strict fasting, holy dips in the river, and prayers to the setting and rising sun. However, the difference lies in their essence. Kartik Chhath is a grand community celebration. In contrast, Chaiti Chhath is often observed by families and individuals who couldnâ€™t perform the Kartik rituals or seek immediate divine blessings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Festival of Healing and Miracles\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMany believe Chaiti Chhath is more than a festivalâ€”it is a path to healing. Devotees observe it to seek relief from ailments, financial struggles, and mental distress. Those who have experienced the divine intervention of Surya Dev continue this tradition with unshaken faith.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Resurgence of Chaiti Chhath\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith changing times, Chaiti Chhath is seeing renewed devotion. While Kartik Chhath remains dominant, more people realize that faith is not about the season but about the soulâ€™s call. The festival is growing, proving that devotion transcends time and tradition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHave you ever experienced the divine blessings of Chaiti Chhath? Share your story in the comments! Follow www.biharsay.com for more updates and become part of our 10K-strong global community.\u003c/p\u003e",
