        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Sweetest Legacy: How Golden Ice Cream Became a Household Name Since 1948!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn the lanes of Bihar and the hearts of Biharis, one name reigns supremeâ€”Golden Ice Cream. More than just a brand, itâ€™s a sweet emotion, evoking childhood summers, late-night cravings, and family celebrations. Since 1948, this iconic ice cream has been a part of Biharâ€™s cultural fabric, serving generations with its unparalleled taste and quality.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Legacy Carved in Ice Cream\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ¦ Golden Ice Cream holds the prestigious title of Eastern Indiaâ€™s first organized ice cream manufacturer. When packaged frozen desserts were a novelty, Golden was already creating magic with its creamy delights. Today, with over 75 years of trust, it remains a household favorite, not through flashy marketing but through consistency, quality, and deep-rooted local love.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Makes Golden Ice Cream Stand Out?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâœ… ISO 22000:2005 Certified â€“ Quality isnâ€™t just a promise; itâ€™s the standard.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ† Award-Winning Excellence â€“ Recognized by the Government of Bihar for its contributions to the stateâ€™s industry.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ« Homegrown Innovation â€“ From exotic Belgium Dark Chocolate to the classic Malai Rabri and American Nuts, Golden blends international flavors with beloved Indian favorites.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ¤ï¸ Generational Fanbase â€“ Customers spanning decades swear by its creamy richness, unmatched by any competitor.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom Local Favorite to Statewide Phenomenon\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGolden Dairy Products Pvt. Ltd. has not just survived but thrived, evolving with the times. With a state-of-the-art automatic manufacturing plant in Patliputra Industrial Area, the brand has expanded while maintaining its original richness. Today, its strong distribution network ensures that no craving goes unanswered across Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTaste the Legacy\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNext time youâ€™re in Bihar, skip the imports and indulge in nostalgia. Experience the taste that generations have cherished because nothing hits the spot like a scoop of Golden!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Follow www.biharsay.com for more updates and become part of the 10K+ community worldwide!\u003c/p\u003e",
