        "summary":  "âœˆï¸ Purnia Takes Off This Independence Day: Air Travel, Expressway \u0026 Development Boom Incoming! Purnia is Soaringâ€”Literally and Figuratively! Come 15th August, a new chapter begins in Biharâ€™s transformation journey as Purni...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eâœˆï¸ Purnia Takes Off This Independence Day: Air Travel, Expressway \u0026 Development Boom Incoming!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePurnia is Soaringâ€”Literally and Figuratively!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCome 15th August, a new chapter begins in Biharâ€™s transformation journey as Purnia will finally take flightâ€”literally! Deputy Chief Minister Samrat Chaudhary announced that air services from Purnia will kick off on Independence Day. This isnâ€™t just big newsâ€”itâ€™s a turning point.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a state thatâ€™s hustling hard toward connectivity and opportunity, this step unlocks the skies for Purniaâ€™s people. Imagine boarding a flight from Purnia without travelling to Patna or Bagdogra. That future? Itâ€™s arriving in a few months.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3 Hours to Patna? The Game-Changing Purniaâ€“Patna Expressway\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLetâ€™s talk roadways now. With the â‚¹6000 crore Patnaâ€“Purnia Expressway under construction, travel time between the two major cities will shrink to just 3 hours.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isnâ€™t just infrastructure; itâ€™s access. It means faster commutes, stronger business ties, smoother emergency transfers, and overall, a smarter, more connected Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd guess what? This mega project is fully greenlit by the Centre. Progress is no longer a promise. Itâ€™s here, itâ€™s visible, and itâ€™s moving fast.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeyond Roads and Runways: Full-On Development in Motion\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Kishanganjâ€™s K Nagar block, plans are also underway for a cold storage facility for vegetablesâ€”ideal for storing high-volume produce efficiently. And thatâ€™s not all. A new degree college is on the cards too, bringing education right to the doorstep of aspiring students in the region.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMeanwhile, the State Government is pushing hard on dairy development, aiming to open milk production centres in every block of Bihar. Thatâ€™s a bold and inclusive move for rural upliftment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Management That Works: From Kosi to Mechi\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor too long, Biharâ€™s floods have been a recurring nightmare. But now, the Centre has finally approved the Kosi-Mechi River Interlinking Project, designed to provide long-term relief from annual flooding.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdd to that the Khargpur-Reservoir and Ganga Water Supply Projects, and you have a blueprint for lasting water security. Already, Deputy CM Samrat Chaudhary and Water Resources Minister Vijay Kumar Chaudhary have surveyed major zones like Khargpur Lake and Barnaar Reservoir.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFestivals, Future \u0026 Full Speed Ahead\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom inaugurating the Rajkiya Maa Kamakhya Mahotsav to overseeing critical reviews in places like Bhawanipur Panchayat, the government is pushing development at every level. Ministers like Leshi Singh and Vijay Kumar Chaudhary are actively steering forward momentum.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake no mistakeâ€”Bihar is not what it was five years ago. Under the leadership of CM Nitish Kumar, a new Bihar is being built on pillars of connectivity, self-sufficiency, and opportunity for all.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ’¥ Real Progress is Happening â€” and You Deserve to Know First!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe wheels of change are already in motionâ€”from the skies above to the rivers below, from roads to education, and from agriculture to aviation. And this is just the beginning.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow www.biharsay.com for daily, real-time updates on Biharâ€™s growth stories. Be part of our growing family of 10,000+ followers worldwide who believe in a better, stronger, and smarter Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTags:air travel from Purnia Bihar development news Cold Storage Bihar dairy growth Bihar Kishanganj development Kosi-Mechi project Nitish Kumar Bihar Purnia Expressway Purnia flights Purnia infrastructure Samrat Chaudhary\u003c/p\u003e",
