        "id":  "begusarais-25-year-transformation-from-river-crossings-to-rail-road-connectivity",
        "title":  "Begusaraiâ€™s 25-Year Transformation: From River Crossings to Rail-Road Connectivity",
        "summary":  "Begusaraiâ€™s 25-Year Transformation: From River Crossings to Rail-Road Connectivity What was once a journey across the Ganges by boat is now a seamless drive or train ride across a modern rail-road bridge. Yes, you read that righ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBegusaraiâ€™s 25-Year Transformation: From River Crossings to Rail-Road Connectivity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat was once a journey across the Ganges by boat is now a seamless drive or train ride across a modern rail-road bridge. Yes, you read that rightâ€”Sahebpur Kamal in Begusarai has redefined its identity over the past 25 years. From infrastructure to education, and healthcare to connectivity, this region has become a living example of Biharâ€™s silent yet powerful transformation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Game-Changer: Shri Krishna Setu\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLetâ€™s rewind to 12th March 2016, a date now etched in Begusaraiâ€™s history. On this day, Prime Minister Narendra Modi inaugurated the 3.8 km long Shri Krishna Setu, a rail-cum-road bridge that connects Sahebpur Kamal (Begusarai) to Munger. But did you know the journey began way back in 2001, when Atal Bihari Vajpayee laid the foundation for this visionary project?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter facing numerous delays and hurdles, the bridge finally stood tallâ€”transforming travel and trade across the region. Later, in February 2022, CM Nitish Kumar and Union Minister Nitin Gadkari inaugurated the approach road (333B) that completed the connectivity dream.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Bridge Mattered So Much\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEarlier, people from Begusarai, Khagaria, Saharsa, and even Maheshkhunt had only one optionâ€”cross the Ganges in small boats to reach Munger. Dangerous, time-consuming, and weather-dependent. Today, Shri Krishna Setu saves lives, time, and opens up limitless opportunities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith â‚¹2,774 crore invested, 32 pillars standing strong, and a width of 60 feet, this isnâ€™t just a bridgeâ€”itâ€™s a symbol of regional pride and progress.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAn Education Revolution in Sahebpur Kamal\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe development didnâ€™t stop at roads. Sahebpur Kamal has made giant strides in education. Every Panchayat now has Plus Two education facilities. But the real game-changer came in 2022, when:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAn ITI (Industrial Training Institute) was launched in Sadpur East Panchayat An ANM (Auxiliary Nurse Midwifery) College opened for aspiring healthcare workers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAn ITI (Industrial Training Institute) was launched in Sadpur East Panchayat\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAn ANM (Auxiliary Nurse Midwifery) College opened for aspiring healthcare workers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStudents now train in trades like Electrician, Fitter, Electronics, Mechanical, IT, Welder, and Diesel Mechanic. Currently, over 200 students are enrolled across ITI programs, while the ANM college trains 109 girl students. Thereâ€™s even a hostel nearby for female students, making higher education accessible and safer for all.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHealthcare, Cleanliness \u0026 Community Development\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeyond education and connectivity, the Panchayats of Sahebpur Kamal are embracing modern living:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGarbage management centers have been built PACS buildings (Primary Agricultural Credit Society) support local agriculture Access to primary, middle, and high schools is now a reality across the block\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGarbage management centers have been built\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePACS buildings (Primary Agricultural Credit Society) support local agriculture\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccess to primary, middle, and high schools is now a reality across the block\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll these achievements reflect a larger shift toward dignity, empowerment, and modernityâ€”values that are shaping Biharâ€™s rural landscape.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocal Leadership and Regional Pride\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLetâ€™s not forget the people behind the progress. MLA Sattanand Sambuddha, a native of Phulmalik Panchayat, continues to champion development in Sahebpur Kamal under the RJD banner.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant more stories like this?Stay connected with the heart of Bihar. Follow ðŸ‘‰ www.biharsay.com for real-time updates and join our fast-growing community of 10,000+ global readers.\u003c/p\u003e",
