        "summary":  "Now Travel Easy: Chhapra to Mumbai Summer Special Train Announced Indian Railways has just gifted something special to thousands of travelers between Chhapra and Mumbai. Starting this April, a weekly summer special train (Train No...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eNow Travel Easy: Chhapra to Mumbai Summer Special Train Announced\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndian Railways has just gifted something special to thousands of travelers between Chhapra and Mumbai. Starting this April, a weekly summer special train (Train No. 01029/01030) will run between Chhapra and Lokmanya Tilak Terminus, offering greater convenience, comfort, and connectivity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis summer special is a game-changer for those commuting across Bihar, UP, MP, and Maharashtra.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen Will This Train Run?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLetâ€™s get the schedule straight:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTrain No. 01029 (Lokmanya Tilak Terminus to Chhapra) Runs Every Sunday from April 13 to May 25 Departs from LTT at 10:55 PM Reaches Chhapra by 1:15 PM on Tuesday Train No. 01030 (Chhapra to Lokmanya Tilak Terminus) Runs Every Tuesday from April 15 to May 27 Leaves Chhapra at 7:00 PM Arrives at LTT by 8:00 AM on Thursday\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTrain No. 01029 (Lokmanya Tilak Terminus to Chhapra)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns Every Sunday from April 13 to May 25 Departs from LTT at 10:55 PM Reaches Chhapra by 1:15 PM on Tuesday\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns Every Sunday from April 13 to May 25\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeparts from LTT at 10:55 PM\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReaches Chhapra by 1:15 PM on Tuesday\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTrain No. 01030 (Chhapra to Lokmanya Tilak Terminus)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns Every Tuesday from April 15 to May 27 Leaves Chhapra at 7:00 PM Arrives at LTT by 8:00 AM on Thursday\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRuns Every Tuesday from April 15 to May 27\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLeaves Chhapra at 7:00 PM\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArrives at LTT by 8:00 AM on Thursday\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerfect for weekend planning and long-distance family trips, isnâ€™t it?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhatâ€™s the Route?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis train covers a major cross-section of India. Hereâ€™s the key route:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom Mumbai (LTT) through Thane, Kalyan, Nashik Road, Jalgaon, Bhusaval, and Itarsi Then onto Jabalpur, Katni, Satna, Manikpur, Prayagraj Chheoki, and Varanasi Finally, via Jaunpur, Aunrihar, Ghazipur City, Ballia, it reaches Chhapra\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom Mumbai (LTT) through Thane, Kalyan, Nashik Road, Jalgaon, Bhusaval, and Itarsi\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThen onto Jabalpur, Katni, Satna, Manikpur, Prayagraj Chheoki, and Varanasi\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFinally, via Jaunpur, Aunrihar, Ghazipur City, Ballia, it reaches Chhapra\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe return route follows the same track, in reverse.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCoach Composition: Comfort All the Way\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlanning a comfortable summer trip? Hereâ€™s why this train fits the bill:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e8 AC II Tier Coaches 10 AC III Tier Coaches 2 Luggage-Cum-Generator Vans\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e8 AC II Tier Coaches\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 AC III Tier Coaches\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2 Luggage-Cum-Generator Vans\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn total, 20 coaches designed to make long travel not just possibleâ€”but pleasant.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso Extended: 6 Other Train Services\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Eastern Central Railway has also extended services of 6 special trains, including the popular Sampark Kranti Clone Special. Some key highlights:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRajendra Nagarâ€“New Delhi Clone Special (02393): Now runs 6 days a week (except Thursday) till June 30 Deolaliâ€“Danapur Mixed Unreserved Special: Extended till October 18 Saharsaâ€“Lalitgram Special: Operational every Thursday till July 31\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRajendra Nagarâ€“New Delhi Clone Special (02393): Now runs 6 days a week (except Thursday) till June 30\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeolaliâ€“Danapur Mixed Unreserved Special: Extended till October 18\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSaharsaâ€“Lalitgram Special: Operational every Thursday till July 31\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese extended schedules mean more options and better frequency for travelers from Bihar and beyond.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery summer, thousands head west for work, family, or better opportunities. This new service is not just a transport updateâ€”itâ€™s a lifeline, especially for migrant workers and families in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMoreover, the availability of AC coaches and a predictable schedule brings much-needed comfort and reliability to long-distance train travel.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸŒ Stay Updated with BiharSay\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant more such real-time travel updates and important local news from Bihar?ðŸ”” Follow www.biharsay.com and become a part of our growing community of 10k+ engaged readers worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLetâ€™s make Biharâ€™s stories reach every corner of the globeâ€”together!\u003c/p\u003e",
