        "title":  "Biharâ€™s Makhana Gets US FDA Approval â€“ MoSo International Leads Export to America",
        "summary":  "Katiharâ€™s Makhana Heads to USA After Securing Prestigious FDA Approval â€“ A Milestone Moment for Indiaâ€™s Superfood Industry!Read full blog to know how one company from rural Bihar is changing the global snack gameâ€¦ Biharâ€™...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eKatiharâ€™s Makhana Heads to USA After Securing Prestigious FDA Approval â€“ A Milestone Moment for Indiaâ€™s Superfood Industry!Read full blog to know how one company from rural Bihar is changing the global snack gameâ€¦\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Makhana Goes Global â€“ Thanks to MoSo International!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a powerful leap for Indian agriculture, MoSo International Private Limited, a Katihar-based company from Kodha block, has received the coveted US FDA (Food and Drug Administration) license. This breakthrough has not only opened global doors for the regional superfood â€“ Makhana â€“ but also marked a historic moment for Indiaâ€™s food export industry.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‡®ðŸ‡³ From Fields of Bihar to Shelves of America\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isnâ€™t just about a license. Itâ€™s a symbol of pride, perseverance, and progress.Mr. Gul Raj, Director of MoSo International, shared that this achievement is the outcome of years of hard work by thousands of farmers and stakeholders in the Makhana value chain.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œThis license is a recognition of the hard work put in by every hand that cultivated Makhana in Bihar. We aim to position Makhana as a healthy, premium snack across global markets,â€ said Gul Raj.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œThis license is a recognition of the hard work put in by every hand that cultivated Makhana in Bihar. We aim to position Makhana as a healthy, premium snack across global markets,â€ said Gul Raj.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Does the US FDA License Mean?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReceiving the US FDA license means Makhana from Bihar now meets the stringent quality standards of the United States.Now, direct export of Makhana to America is not only possible but actively in process. This paves the way for international markets to embrace Indiaâ€™s traditional superfood as a guilt-free, nutritious snack.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters â€“ A Win for Rural India\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis success holds immense value for Indiaâ€™s farmers, especially those in rural Bihar, where Makhana cultivation is a major livelihood.With global markets opening up, prices are likely to improve, demand will surge, and employment opportunities will rise for thousands of workers associated with its processing and packaging.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMoreover, with America on board, other countries are more likely to follow, giving Indian Makhana the global identity it truly deserves.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Vision Beyond Business\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMoSo International isnâ€™t stopping here. With a mission to rebrand Makhana as a global health snack, the company plans to launch its products in US markets soon. These products will highlight Indian origin, organic cultivation, and nutritional richness.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhatâ€™s Next?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis win is just the beginning. With focused branding, improved packaging, and global collaborations, Biharâ€™s Makhana may soon become the quinoa or chia of the East!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant to stay updated with more inspiring stories like this from Biharâ€™s heartland?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Follow www.biharsay.com for daily updates and become part of a growing global community of 11,000+ readers!\u003c/p\u003e",
