        "title":  "Patna Road Update: Bihta to JP Ganga Path Road Expansion Underway â€“ Full Details Inside",
        "summary":  "A Big Roadshift Is Coming. Are You Ready for a Smoother Ride in Patna? Patnaâ€™s roads are about to tell a new storyâ€”and it begins with Behta to Maner. While everyone was watching the skyways and flyovers, a quieter revolution h...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eA Big Roadshift Is Coming. Are You Ready for a Smoother Ride in Patna?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePatnaâ€™s roads are about to tell a new storyâ€”and it begins with Behta to Maner. While everyone was watching the skyways and flyovers, a quieter revolution has taken shape below. Itâ€™s not just constructionâ€”itâ€™s Bihar, building momentum!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Clear Route to the Future: Whatâ€™s Happening?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bihar government, under the leadership of CM Nitish Kumar, is accelerating infrastructure projects in Patna to transform urban mobility. As part of this mission, the Detailed Project Report (DPR) for widening the crucial Behtaâ€“Maner route is ready.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis 22-kilometer stretch will soon be expanded to 14 meters, connecting smoothly to JP Ganga Pathâ€”one of Patnaâ€™s most ambitious expressway projects. The move is not just about width; itâ€™s about opening up ease, time, and economic opportunity for thousands of daily commuters.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBig Budget, Bigger Impact\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith an expected investment of â‚¹70 crore, the widened Behta-Danapur-Maner route will boost connectivity towards Ara and Buxar. Until JP Ganga Path extends to Koilwar, this widened stretch will serve as a strategic alternative, helping ease traffic and save hours of travel time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMoreover, the upcoming Danapur-Bihta Elevated Road will further reduce congestion, marking a new chapter in Patnaâ€™s west zone development.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNot Just Oneâ€”Three Roads Are Set for a Makeover\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isnâ€™t a one-road story. The state government has placed Patna West Path Pramandal in charge of executing three crucial road expansions:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâœ…Gola Road Expansion\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCurrently just 7.5 meters wide, Gola Roadâ€”connecting Nehru Path (Bailey Road)â€”will soon feature dual 7-meter lanes. With a budget of â‚¹20 crore, the project includes proper drainage, dividers, and sidewalks to ease traffic and prevent flooding.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâœ… Khagaulâ€“Digha Nahar Road\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlans are underway to turn this canal-side road into a 14-meter-wide four-lane route. At a cost of â‚¹70 crore, the project requires relocating schools in Chulhaichak and Kothwa villages. Authorities will also remove encroachments and mark land boundaries by May.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTime-Bound Execution with No Loose Ends\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDistrict Magistrate Dr. Chandrashekhar Singh has assured timely execution. The tender process is almost complete. Temporary encroachments on government land will be dealt with strictlyâ€”legal notices will follow if deadlines are missed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese arenâ€™t just plans on paper. These are real steps being taken, with deadlines, budgets, and local accountability.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat This Means for Patnaâ€™s Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBetter roads lead to better lives. From reducing travel time to boosting local business and easing school commutes, these changes will touch every Patnaiteâ€™s life. Once completed, these roads will serve as milestones in Patnaâ€™s journey towards becoming a modern, well-connected city.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut this isnâ€™t the endâ€”Patnaâ€™s infrastructure growth is just warming up.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant to know whatâ€™s next in Biharâ€™s road revolution?Follow www.BiharSay.com for real-time updates and become a part of our growing 11k-strong global community that believes in Biharâ€™s better future!\u003c/p\u003e",
