        "title":  "Muzaffarpur Airport Expansion to Benefit 2 Crore People",
        "summary":  "à¤…à¤¬ à¤ªà¤Ÿà¤¨à¤¾-à¤¦à¤°à¤­à¤‚à¤—à¤¾ à¤¨à¤¹à¥€à¤‚! Muzaffarpur Airport à¤¸à¥‡ à¤­à¤°à¥‡à¤‚ à¤‰à¤¡à¤¼à¤¾à¤¨ â€“ 2 à¤•à¤°à¥‹à¤¡à¤¼ à¤²à¥‹à¤—à¥‹à¤‚ à¤•à¥‹ à¤®à¤¿à¤²à¥‡à¤—à¤¾ à¤¸à¥€à¤§à¤¾ à¤«à¤¾à¤¯à¤¦à¤¾ Muzaffarpur Airport to Soar ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eà¤…à¤¬ à¤ªà¤Ÿà¤¨à¤¾-à¤¦à¤°à¤­à¤‚à¤—à¤¾ à¤¨à¤¹à¥€à¤‚! Muzaffarpur Airport à¤¸à¥‡ à¤­à¤°à¥‡à¤‚ à¤‰à¤¡à¤¼à¤¾à¤¨ â€“ 2 à¤•à¤°à¥‹à¤¡à¤¼ à¤²à¥‹à¤—à¥‹à¤‚ à¤•à¥‹ à¤®à¤¿à¤²à¥‡à¤—à¤¾ à¤¸à¥€à¤§à¤¾ à¤«à¤¾à¤¯à¤¦à¤¾\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMuzaffarpur Airport to Soar High: A Game-Changer for North Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine boarding a flight directly from Muzaffarpur instead of navigating long and tiring journeys to Patna or Darbhanga. This long-awaited dream is finally coming true. North Bihar is ready to take flight, bringing with it renewed hope, better connectivity, and regional progress.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Airport Expansion Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe once-underutilized Patahi Airport in Muzaffarpur is now at the heart of a significant infrastructure development plan. With 475 acres of land acquisition underway, the expansion is set to benefit more than 2 crore people living across North Bihar. The project stretches its impact far beyond Muzaffarpur, covering districts such as Sitamarhi, Shivhar, Gopalganj, East Champaran, and West Champaran.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis development received a boost when Biharâ€™s Deputy Chief Minister, Samrat Chaudhary, during his recent Muzaffarpur visit, confirmed that the Central Government has approved the airport expansion. The process has officially begun.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Boost for Business, Tourism, and Everyday Life\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe launch of air services from Muzaffarpur is expected to transform local life in multiple ways. People previously relied on Patna or Darbhanga airports, often losing valuable time and money. With flights soon taking off from Muzaffarpur itself, this inconvenience will no longer exist.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe expected benefits include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnhanced regional connectivity A surge in small business and local industries More footfall for tourist attractions in North Bihar Improved job opportunities in aviation, retail, and logistics sectors\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnhanced regional connectivity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA surge in small business and local industries\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore footfall for tourist attractions in North Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImproved job opportunities in aviation, retail, and logistics sectors\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isnâ€™t just about convenience. Itâ€™s about unlocking economic potential, making North Bihar visible on the aviation map, and offering local communities the growth they deserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho Will Benefit the Most?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccording to the 2011 Census, Muzaffarpur had a population of around 3.5 lakh, which has now grown to an estimated 5.16 lakh. However, the real impact is broader. The combined population of Muzaffarpur and its surrounding districts touches 2 crore. These are the people who stand to gain from shorter travel times, better business prospects, and increased civic pride.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLand acquisition for the airport spans five villages, and the government has already submitted the proposal to the District Land Acquisition Office. With construction likely to begin soon, the local economy is expected to see a major uplift. Traders, entrepreneurs, and service providers will all find themselves closer to opportunities, customers, and suppliers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isnâ€™t just a developmentâ€”itâ€™s a turning point for North Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant to stay ahead of such powerful stories transforming Bihar every day?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow www.biharsay.com for more such regular updates and become part of our 11K+ community worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e",
