        "title":  "BCCI Central Contract 2025: Biharâ€™s Ishan Kishan, Mukesh Kumar \u0026 Akash Deep Included",
        "summary":  "ðŸ”¥ â€œBiharâ€™s Big 3 Make History: Ishan Kishan, Mukesh Kumar \u0026 Akash Deep Bag BCCI Central Contracts 2025!â€ Biharâ€™s Cricketing Glory Just Got Real! For decades, young cricket enthusiasts in Bihar have dreamt of seeing thei...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eðŸ”¥ â€œBiharâ€™s Big 3 Make History: Ishan Kishan, Mukesh Kumar \u0026 Akash Deep Bag BCCI Central Contracts 2025!â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Cricketing Glory Just Got Real!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor decades, young cricket enthusiasts in Bihar have dreamt of seeing their names shine in Indian cricket. Today, that dream feels more achievable than ever. With Ishan Kishan, Mukesh Kumar, and Akash Deep securing spots in the BCCI Central Contract 2025 (Grade C), Bihar is no longer on the sidelines â€” itâ€™s stepping into the spotlight.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLetâ€™s dive into what this means, why it matters, and how these three trailblazers are rewriting Biharâ€™s cricketing story.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat is the BCCI Central Contract?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Board of Control for Cricket in India (BCCI) issues annual central contracts to top-performing cricketers. These contracts offer both financial security and official recognition. Players are divided into three grades:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrade A: â‚¹7 crore Grade B: â‚¹3 crore Grade C: â‚¹1 crore\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrade A: â‚¹7 crore\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrade B: â‚¹3 crore\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrade C: â‚¹1 crore\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn 2025, Bihar proudly celebrates as three of its own â€“ Ishan Kishan, Mukesh Kumar, and Akash Deep â€“ land in Grade C. And this is just the beginning.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIshan Kishan: A Comeback That Roared\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHailing from Patna, Ishan Kishan made headlines with his electrifying 106-run knock in IPL 2025. This was not just a comeback; it was a statement.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBack in 2023, he stepped away from domestic cricket due to mental health challenges and was dropped from the contract list. But Ishan didnâ€™t give up. With courage and determination, he made a roaring return this season â€” earning back his place and reminding everyone why heâ€™s a force in Indian cricket.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMukesh Kumar: From Gopalganj to Global\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMukesh Kumarâ€˜s rise has been nothing short of meteoric. Making his international debut during the 2023 West Indies tour, he delivered standout performances across Tests, ODIs, and T20Is.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHis consistent pace, deadly yorkers, and calm composure under pressure earned him praise from senior pros and selectors alike. With this contract, Mukesh has officially become a trusted pace option for Team India â€” a journey rooted in Gopalganjâ€™s soil and powered by national ambition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAkash Deep: Rohtasâ€™ Answer to Indiaâ€™s Pace Attack\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAkash Deep, from Rohtas, turned heads during the 2024 England series. On his Test debut, he scalped 3 crucial wickets and proved he could handle pressure with style.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHis fiery spells and aggressive line-and-length approach make him a future star in Indiaâ€™s pace department. The central contract is a testament to his hard work, and it signals that heâ€™s here to stay.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Biharâ€™s Representation in Indian Cricket Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor years, states like Mumbai and Delhi dominated Indian cricket. Bihar, despite its immense talent, struggled for representation. But thatâ€™s changing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe inclusion of these three players sends a powerful message â€” talent has no postcode. It shows that with dedication, even players from non-traditional cricketing hubs can break into the national spotlight.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd when these players succeed, they bring hope and motivation to thousands of youngsters training in Biharâ€™s dusty grounds and modest academies.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBCCIâ€™s Renewed Focus on Regional Talent\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis yearâ€™s contracts reflect a clear shift in the BCCIâ€™s scouting strategy. Theyâ€™re no longer just looking at metros â€” theyâ€™re diving into heartland India, discovering hidden gems.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlayers like Ishan, Mukesh, and Akash are examples of what happens when opportunity meets preparation. Itâ€™s a win for regional cricket, and Bihar is leading that charge.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat This Means for Bihar Cricketâ€™s Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe achievements of these players arenâ€™t isolated events. They are spark plugs for Biharâ€™s cricketing engine. With improved infrastructure, better coaching, and rising awareness, more players from the state are getting noticed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeâ€™re witnessing a quiet revolution â€” and itâ€™s only going to get louder.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo if youâ€™re a young cricketer from Sitamarhi, Gaya, Bhagalpur, or Araria â€” the stage is set. Bihar is watching. India is waiting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Want to stay in the loop about more such proud moments and sports updates from Bihar?Join our 11K+ strong global community at www.biharsay.com and never miss a beat!\u003c/p\u003e",
