        "id":  "muzaffarpur-shahi-litchi-goes-nationwide-with-blinkit",
        "title":  "Muzaffarpur Shahi Litchi Goes Nationwide with Blinkit",
        "summary":  "Biharâ€™s Juicy Gem Gets a Blinkit Boost! Ever imagined biting into a farm-fresh Muzaffarpur Shahi litchi in Mumbai or Bengaluruâ€”just 30 minutes after craving it? Well, itâ€™s happening now! In a game-changing move, Blinkit has ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Juicy Gem Gets a Blinkit Boost!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEver imagined biting into a farm-fresh Muzaffarpur Shahi litchi in Mumbai or Bengaluruâ€”just 30 minutes after craving it? Well, itâ€™s happening now!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a game-changing move, Blinkit has teamed up with the Bihar Litchi Association to ensure that up to 12 tonnes of Muzaffarpurâ€™s iconic Shahi litchis will be dispatched daily to metros across India. This partnership, signed on April 17, 2025, is not only making a juicy promise to fruit lovers but is also rewriting the future for litchi farmers in North Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Historic Deal Signed in Mushahari\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt the scenic National Litchi Research Centre in Mushahari, Blinkitâ€™s Marketing Head Sarthak Jain and Bachha Prasad Singh, President of the Bihar Litchi Association, sealed this transformative deal.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTheir goal\u0027o make Muzaffarpurâ€™s Shahi litchi available in major cities like Delhi, Mumbai, Bangalore, Kolkata, and more â€” all while eliminating middlemen and ensuring fair prices for farmers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œThis collaboration means our farmers can directly supply fresh litchis from the orchards, and receive fairer prices without the middlemen,â€ said Bachha Prasad Singh.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œThis collaboration means our farmers can directly supply fresh litchis from the orchards, and receive fairer prices without the middlemen,â€ said Bachha Prasad Singh.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat This Means for Farmers and Consumers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor farmers, this deal guarantees:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDirect market access Improved income Fast and efficient logistics End-to-end support through Bihar Litchi Association\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDirect market access\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImproved income\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFast and efficient logistics\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnd-to-end support through Bihar Litchi Association\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor consumers, especially in urban India:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e30-minute doorstep delivery of farm-fresh litchis Premium quality guaranteed via Blinkitâ€™s fast-track logistics A chance to support sustainable farming practices from Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e30-minute doorstep delivery of farm-fresh litchis\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePremium quality guaranteed via Blinkitâ€™s fast-track logistics\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA chance to support sustainable farming practices from Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComing Up Next: Direct Procurement Camps\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe partnership doesnâ€™t stop here.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA follow-up meeting in May will set the stage for Blinkit to establish procurement camps across the region. This step will help source litchis directly from local orchards, cutting down delays and maximizing freshness.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKey players present at the Mushahari meet included:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeepak Mishra, Director of Mohi Group Sagar, Representative from Blinkit Members of the Litchi Utpadak Sangh\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeepak Mishra, Director of Mohi Group\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSagar, Representative from Blinkit\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMembers of the Litchi Utpadak Sangh\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters: Biharâ€™s Pride Goes Pan-India\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Muzaffarpur Shahi litchi, with its juicy pulp, rich aroma, and GI tag, has always been a crown jewel of Biharâ€™s fruit heritage. But this deal finally gives it the infrastructure and exposure it deserves.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith Blinkit on board, the world-famous fruit isnâ€™t just a seasonal delight anymore â€” itâ€™s a nationwide sensation in the making.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ’¬ Want to stay updated with more such real-time breakthroughs from Bihar?Join the growing tribe of 11k readers from around the world â€” follow www.biharsay.com for daily updates and inspirational stories that matter.\u003c/p\u003e",
