        "title":  "Bihar to Build 14,000 KM Rural Roads",
        "summary":  "à¤œà¤¬ à¤—à¤¾à¤à¤µà¥‹à¤‚ à¤¤à¤• à¤ªà¤¹à¥à¤‚à¤šà¥‡à¤—à¥€ à¤ªà¤•à¥à¤•à¥€ à¤¸à¤¡à¤¼à¤•à¥‡à¤‚, à¤¤à¤¬ à¤šà¤®à¤•à¥‡à¤—à¤¾ à¤¬à¤¿à¤¹à¤¾à¤°! In a historic move, the Bihar government has greenlit the construction and maintenance of 14,...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eà¤œà¤¬ à¤—à¤¾à¤à¤µà¥‹à¤‚ à¤¤à¤• à¤ªà¤¹à¥à¤‚à¤šà¥‡à¤—à¥€ à¤ªà¤•à¥à¤•à¥€ à¤¸à¤¡à¤¼à¤•à¥‡à¤‚, à¤¤à¤¬ à¤šà¤®à¤•à¥‡à¤—à¤¾ à¤¬à¤¿à¤¹à¤¾à¤°!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a historic move, the Bihar government has greenlit the construction and maintenance of 14,000 kilometers of rural roads under Gramin Path Yojana Phase-2. This decision, taken by the Cabinet, promises to bring a wave of progress to every corner of Bihar!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e14,000 KM Rural Roads: A Giant Step for Bihar!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnder the Mukhyamantri Gram Sampark Yojana, the government will connect all settlements with populations over 100 across 38 districts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNotably, earlier projects covered 8283 kilometers with NDB (New Development Bank) assistance. However, Bihar has now decided to fund the expanded 14,000-km project entirely from its own resources. This shows the stateâ€™s growing confidence and commitment to rural upliftment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThus, for countless villagers, dusty trails will soon be replaced by smooth roads!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNew Petrol Pump Rules for Patna: More Convenience, Better Planning\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Cabinet has also revised rules for setting up petrol pumps in urban areas including Patna.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow, petrol pumps can only be set up on plots adjoining roads that are at least 12.20 meters wide. Earlier, only highways and roads wider than 30 meters were permitted. This change ensures better access and urban convenience, reflecting smart planning for a growing city.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFestivals Get Bigger: New Fairs Included under Bihar State Mela Authority\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTwo major fairs, Baba Ganinath Palvaiya Dham Mela (Vaishali) and Baba Sundarnath Dham Mela (Araria), have been officially added to the Bihar State Mela Authority.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMoreover, the Chaithi Durga Puja Mela in Khagariaâ€™s Parbatta block has also joined the list. With this, Bihar strengthens its cultural roots while offering better facilities to visitors.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBridges for Better Connectivity: Updates on Rural Bridge Scheme\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor uninterrupted connectivity, the Mukhyamantri Gramin Setu Yojana has been updated too.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow, the Rural Works Department will handle bridges over 100 meters during construction, while Pul Nirman Nigam will take care of their maintenance. This ensures specialization and faster execution of projects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore Major Decisions That Shape Biharâ€™s Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApproval of â‚¹119.4 crore for hosting Khelo India Youth Games 2025 in Bihar. Promotion benefits: 4% horizontal reservation in promotions for benchmark persons with disabilities (PwDs). Director of IGIC Patna can now serve until the age of 70. Several recruitment, dismissal, and service condition updates across government departments. Clearance for land transfer for NH 333C Saroun-Chakai widening project in Jamui. Updated rules under Bihar Boiler Fine Adjudication and Appeal Rules 2025. Launch of the new Bihar Tourism Branding and Marketing Amendment Policy 2025.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApproval of â‚¹119.4 crore for hosting Khelo India Youth Games 2025 in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePromotion benefits: 4% horizontal reservation in promotions for benchmark persons with disabilities (PwDs).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDirector of IGIC Patna can now serve until the age of 70.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeveral recruitment, dismissal, and service condition updates across government departments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClearance for land transfer for NH 333C Saroun-Chakai widening project in Jamui.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpdated rules under Bihar Boiler Fine Adjudication and Appeal Rules 2025.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLaunch of the new Bihar Tourism Branding and Marketing Amendment Policy 2025.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClearly, Bihar is not just building roads â€” itâ€™s building the future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you want to stay updated with such inspiring development stories from Bihar, make sure to follow www.biharsay.com and become a proud member of our 11K-strong global community!\u003c/p\u003e",
