        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar: Where Dreams Turn into Unstoppable Triumphs!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eà¤œà¤¬ à¤¹à¥Œà¤¸à¤²à¥‡ à¤¬à¥à¤²à¤‚à¤¦ à¤¹à¥‹, à¤¤à¥‹ à¤œà¥€à¤¤ à¤®à¥à¤•à¤¦à¥à¤¦à¤° à¤¬à¤¨ à¤œà¤¾à¤¤à¥€ à¤¹à¥ˆ!Biharâ€™s unstoppable spirit once again made the nation proud, clinching the crown at the 12th Senior National Womenâ€™s Rugby 7s Championship held in Punjab.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a dazzling display of grit, skill, and pure passion, Biharâ€™s womenâ€™s team bulldozed through the tournament with unmatched energy. The final match saw a breathtaking performance against Maharashtra, sealing Biharâ€™s name in golden letters of Indian rugby history.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrushing Stereotypes, Crafting History\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s victory didnâ€™t just add another trophy to their shelf; it shattered stereotypes and lifted the dreams of thousands of young girls.Their dominant playstyle, impeccable coordination, and fearless tackles showcased a side of Bihar that the world must see more of!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNotably, the tournament witnessed intense competition, yet Biharâ€™s team, under the stellar leadership and coaching support, held their nerve throughout.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho Deserves the Spotlight?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile the entire team shined, players like Anjali Kumari, Priyanka Thakur, and Pooja Kumari (tag if available!) stole the show with their remarkable speed and resilience.Special applause also goes to the dedicated coaching staff, who shaped the squad into national champions!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you still think Bihar is only about cricket and kabaddi, think again. Rugby has found its fierce queens right here!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Win is Bigger Than a Trophy\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis triumph brings fresh hope and pride not just for Bihar, but for Indiaâ€™s womenâ€™s rugby as a whole.With minimal resources but maximum heart, these girls have shown that where thereâ€™s courage, thereâ€™s always victory.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMoreover, this win will surely inspire more young talents across small towns and villages to pick up the rugby ball and dream bigger.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant to witness Biharâ€™s rising stars shine even brighter?Follow www.biharsay.com today and become part of our global family of 11K+ supporters celebrating Biharâ€™s unstoppable spirit!\u003c/p\u003e",
