        "title":  "Bihar Sets Guinness World Record with Worldâ€™s Largest Madhubani Painting",
        "summary":  "Bihar Sets a New Record: Guinness World Record for Largest Madhubani Painting Bihar has made a monumental mark in the world of art by setting a Guinness World Record with the worldâ€™s largest Madhubani painting! Spanning a massiv...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar Sets a New Record: Guinness World Record for Largest Madhubani Painting\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar has made a monumental mark in the world of art by setting a Guinness World Record with the worldâ€™s largest Madhubani painting! Spanning a massive 18.69 square meters, this achievement celebrates the legacy of Mithila art. Crafted under the guidance of legendary artist Baua Devi, this masterpiece brings Biharâ€™s rich artistic tradition into the global spotlight.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Collaborative Masterpiece by 50 Talented Artists\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe paintingâ€™s creation was not a solo effort. Under the expert supervision of Baua Devi, a team of 50 artists and students came together to bring the painting to life. The artists worked in unison, combining their individual talents with traditional techniques to create a stunning piece that captures the essence of Mithila art.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach stroke of paint tells a story, showcasing vibrant colors, intricate patterns, and a deep connection to Biharâ€™s cultural heritage. The collaborative nature of this project demonstrates the power of community and the uniting force of art.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Proud Moment for Bihar and Indian Art\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis Guinness World Record is not just a personal triumph; itâ€™s a moment of pride for all of Bihar. The painting showcases the beauty of Mithila art to the world and brings international recognition to Biharâ€™s creative excellence. Moreover, it highlights the enduring legacy of Indiaâ€™s traditional art forms, proving that culture and creativity are alive and well.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMadhubani, with its rich history, has long been one of Indiaâ€™s most celebrated art forms. With this new record, Biharâ€™s place in the global art community is firmly secured. Art lovers from all over the world now have an opportunity to experience the intricacy and beauty of Mithila art at the Patliputra Sports Complex.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhere to See the Masterpiece: Patliputra Sports Complex\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe worldâ€™s largest Madhubani painting is now proudly installed at the Patliputra Sports Complex in Kankarbagh, Patna. Itâ€™s open to the public, and visitors can marvel at its intricate details and vivid colors. This monumental piece is a perfect fusion of tradition and innovation, offering a unique opportunity to experience Biharâ€™s cultural richness firsthand.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the Celebration of Biharâ€™s Artistic Legacy\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis record-breaking painting is more than just a work of art. Itâ€™s a celebration of Biharâ€™s rich history, its artistic prowess, and the collaborative efforts of 50 talented individuals. By setting a Guinness World Record, Bihar has put itself on the global map as a center for traditional and contemporary art.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLetâ€™s continue to celebrate and support Biharâ€™s artistic endeavors. For more updates on this remarkable achievement and other cultural milestones from Bihar, follow www.biharsay.com. Become part of our community of over 11,000 followers and stay connected with stories that showcase the best of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e",
