        "id":  "bihar-opens-6-new-cancer-day-care-centers-free-treatment-chemo-in-17-districts",
        "title":  "Bihar Opens 6 New Cancer Day Care Centers â€“ Free Treatment \u0026 Chemo in 17 Districts",
        "summary":  "6 new Day Care Centers are launching across Biharâ€”Read how this changes everything for cancer patients! Hope Just Got Closer: 6 New Cancer Day Care Centers in Bihar Cancer patients in Bihar have long battled not just the disease...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003e6 new Day Care Centers are launching across Biharâ€”Read how this changes everything for cancer patients!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHope Just Got Closer: 6 New Cancer Day Care Centers in Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCancer patients in Bihar have long battled not just the disease but also the distance. Until now, access to proper care meant traveling to cities like Patna, Delhi, or Mumbai. But hereâ€™s the good newsâ€”thatâ€™s changing fast. The state government, with support from the Central Government of India, is bringing cancer care closer to home.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSix more Cancer Day Care Centers are being launched in Begusarai, Samastipur, Motihari, Siwan, Bhojpur, and Kishanganj. These are in addition to the 11 already functioning in places like Patna, Gaya, and Bhagalpur.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Makes These Centers Special?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese centers are designed to provide free OPD consultations, screenings, and chemotherapy medicinesâ€”a massive relief for underprivileged families.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHereâ€™s what a patient can expect at these centers:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick OPD services On-spot screening for lumps or symptoms Access to a specialized Tumor Board for diagnosis and treatment roadmap Free chemotherapy drugs Palliative OPD services for advanced cases\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick OPD services\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn-spot screening for lumps or symptoms\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccess to a specialized Tumor Board for diagnosis and treatment roadmap\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFree chemotherapy drugs\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePalliative OPD services for advanced cases\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith this initiative, cancer treatment is becoming not only accessible but also dignified for many who couldnâ€™t afford the travel or cost earlier.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Step Toward Early Detection \u0026 Prevention\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMost cancers, if detected early, are treatable. These day care centers will focus heavily on early detection through regular screening, especially in rural and semi-urban populations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis development will:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReduce treatment delays Lower the patient burden on Mahavir Cancer Sansthan and other tertiary hospitals Increase awareness at the grassroots level\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReduce treatment delays\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLower the patient burden on Mahavir Cancer Sansthan and other tertiary hospitals\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncrease awareness at the grassroots level\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow Many Centers Are Operational Now?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOut of the approved 17 cancer day care centers in Bihar, 11 are already functional. These include: Patna, Muzaffarpur, Gaya, Bhagalpur, Nalanda, Madhubani, Chhapra, Purnia, Siwan, Bettiah, and Darbhanga.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow, 6 new centers are being added, and the remaining 21 districts are also expected to see such facilities in the near future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Experts Are Saying\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccording to Dr. (Major) K.N. Sahay, State Program Officer at Homi Bhabha Cancer Research Centre:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œWeâ€™ve made strong progress. With 17 centers sanctioned and 11 already operational, Bihar is now on the path to full cancer care coverage.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œWeâ€™ve made strong progress. With 17 centers sanctioned and 11 already operational, Bihar is now on the path to full cancer care coverage.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis initiative falls under the Non-Communicable Disease (NCD) Programme and aligns with the nationwide goal of launching 200 such centers across India.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHealthcare at Your Doorstep: No More City Travel\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUntil now, patients from smaller districts had no choice but to spend thousands traveling to metros. With these local facilities, patients can now receive high-quality care close to their homes, without the logistical and financial strain.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eItâ€™s not just healthcareâ€”itâ€™s human care, at scale.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more such positive Bihar updates that matterâ€”Follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our growing 11,000+ global community.Letâ€™s celebrate change together!\u003c/p\u003e",
