        "title":  "Biharâ€™s First Dry Port Opens at Bihta, Boosting Export-Import Potential",
        "summary":  "Biharâ€™s Big Leap: Bihta Gets Stateâ€™s First-Ever Dry Port! â€œà¤¬à¤¿à¤¹à¤¾à¤° à¤•à¥‹ à¤®à¤¿à¤²à¤¾ à¤…à¤ªà¤¨à¤¾ à¤ªà¤¹à¤²à¤¾ Dry Port â€“ à¤…à¤¬ à¤•à¤¾à¤°à¥‹à¤¬à¤¾à¤° à¤¹à¥‹à¤—à¤¾ à¤‡à¤‚à¤Ÿà¤°à¤¨à¥‡à¤¶à¤¨à¤²!â€ A Dry Port in Bi...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Big Leap: Bihta Gets Stateâ€™s First-Ever Dry Port!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œà¤¬à¤¿à¤¹à¤¾à¤° à¤•à¥‹ à¤®à¤¿à¤²à¤¾ à¤…à¤ªà¤¨à¤¾ à¤ªà¤¹à¤²à¤¾ Dry Port â€“ à¤…à¤¬ à¤•à¤¾à¤°à¥‹à¤¬à¤¾à¤° à¤¹à¥‹à¤—à¤¾ à¤‡à¤‚à¤Ÿà¤°à¤¨à¥‡à¤¶à¤¨à¤²!â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Dry Port in Bihar? Yes, and Itâ€™s a Game Changer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSomething transformational just happened in Bihar.Pristine Logistics \u0026 Infraprojects Ltd has launched ICD Bihta, Biharâ€™s first and only inland container depot. Just 40 km from Patna, this dry port brings global logistics solutions right to the heart of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBacked by Global Infrastructure Partners India Pvt Ltd, the facility is not just a development â€” itâ€™s a signal of Biharâ€™s industrial revolution.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy ICD Bihta Matters for Biharâ€™s Economy\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor decades, Biharâ€™s traders, farmers, and manufacturers had to look outside the state for export-import support.Now, with ICD Bihta, things are about to change â€” massively.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHereâ€™s what it brings:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShipping line containers now available within Bihar Customs clearance at Bihta itself Warehousing, rail, and road linkages all at one hub Direct connections to international ports\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShipping line containers now available within Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustoms clearance at Bihta itself\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWarehousing, rail, and road linkages all at one hub\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDirect connections to international ports\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eItâ€™s a one-stop logistics powerhouse â€” eliminating red tape and saving time, money, and effort for local businesses.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoosting Biharâ€™s Industrial \u0026 Trade Growth\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis dry port opens up:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExport potential for small manufacturers Trade channels for agro-based industries Investment opportunities in warehousing and logistics Massive job creation across the state\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExport potential for small manufacturers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTrade channels for agro-based industries\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInvestment opportunities in warehousing and logistics\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMassive job creation across the state\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor a state like Bihar that has always punched below its weight in exports, ICD Bihta is the bridge to the global market.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccording to industry insiders, this will redefine ease of doing business in Bihar. And with Bihta being part of Pristineâ€™s larger network â€” spanning Kanpur, Siliguri, Ludhiana, Chennai, and even Birgunj, Nepal â€” the location is now a key node in Indiaâ€™s container train grid.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Beginning of a Logistics-Led Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePristine Logistics has made Bihar visible on Indiaâ€™s logistics map.With a Category 1 railway permit, it can now run container trains across the country â€” placing Bihar at the centre of domestic and international commerce.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo longer will exporters in Bihar feel cut off. The ICD brings the ocean routes closer than ever before.The opportunity to access world markets is no longer a dream â€” itâ€™s a dry port away.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant more such powerful updates from Bihar?ðŸ“² Follow www.biharsay.com â€” Biharâ€™s leading apolitical storytelling platformðŸŽ™ï¸ Dive into real stories from grassroots to growth â€” become a part of our 11k+ strong global community today!\u003c/p\u003e",
