        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eâ€œPatnaâ€™s Sky Is About to Change!â€ â€” PM Modi to Inaugurate New Airport Terminal on May 30\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a monumental push to boost Biharâ€™s infrastructure, Prime Minister Narendra Modi is all set to inaugurate the brand-new terminal at Jay Prakash Narayan International Airport, Patna, on May 30. The announcement came straight from Deputy Chief Minister Samrat Choudhary during a high-level review meeting for the PMâ€™s Bihar visit.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLetâ€™s break down what this means for Patna, for Bihar, and for every citizen whoâ€™s dreamed of world-class airport facilities in the state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA New Terminal, A New Era for Patna\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter years of delay and demand, the swanky new terminal at Patna Airport is finally ready. With modern architecture, spacious design, and smart infrastructure, this terminal will dramatically ease the pressure on one of Indiaâ€™s most congested airports.Travelers can expect faster check-ins, better lounges, improved baggage handling, and overall smoother operations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis move is not just cosmetic. Itâ€™s a symbol of Biharâ€™s fast-evolving connectivity with the rest of the country â€” and the world.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePM Modi to Launch â‚¹1000+ Crore Development Projects\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDuring his visit, PM Modi will not stop at the airport ribbon-cutting. As per Dy. CM Samrat Choudhary, the Prime Minister will also lay the foundation stone for six major development projects across Bihar. Hereâ€™s whatâ€™s on the list:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePatna to Sasaram Four-Lane Highway Varanasiâ€“Ranchi Four-Lane Highway Connectivity 600 MW Power Plant at Nabinagar Expansion of Bihta Airport\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePatna to Sasaram Four-Lane Highway\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVaranasiâ€“Ranchi Four-Lane Highway Connectivity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e600 MW Power Plant at Nabinagar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExpansion of Bihta Airport\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTogether, these projects represent a massive investment in Biharâ€™s future, with a strong focus on energy, infrastructure, and mobility.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Does This Mean for Bihar?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is more than just roads and runways. These projects bring jobs, increase tourism, speed up logistics, and project Bihar as a serious player in Indiaâ€™s growth story.Every new launch echoes one core message â€” Bihar is not being left behind anymore.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom expanding aviation reach to energizing rural zones, these initiatives are designed to make Bihar shine on the national map.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ“¢ Be the first to know whatâ€™s shaping the new Bihar.ðŸ‘‰ Follow www.biharsay.com for regular, non-political updates on infrastructure, culture, and change-makers â€” and join the #11KStrong community across the globe.\u003c/p\u003e",
