        "title":  "Bihar Bihar Boosts Sugarcane Farming with International Research Center \u0026 New App",
        "summary":  "Digital Revolution and Research Powering Biharâ€™s Sugarcane Farmers Bihar is transforming sugarcane farming with two major initiatives. First, the state is launching an International Sugarcane Research Center in Pusa, Samastipur....",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eDigital Revolution and Research Powering Biharâ€™s Sugarcane Farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar is transforming sugarcane farming with two major initiatives. First, the state is launching an International Sugarcane Research Center in Pusa, Samastipur. This center will develop high-quality seeds and advanced farming techniques. As a result, farmers can expect better yields and stronger crops.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSecond, Bihar has introduced a smart sugarcane farming app for farmers. This app provides real-time advice on crop care, disease control, irrigation, and cost-saving tools. Additionally, it simplifies licensing processes for jaggery units by making them fully online. Thus, farmers no longer need to visit offices repeatedly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTogether, these efforts show Biharâ€™s commitment to modern agriculture. By combining research and digital technology, the state is empowering farmers in many ways. They will receive superior seeds, expert guidance, and easy access to government services. Consequently, production costs will drop, while output rises.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFurthermore, these initiatives strengthen rural economies. They help farmers compete not just locally but also nationally and globally. Therefore, Bihar is setting a strong example in agricultural innovation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Stay updated on Biharâ€™s agri-tech and farming breakthroughs! Follow www.biharsay.com and join over 11,000 members worldwide who are shaping Biharâ€™s future.\u003c/p\u003e",
