        "id":  "16100-bihar-farmers-receive-irrigation-aid-under-private-tube-well-scheme",
        "title":  "16,100 Bihar Farmers Receive Irrigation Aid Under Private Tube Well Scheme",
        "summary":  "Ab Har Khet Tak Pani Pahuch Raha Hai Big Relief for 16,100 Farmers in Bihar as Irrigation Support Reaches the Ground A Game-Changer for Biharâ€™s Farmers Over 16,100 farmers in Bihar have received direct financial aid under a stat...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eAb Har Khet Tak Pani Pahuch Raha Hai\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBig Relief for 16,100 Farmers in Bihar as Irrigation Support Reaches the Ground\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Game-Changer for Biharâ€™s Farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver 16,100 farmers in Bihar have received direct financial aid under a state-supported irrigation initiative, allowing them to install private tube wells and water their fields independently. This effort marks a major step in ensuring irrigation access for every farm, reducing dependence on seasonal rainfall and boosting agricultural productivity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe initiative, under the Mukhyamantri Niji Nalkoop Yojana, is designed to help farmers take irrigation into their own hands and cultivate with confidence year-round.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKey Highlights of the Scheme\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e16,100 farmers already received subsidies. â‚¹91.91 crore disbursed to support irrigation infrastructure. 23,397 farmers uploaded claims for boring completion. 116,985 hectares of farmland brought under irrigation. Total target: 35,000 tube wells across Bihar. Total goal: 1.75 lakh hectares of irrigated land.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e16,100 farmers already received subsidies.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ‚¹91.91 crore disbursed to support irrigation infrastructure.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e23,397 farmers uploaded claims for boring completion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e116,985 hectares of farmland brought under irrigation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTotal target: 35,000 tube wells across Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTotal goal: 1.75 lakh hectares of irrigated land.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow the Financial Aid Works\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe scheme provides grants based on category-wise support to ensure equitable access:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGeneral category farmers receive a 50% subsidy, capped at â‚¹57,000. Backward class farmers receive a 70% subsidy, capped at â‚¹79,800. Scheduled Caste/Scheduled Tribe farmers receive an 80% subsidy, capped at â‚¹91,200.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGeneral category farmers receive a 50% subsidy, capped at â‚¹57,000.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBackward class farmers receive a 70% subsidy, capped at â‚¹79,800.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScheduled Caste/Scheduled Tribe farmers receive an 80% subsidy, capped at â‚¹91,200.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe aid covers tube wells ranging between 15â€“70 meters in depth, equipped with 2 to 5 HP pumpsâ€”suitable for typical farmland in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApplication Process Made Simple\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe claim process is fully online and accessible to farmers across Bihar. Hereâ€™s how it works:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the official portal: horticulture.bihar.gov.in Upload the following documents: Aadhaar card Land ownership proof Caste certificate (if applicable) Farmerâ€™s passport-size photo Wait for application approval. After boring is completed, upload proof of installation. Subsidy is transferred post-verification by district officials.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the official portal: horticulture.bihar.gov.in\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpload the following documents:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAadhaar card Land ownership proof Caste certificate (if applicable) Farmerâ€™s passport-size photo\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAadhaar card\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLand ownership proof\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCaste certificate (if applicable)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFarmerâ€™s passport-size photo\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWait for application approval.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter boring is completed, upload proof of installation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubsidy is transferred post-verification by district officials.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImpact Already Visible on the Ground\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe initiative has already improved irrigation access across vast rural regions. With the majority of claims verified and subsidies released, farmers are witnessing:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBetter crop yields Reduced irrigation costs Increased independence from monsoons More confidence in planning multiple harvests\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBetter crop yields\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReduced irrigation costs\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncreased independence from monsoons\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore confidence in planning multiple harvests\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is more than a policyâ€”itâ€™s a tool for self-reliance and long-term growth.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEncouraging More Farmers to Apply\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDespite its success, many eligible farmers are yet to apply. To address this, the department is conducting extensive awareness campaigns in villages, blocks, and districts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFarmers with approved applications are urged to complete boring installations and upload proof at mwrd.bihar.gov.in to claim their grants. Meanwhile, pending claims are under active verification.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters for Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReliable irrigation remains one of Biharâ€™s biggest agricultural challenges. This scheme bridges the gap quickly and efficiently at the grassroots level. It empowers farmers, ensures water security, and strengthens rural livelihoods.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReliable irrigation remains one of Biharâ€™s biggest agricultural challenges.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis scheme bridges the gap quickly and efficiently at the grassroots level.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt empowers farmers, ensures water security, and strengthens rural livelihoods.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInstead of waiting for large infrastructure to be built, this initiative gives farmers the power to act nowâ€”directly and efficiently.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet More Stories That Matter\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isnâ€™t just about subsidiesâ€”itâ€™s about restoring hope, building trust, and enabling farmers to grow their future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more such verified and positive updates from Bihar, follow www.biharsay.comBecome part of the 11K+ community worldwide that celebrates Biharâ€™s change-makers, grassroots development, and real success stories.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo noise. No bias. Just Biharâ€”loud and clear.\u003c/p\u003e",
