        "title":  "IPL Sensation Vaibhav Suryavanshi Gets Heroâ€™s Welcome in Hometown Bihar",
        "summary":  "Jahan se nikle the sapne, wahan aaj sitare utare hain! When 14-year-old Vaibhav Suryavanshi stepped off the car in Tajpur, Samastipur, it wasnâ€™t just a return homeâ€”it was a full-blown celebration of dreams come true. The narro...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eJahan se nikle the sapne, wahan aaj sitare utare hain!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen 14-year-old Vaibhav Suryavanshi stepped off the car in Tajpur, Samastipur, it wasnâ€™t just a return homeâ€”it was a full-blown celebration of dreams come true. The narrow lanes of his ancestral village swelled with cheers, music, and pride as locals welcomed their cricketing hero with garlands, dhol beats, and a cake that read â€œWelcome Back to Home.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Boy Who Broke IPL Records\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSuryavanshi didnâ€™t just play the 2025 IPL; he rewrote it. Representing Rajasthan Royals â€” a brand known for scouting young talent â€” he stunned the cricketing world by smashing a 35-ball century against Gujarat Titans. This blazing knock made him the youngest player ever to score a century in menâ€™s T20 cricket and the fastest Indian to do so in IPL history.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHis debut season stats? A whopping 252 runs in just 7 matches with a strike rate of 206.55. Unbelievable? Yes. But entirely earned.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom Youth Cricket to National Dreams\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis wasnâ€™t Suryavanshiâ€™s first show of brilliance. Before the IPL fireworks, he hammered a 58-ball century in a youth Test against Australia, setting selectors abuzz. That performance, paired with his IPL dominance, secured him a place in Indiaâ€™s U-19 squad for an upcoming tour of England.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe tour includes five 50-over matches and three four-day gamesâ€”a perfect platform for Vaibhav to test his mettle in challenging conditions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Star Who Knows His Roots\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile speaking to head coach Rahul Dravid, Vaibhav showed maturity beyond his years. â€œThereâ€™s no such thing as a natural game,â€ he said. â€œYou play what the team needs. Focus and adaptability are everything.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDravid, in turn, had just one piece of advice: stay grounded. â€œNext season, bowlers will come better prepared. You have to train smarter.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Bounces with Pride\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTajpurâ€™s celebration wasnâ€™t just about cricket. It was about belief. A village that once whispered about possibilities now roared with confidence. Kids ran around holding makeshift bats. Elders smiled through teary eyes. The message was clear: Biharâ€™s soil grows legends.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVaibhav Suryavanshiâ€™s journey from rural lanes to cricketing glory is no less than a blockbuster. Yet, itâ€™s just the beginning.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo know whatâ€™s next for this teenage sensation, and to explore more such inspiring stories from the heartlandâ€”follow www.biharsay.com and become a proud member of our 11,000+ global community.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Say is Biharâ€™s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, reshaping the stateâ€™s image through powerful stories of culture, sports, grassroots change and youth icons like #VaibhavSuryavanshi.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e#BiharSay #VaibhavSuryavanshi #IPL2025 #RajasthanRoyals #Samastipur #BiharCricket #CricketIndia #IndiaU19 #RahulDravid #YoungTalent #CricketRisingStar #BiharSports #TeenCricketStar #BiharNews #Inspiration #BiharUpdates\u003c/p\u003e",
