        "id":  "bihta-dry-port-sends-first-container-to-russia",
        "title":  "Bihta Dry Port Sends First Container to Russia",
        "summary":  "Bihta to Russia: Biharâ€™s Bold Leap into Global Trade | Indiaâ€™s Export Story Rewritten from a Small Town From Bihta to the Battlefield: Biharâ€™s Safety Shoes March into Russia What connects a silent logistics hub near Patna to...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihta to Russia: Biharâ€™s Bold Leap into Global Trade | Indiaâ€™s Export Story Rewritten from a Small Town\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom Bihta to the Battlefield: Biharâ€™s Safety Shoes March into Russia\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat connects a silent logistics hub near Patna to the icy terrains of Russia? On Monday, Bihta Dry Port witnessed a landmark eventâ€”the first container was flagged off for Russia, loaded with custom-made safety shoes for Russian soldiers. This historic moment signals more than just an exportâ€”it marks Biharâ€™s entry into global logistics with confidence and capability.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMade in Hajipur, Designed for Russia\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe container, dispatched by Competence Export Pvt. Ltd., is a proud example of â€œMake in Bihar.â€ Manufactured in Hajipurâ€™s industrial zone, these specialised safety shoes are designed to handle the extreme demands of the Russian army.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œRussian soldiers need boots that are light, firm-gripped, and resilient against -40Â°C weather,â€ said Shivnath Rai, Manager at Competence Export. â€œOur design meets every one of those standards.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œRussian soldiers need boots that are light, firm-gripped, and resilient against -40Â°C weather,â€ said Shivnath Rai, Manager at Competence Export. â€œOur design meets every one of those standards.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEarlier, such exports had to route through Kanpur. Now, with the operational push at Pristine Bihta Dry Port, Bihar is becoming the starting point for international supply chains.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihta Dry Port: From Regional Link to Global Gateway\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe flagged-off shipment marks Bihta Dry Portâ€™s entry into international logistics. Managed by Pristine Logistics, this hub now offers businesses across Bihar a smoother, cost-efficient pathway to export via Mumbai Port to global destinations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe event saw the presence of key officials:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRakesh Kumar (Regional Manager, Dry Port) Pradeep Kumar (Customs Superintendent) Naveen Kumar (Customs Inspector)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTheir involvement ensured all clearances were seamless, highlighting how Biharâ€™s infrastructure is now export-ready.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWill Indian Soldiers Wear These Boots Next?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen asked if Indian soldiers might soon use these high-performance boots, Shivnath Rai replied,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œNot yet. Weâ€™re awaiting formal approval. Once we get the order, weâ€™re fully prepared to produce boots for the Indian Army too.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œNot yet. Weâ€™re awaiting formal approval. Once we get the order, weâ€™re fully prepared to produce boots for the Indian Army too.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isnâ€™t just business anymoreâ€”itâ€™s a matter of national service, starting from a small unit in Hajipur.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Emerging Export Power: What This Means\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis milestone demonstrates a massive shift in Biharâ€™s economic narrative. From traditional industries to high-value defence gear exports, the state is now better positioned for global trade. Thanks to Bihta Dry Port, MSMEs and manufacturers in Bihar can export directly, reducing dependency on ports in other states.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith improved infrastructure, faster logistics, and global demandâ€”Bihar is no longer waiting for change. It is leading it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ“£ For More Groundbreaking Stories Like Thisâ€¦\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay informed about Biharâ€™s rising industries, grassroots innovation, and culture-changing stories.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Visit www.biharsay.com for exclusive updates. ðŸŒ Join our growing community of over 11,000 readers worldwide. Bihar Say is Biharâ€™s leading apolitical media platform, spotlighting bold, honest stories that reshape the stateâ€™s imageâ€”in business, culture, and beyond.\u003c/p\u003e",
