        "id":  "janaki-mandir-sitamarhi-ram-mandir-inspired-temple-to-begin-construction-in-august",
        "title":  "Janaki Mandir Sitamarhi: Ram Mandir-Inspired Temple to Begin Construction in August",
        "summary":  "à¤°à¤¾à¤® à¤•à¥€ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¥‡à¤°à¤£à¤¾, à¤¸à¥€à¤¤à¤¾ à¤•à¥€ à¤ªà¤¹à¤šà¤¾à¤¨ â€“ Sitamarhi to Shine with Janaki Mandirâ€™s Grand Beginning â€œà¤°à¤¾à¤® à¤®à¤‚à¤¦à¤¿à¤° à¤•à¥€ à¤¤à¤°à¤¹ à¤…à¤¬ à¤¸à¥€à¤¤à¤¾ à¤®à¤¾à¤¤à¤¾ à¤•à¤¾ à¤­à¤µ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eà¤°à¤¾à¤® à¤•à¥€ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¥‡à¤°à¤£à¤¾, à¤¸à¥€à¤¤à¤¾ à¤•à¥€ à¤ªà¤¹à¤šà¤¾à¤¨ â€“ Sitamarhi to Shine with Janaki Mandirâ€™s Grand Beginning\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œà¤°à¤¾à¤® à¤®à¤‚à¤¦à¤¿à¤° à¤•à¥€ à¤¤à¤°à¤¹ à¤…à¤¬ à¤¸à¥€à¤¤à¤¾ à¤®à¤¾à¤¤à¤¾ à¤•à¤¾ à¤­à¤µà¥à¤¯ à¤®à¤‚à¤¦à¤¿à¤° à¤­à¥€ à¤¬à¤¨à¥‡à¤—à¤¾â€¦ à¤‡à¤¸ à¤¬à¤¾à¤° à¤•à¤¹à¤¾à¤¨à¥€ à¤²à¤¿à¤–à¥‡à¤—à¥€ à¤¬à¤¿à¤¹à¤¾à¤° à¤•à¥€ à¤§à¤°à¤¤à¥€!â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSitamarhi, the birthplace of Goddess Sita, is set to become the next spiritual landmark of India. In August, Punaura Dham will witness the foundation-laying ceremony of the new Janaki Mandir, modeled after the grandeur of the Ram Mandir in Ayodhya. This development marks a cultural resurgence in Bihar and promises to transform Sitamarhi into a global spiritual hub.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Temple with Devotion, Not Just Design\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInspired by the architecture of the Ram Janmabhoomi Mandir, this upcoming temple project will reflect divine elegance. The architectural responsibilities lie with M/s Design Associates Inc., the same agency that brought Ayodhyaâ€™s Ram Mandir to life.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a powerful act of devotion, the agency has chosen to design the temple pro bono. According to the Tourism Department, the final architectural model will be ready by July, paving the way for a smooth construction rollout in August.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom 17 to 67 Acres â€“ Expanding the Spiritual Canvas\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCurrently, the temple spans 17 acres, but Biharâ€™s vision goes beyond that. An additional 50 acres are being acquired to build a complete religious tourism ecosystem. The state government has already sanctioned â‚¹120 crore for this land acquisition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe design will follow an â€œODI modelâ€, ensuring accessibility, beauty, and sustainability. With ample space and planning, Punaura Dham will welcome both devotees and curious travelers from around the world.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDevotion in the Digital Age: Donate Online with Ease\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a first for the region, the temple will accept online donations, making it easier for devotees to contribute from anywhere.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSupporters can donate through:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnline transactions RTGS Cash payments\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnline transactions\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRTGS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCash payments\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce the donation is received, the system will immediately generate a receipt. This will be sent via email or post, along with a visual of the temple model, creating a tangible emotional connection with every contributor.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTourism Minister Raju Kumar Singh confirmed that a dedicated donation portal will go live soon, streamlining the process further.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore Than a Temple â€“ A Movement Begins\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis project is more than just construction. Itâ€™s a call to reclaim Biharâ€™s cultural narrative, revive tourism, and honor Maa Sita on her own land. With wide-scale development and global participation, Sitamarhi is set to shine againâ€”this time as a symbol of spiritual strength and cultural pride.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ“£ Want more stories that blend roots, reform, and revival?ðŸŒ Follow www.biharsay.com for inspiring updates.ðŸ’¬ Join 11,000+ readers from across the world and become a part of Biharâ€™s new narrative.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Say is Biharâ€™s top apolitical storytelling platform, showcasing voices of change, heritage, and hope. From viral grassroots updates to deep-dives with BiharCast â€” weâ€™re telling the stories that truly matter.\u003c/p\u003e",
