        "title":  "Bihar Sports University Launches First Prospectus",
        "summary":  "ðŸ… Bihar Sports University Launches First Prospectusâ€”Two Game-Changing Courses to Shape Indiaâ€™s Next Champions! Biharâ€™s Bold Leap: Sports Meets Higher Education at Rajgir! In a state long celebrated for intellect and resil...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eðŸ… Bihar Sports University Launches First Prospectusâ€”Two Game-Changing Courses to Shape Indiaâ€™s Next Champions!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Bold Leap: Sports Meets Higher Education at Rajgir!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a state long celebrated for intellect and resilience, Bihar just dropped a game-changerâ€”and itâ€™s not in a classroom. Itâ€™s on the field. On a historic Tuesday in Rajgir, Bihar Sports University officially launched its first-ever prospectus for the 2025â€“26 academic session, marking a monumental leap toward creating national and global sports icons from the heart of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Historic Launch That Kicks Off a New Era\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVice Chancellor Shri Shishir Sinha led the ceremonial release of the inaugural prospectus. Alongside him stood a strong team of university dignitariesâ€”Registrar Rajni Kant, Dean and Exam Controller Dr. Nishikant Tiwari, Finance Officer Mukesh Samrat, and advisors including Dr. Ravi Kumar Singh, Chandan Kumar, and many more. Their collective presence underlined the seriousness of this mission.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis wasnâ€™t just a press-worthy event. It was a declaration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhatâ€™s Inside the Prospectus?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor students, parents, and coaches eager to learn, the 2025â€“26 prospectus is a goldmine. It offers a comprehensive roadmap to the universityâ€™s curriculum, sports training infrastructure, admission guidelines, and student amenities. Everything a sports aspirant needs to dreamâ€”and planâ€”big.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTwo Power-Packed Courses Ready to Roll\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStarting July 2025, the university will introduce two postgraduate diploma courses in Athletics and Cricket. Each course offers 20 seats, curated to groom the next generation of sports professionals. This bold step addresses the demand for quality sports education in Bihar, placing the state on Indiaâ€™s sports education map.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTransparent Selection, Rooted in Merit\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdmissions will strictly follow Bihar Governmentâ€™s reservation policy. However, merit will drive selectionâ€”based on academic performance and sports achievements. The universityâ€™s admissions committee will maintain a transparent and unbiased process to ensure only the most deserving make it through.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFull Admission Schedule at a Glance\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRegistration: May 28 â€“ June 15, 2025 Fitness Test Notification: July 3, 2025 Fitness Test Dates: July 10â€“11, 2025 Results Announcement: July 17, 2025 Document \u0026 Medical Verification: July 24, 2025 Admission \u0026 Fee Payment: July 26â€“27, 2025 Class Commencement \u0026 Orientation: July 28, 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRegistration: May 28 â€“ June 15, 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFitness Test Notification: July 3, 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFitness Test Dates: July 10â€“11, 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResults Announcement: July 17, 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDocument \u0026 Medical Verification: July 24, 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdmission \u0026 Fee Payment: July 26â€“27, 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClass Commencement \u0026 Orientation: July 28, 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo, mark your calendars. This is your shot to turn passion into profession.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters for Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis initiative isnâ€™t just about launching courses. Itâ€™s about changing narratives. Bihar, often overlooked in sports, is taking charge of its own destiny. With this university, young athletes get the right platform, proper training, and an opportunity to compete globally.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore than that, it sets a precedent. One where Bihar becomes a hub for sports talent, fostering champions who can make their stateâ€”and countryâ€”proud.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ’¥ Donâ€™t just read historyâ€”become a part of it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor exclusive Bihar sports updates, grassroots stories, and insider access to development breakthroughs, follow www.biharsay.com and become a part of our global 11,000+ strong community.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Say is the stateâ€™s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, reshaping Biharâ€™s image through powerful stories in culture, sports, business, and grassroots movements.Catch us on LinkedIn, DailyHunt, and tune in to our flagship show BiharCast to hear voices from the very heart of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e",
