        "title":  "This Bihar Village Turned into a Boxing Hub",
        "summary":  "A Punch of Hope: How a Government School Coach Is Transforming Biharâ€™s Boxing Future â€œFrom forgotten fields to fierce fightersâ€”how one manâ€™s selfless act is changing the game in rural Bihar.â€ Bhojpurâ€™s Rise as Biharâ€™...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eA Punch of Hope: How a Government School Coach Is Transforming Biharâ€™s Boxing Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œFrom forgotten fields to fierce fightersâ€”how one manâ€™s selfless act is changing the game in rural Bihar.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBhojpurâ€™s Rise as Biharâ€™s Unexpected Boxing Powerhouse\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a small village of Bhojpur district, Bihar, something extraordinary is unfolding. The quiet mornings now echo with the thud of gloves hitting punching bags. Why? Because this rural stretch is no longer just another villageâ€”itâ€™s becoming a boxing hub.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt the heart of this revolution is Ramesh Kumar Yadav, a dedicated physical education teacher in a government school and a former national-level boxer originally from Uttar Pradesh. Despite facing a lack of resources and structured coaching, Ramesh never gave up on his passion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile he couldnâ€™t advance far due to poor infrastructure, he decided his students wouldnâ€™t face the same fate. So, he started training themâ€”for free.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFree Training, Fierce Fighters: A Mission Born Out of Passion\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore than 150 children now learn boxing under his guidance. Morning or evening, the school playground becomes a makeshift boxing ring. There are no fancy gyms, no elite equipmentâ€”just heart, hustle, and heavy sweat.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat makes this story remarkable is not just the number of students but their performance. Three of his students have already won medals at the state level, proving that talent doesnâ€™t wait for privilege. It just needs a chanceâ€”and Ramesh is giving them exactly that.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Movement, Not Just a Mission\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat began with a few kids watching him train turned into a village-wide movement. Now, boxing isnâ€™t just a sport hereâ€”itâ€™s a way of life. Children look up to Ramesh as a mentor, parents trust him with their dreams, and local youth have found purpose.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHis selfless work is not backed by any government scheme or private sponsorship. It runs purely on dedication. In a world obsessed with brands, Ramesh Kumar Yadav has become a grassroots icon. His story is reshaping how we view sports, education, and leadership in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe Part of the Change\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStories like Rameshâ€™s deserve to be heard, celebrated, and supported. Bihar isnâ€™t just about challengesâ€”itâ€™s about changemakers too.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Follow www.biharsay.com for more such inspiring stories that celebrate Biharâ€™s heartbeat and strength.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBecome a part of the #11kStrong global community thatâ€™s changing how the world sees Biharâ€”one story at a time.\u003c/p\u003e",
