        "title":  "Namo Bharat Express Extension to Ara \u0026 Buxar Proposed",
        "summary":  "Namo Bharat Express might soon zoom into Ara and Buxar â€” are you ready for the ride? Biharâ€™s Next Big Leap in Connectivity: Namo Bharat Extension Proposed! The wait might be over for Ara and Buxar! A proposal has been sent to ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eNamo Bharat Express might soon zoom into Ara and Buxar â€” are you ready for the ride?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Next Big Leap in Connectivity: Namo Bharat Extension Proposed!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe wait might be over for Ara and Buxar! A proposal has been sent to the Railway Board to extend the Namo Bharat Express â€” Biharâ€™s ultra-modern high-speed metro â€” beyond Patna, all the way to Buxar, with a crucial stop at Ara.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf approved, this expansion will be a game-changer for daily commuters, students, and businesses alike. With stations like Jaynagar, Madhubani, Darbhanga, Samastipur, Begusarai, and Patna already connected, adding Ara and Buxar to the route means unlocking even more possibilities for faster, smoother travel.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Makes Namo Bharat So Special?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is not your regular train. The Namo Bharat Express, currently running between Jaynagar and Patna, boasts:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA sleek metro-style design 16 air-conditioned coaches Automatic door lock system Mobile charging points 120 km/h top speed\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA sleek metro-style design\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e16 air-conditioned coaches\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAutomatic door lock system\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMobile charging points\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e120 km/h top speed\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery day, more than 2,000 passengers enjoy this futuristic train ride.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Extend to Buxar via Ara?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSmart planning is behind this proposed move. The train remains idle for nearly 5 hours in Patna after its morning arrival. East Central Railwayâ€™s Danapur Division suggests extending the service during that idle time â€” reaching Buxar via Ara â€” without disrupting its core schedule.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce this gets the green light, around 600 additional passengers from Ara and Buxar could benefit daily.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCurrent Timings and Ticket Price\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeparts Jaynagar: 5:28 AM Reaches Patna: 10:30 AM Returns from Patna: 6:05 PM Back in Jaynagar: 11:45 PM Fare: â‚¹85 (General), â‚¹340 (AC); Fares for Ara \u0026 Buxar will be updated post-approval.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeparts Jaynagar: 5:28 AM\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReaches Patna: 10:30 AM\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReturns from Patna: 6:05 PM\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBack in Jaynagar: 11:45 PM\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFare: â‚¹85 (General), â‚¹340 (AC); Fares for Ara \u0026 Buxar will be updated post-approval.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhatâ€™s Next?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis proposal is currently with the Railway Board. Once approved, work will begin on route alignment, station management, and fare structuring.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor residents of Ara and Buxar, this could mean:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLess travel time Modern facilities Direct access to North Biharâ€™s key cities\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLess travel time\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eModern facilities\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDirect access to North Biharâ€™s key cities\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Want more such updates that matter to Bihar?ðŸ“² Follow www.biharsay.com and become part of the 11K+ global community that believes in reshaping Biharâ€™s image through credible storytelling, local development, and smart updates.\u003c/p\u003e",
