        "id":  "bihar-water-atlas-2025-uid-numbers-for-all-ponds-mapping-panchayat-water-sources",
        "title":  "Bihar Water Atlas 2025: UID Numbers for All Ponds, Mapping Panchayat Water Sources",
        "summary":  "Every Pond, Every Panchayat: Biharâ€™s New Water Atlas to Revolutionize Rural Water Management Imagine every village pond in Bihar having its own digital identity.Thatâ€™s not just a visionâ€”itâ€™s official policy now. In a power...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eEvery Pond, Every Panchayat: Biharâ€™s New Water Atlas to Revolutionize Rural Water Management\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine every village pond in Bihar having its own digital identity.Thatâ€™s not just a visionâ€”itâ€™s official policy now.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a powerful step towards transparent water governance, the Revenue and Land Reforms Department of Bihar is developing the Gazette-cum-Atlas of Water Bodies, mapping every pond, canal, and water source in the stateâ€”right down to the panchayat level.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUID for Every Pond, Transparency for Every Panchayat\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a recent high-level meeting chaired by Chief Secretary Amrit Lal Meena (tagged), officials announced that every pond in Bihar will get a UID (Unique Identification Number). This digital tagging will not only help track their status but also make it easier to detect encroachments and maintain data in real time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNearly 2 lakh water bodies to be mapped Mobile App in development for real-time updates Strong emphasis on removal of encroachments\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNearly 2 lakh water bodies to be mapped\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMobile App in development for real-time updates\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrong emphasis on removal of encroachments\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis initiative will initially begin with Purnia and Saharsa divisions, where gazette work is already underway. Other districts will follow in a phased manner.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom Maps to Mobile: How the Atlas Will Work\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe state is going beyond mere documentation. Itâ€™s planning a dedicated mobile app that will update pond data regularly. It will include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLive status updates Geotagging with maps Field officer verification access Integration with encroachment removal drives\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLive status updates\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGeotagging with maps\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eField officer verification access\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIntegration with encroachment removal drives\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach pondâ€™s UID will function like a digital Aadhaar, enabling centralized tracking, faster responses, and smarter planning for water-related schemes like Jal Jeevan Hariyali.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattling Encroachment, One Pond at a Time\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThough the government has already freed many ponds from illegal occupation, the fight isnâ€™t over yet. In the same meeting, the Chief Secretary clearly stated that removing encroachment from water bodies must be the topmost priority for all departments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCommittees led by District Magistrates are being formed to publish local water body gazetteers within a year. Departments must share maps and relevant data promptly to meet this deadline.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters to You (Even if Youâ€™re Not a Farmer)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater is life.Yet, in rural Bihar, water sources often disappear due to neglect, illegal construction, or poor records.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBy tagging and mapping them:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePolicy becomes data-driven Water bodies get legal protection Development becomes inclusive\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePolicy becomes data-driven\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater bodies get legal protection\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDevelopment becomes inclusive\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis effort aligns with the broader goals of rural development, climate resilience, and digital governanceâ€”turning every pond into a protected, recognized, and respected asset.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ“² Want to stay ahead on such bold governance stories?Follow www.biharsay.com for impactful updates, and become part of our growing 11k+ global community reshaping Biharâ€™s image through powerful storytelling.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe donâ€™t just report change.We spotlight the heartbeat of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e",
