        "id":  "bihars-marigold-farming-scheme-2025-50-subsidy-for-farmers-announced",
        "title":  "Bihar\u0027s Marigold Farming Scheme 2025: 50% Subsidy for Farmers Announced",
        "summary":  "à¤—à¥‡à¤‚à¤¦à¤¾ à¤¸à¥‡ à¤¬à¤¦à¤²à¤¾à¤µ à¤•à¥€ à¤¬à¤¯à¤¾à¤°! Biharâ€™s Marigold Mission Promises 50% Subsidy to Farmersâ€”A Blooming Opportunity Biharâ€™s Blooming Move: Farmers to Get 50% Subsidy for Marigold Farming What if your ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eà¤—à¥‡à¤‚à¤¦à¤¾ à¤¸à¥‡ à¤¬à¤¦à¤²à¤¾à¤µ à¤•à¥€ à¤¬à¤¯à¤¾à¤°! Biharâ€™s Marigold Mission Promises 50% Subsidy to Farmersâ€”A Blooming Opportunity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Blooming Move: Farmers to Get 50% Subsidy for Marigold Farming\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat if your farm could bloom into a business\u0027hatâ€™s exactly what the Bihar Government is aiming for with its Marigold Flower Development Scheme, a revolutionary step to help farmers grow profitsâ€”literally!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhatâ€™s the Buzz About?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s farmers are about to witness a floral revolution! Under the Genda Phool Vikas Yojana, the state will offer â‚¹40,000 per hectare as a subsidy to promote marigold farming. The move is part of a larger initiative to diversify agriculture and ensure sustainable income for farmers across Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePer hectare cost: â‚¹80,000 Government subsidy: 50% or â‚¹40,000 Budget approved for 2025-26: â‚¹6.32 crore Scheme coverage: Entire state\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePer hectare cost: â‚¹80,000\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGovernment subsidy: 50% or â‚¹40,000\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBudget approved for 2025-26: â‚¹6.32 crore\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScheme coverage: Entire state\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeputy CM and Agriculture Minister Vijay Kumar Sinha (tagged) announced the scheme, calling it a step toward smart and inclusive agriculture.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Marigold? Why Now?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe marigold isnâ€™t just a pretty face.Used extensively in religious rituals, festivals, weddings, and dÃ©cor, the demand for high-quality marigold flowers remains consistent throughout the year.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith growing demand and profitable margins, marigold farming has the potential to transform small and marginal farmers into self-reliant entrepreneurs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMoreover, the scheme covers not just cultivation but also processing and marketing, helping farmers earn better and faster.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTransition from Crop to Cash: How It Works\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnlike many schemes that come with layers of paperwork, this one is straightforward.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFarmers apply for marigold cultivation. Quality plants are provided at subsidised rates. After the flowers bloom fully, subsidy is released based on verification by Block Horticulture Officers. Final payment is made by the Assistant Director of Horticulture at the district level.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFarmers apply for marigold cultivation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuality plants are provided at subsidised rates.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter the flowers bloom fully, subsidy is released based on verification by Block Horticulture Officers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFinal payment is made by the Assistant Director of Horticulture at the district level.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis single-shot subsidy approach reduces red tape and ensures that the farmer is empowered at the grassroots level.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Makes This Scheme Stand Out?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt encourages crop diversification, moving farmers beyond traditional wheat-rice cycles. It aligns with sustainable agricultural models and promotes floriculture entrepreneurship. It guarantees high returns in a short span, especially during peak festive and wedding seasons.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt encourages crop diversification, moving farmers beyond traditional wheat-rice cycles.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt aligns with sustainable agricultural models and promotes floriculture entrepreneurship.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt guarantees high returns in a short span, especially during peak festive and wedding seasons.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe schemeâ€™s design takes into account market demand, plant quality, ease of implementation, and farmer-friendly processingâ€”everything needed to make it a grand success.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Step Toward Agripreneurship\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s marigold push isnâ€™t just about flowers.Itâ€™s about creating self-sustained rural economies, turning villages into micro-business hubs, and helping farmers transition from survival to growth.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo, if youâ€™re a farmerâ€”or know someone who isâ€”this is your chance to bloom brighter than ever.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ“² Want updates like this at your fingertips?Follow www.biharsay.com for regular updates, ground-level stories, and growth opportunities straight from the heartland of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin our 11k+ strong global community thatâ€™s reshaping Biharâ€™s narrativeâ€”one impactful story at a time.\u003c/p\u003e",
