        "id":  "bihar-sends-1500-kg-of-10-fresh-veggies-to-dubai",
        "title":  "Bihar Exports 1500 KG of 10 Fresh Veggies to Dubai",
        "summary":  "10 Veggies, 1500 KG \u0026 1 Historic Leap: Why Biharâ€™s First Export to Dubai Matters From Fields to Flight: Biharâ€™s Global Vegetable Debut Ever imagined jackfruit from Bihar landing in a Dubai mall? Itâ€™s now a reality. For the f...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003e10 Veggies, 1500 KG \u0026 1 Historic Leap: Why Biharâ€™s First Export to Dubai Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom Fields to Flight: Biharâ€™s Global Vegetable Debut\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEver imagined jackfruit from Bihar landing in a Dubai mall? Itâ€™s now a reality. For the first time, Bihar has exported 1,500 kilograms of fresh vegetables to Dubai, marking a groundbreaking milestone for the stateâ€™s farmers and the agri-economy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn June 5, Cooperative Minister Dr. Prem Kumar flagged off this shipment from Dasrath Manjhi Labor and Planning Institute, Patna. This isnâ€™t just a shipment. Itâ€™s a symbol of hard work, strategic planning, and global ambition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhatâ€™s Inside the Shipment? 10 Local Stars\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis test shipment contains 10 popular vegetables, grown in Biharâ€™s fertile soil. These include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJackfruit Cauliflower Bitter Gourd Bottle Gourd\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJackfruit\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCauliflower\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBitter Gourd\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBottle Gourd\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€¦along with six other seasonal staples. These vegetables are now en route to Lulu Mall, Dubai, via Varanasi Airport.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho Made It Happen? A Truly Joint Effort\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe shipment reflects the collective work of multiple sabji sanghs across Bihar. Among them:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHarit Sabji Sangh (Patna) Tirhut Sabji Sangh (MotiHari) Mithila Sabji Sangh (Darbhanga) Magadh Sabji Sangh (Gaya)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHarit Sabji Sangh (Patna)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTirhut Sabji Sangh (MotiHari)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMithila Sabji Sangh (Darbhanga)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMagadh Sabji Sangh (Gaya)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith support from VEGFED (Vegetable Processing \u0026 Marketing Federation) and execution by Fair Exporters Ltd., the vegetables were processed, packed, and sentâ€”showcasing Biharâ€™s new capability to meet international export standards.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Moment Matters for Bihar and Its Farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is more than just produce on a plane. Itâ€™s proof that Bihar can feed not only India but the world. More importantly, it creates opportunities:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBetter income for farmers Exposure to global markets Encouragement for rural entrepreneurship\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBetter income for farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExposure to global markets\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEncouragement for rural entrepreneurship\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile this was a test shipment, it opens doors for regular exports. It also boosts the image of Biharâ€™s agricultural outputâ€”long underrated despite high productivity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Government with Global Vision\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMinister Dr. Prem Kumar emphasized that the move aligns with Biharâ€™s motto:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œHar Thali Mein Bihari Tarkari.â€(Every plate should have Biharâ€™s vegetables.)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œHar Thali Mein Bihari Tarkari.â€(Every plate should have Biharâ€™s vegetables.)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHe added that this step wouldnâ€™t have been possible without the stateâ€™s visionary policies and support from cooperatives.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is not just a win for the state government, but a proud moment for every farmer in Bihar. The state now positions itself as a serious contender in the global food supply chain.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ“£ Whatâ€™s Next?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf this shipment proves successful, we may soon see weekly exports, new processing hubs, and improved logistics networks across rural Bihar. For thousands of farmers, this could mean new life-changing possibilities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant to stay ahead of such game-changing updates?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Follow www.biharsay.com for regular, honest, and inspiring Bihar updates.Be part of the growing #11KGlobalCommunity thatâ€™s helping reshape Biharâ€™s imageâ€”one powerful story at a time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Say is Biharâ€™s leading apolitical media \u0026 storytelling platform, bringing stories of culture, innovation, and grassroots change to a global audience. With presence on Dailyhunt, a growing podcast series â€œBiharCastâ€œ, and strong LinkedIn engagement, itâ€™s the digital voice of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e",
