        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eà¤¬à¤¿à¤¹à¤¾à¤° à¤®à¥‡à¤‚ à¤²à¤—à¥à¤œà¤°à¥€ à¤…à¤¬ à¤†à¤¸à¤®à¤¾à¤¨ à¤›à¥‚à¤¨à¥‡ à¤µà¤¾à¤²à¥€ à¤¹à¥ˆ!A new chapter has begun in Patnaâ€™s real estate journey. The foundation stone for what will soon be Biharâ€™s tallest building has been laid, setting a benchmark not just in height but in design, comfort, and sustainability. With 34 floors and a height of 120 meters, this mega residential tower is all set to transform the way Bihar lives and dreams.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Tower That Outshines All Others\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo far, Biscomaun Bhawan held the title of Biharâ€™s tallest structure. But thatâ€™s about to change. This new skyscraper is being developed in the Danapur area of Patna, and itâ€™s expected to surpass Biscomaun by nearly 50 meters!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat makes it even more exciting is that itâ€™s not just about heightâ€”itâ€™s about redefining the future of urban living in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eModern Architecture Meets Visionary Planning\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned by Indiaâ€™s celebrated architect Hafeez Contractor, this project will reflect both aesthetic brilliance and thoughtful planning. It spans over 14 acres and includes:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 elegant towers Around 1100 high-end flats 34 floors of luxury 85% open green space Only 15% of land used for construction\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 elegant towers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAround 1100 high-end flats\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e34 floors of luxury\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e85% open green space\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnly 15% of land used for construction\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes, you read that right! The developers are leaving the majority of land untouched for open lawns, jogging tracks, playgrounds, and peaceful walking zones. This makes it one of Biharâ€™s most environment-conscious real estate projects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLoaded With World-Class Facilities\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYouâ€™re not just buying a homeâ€”youâ€™re stepping into a complete lifestyle. Some of the standout amenities include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll-weather swimming pool 70,000 sq. ft. modern clubhouse Dedicated spaces for yoga, indoor games, and fitness Childrenâ€™s play zones A serene temple complex with a Chhath Puja ghat 100% power backup Vastu-compliant apartment layouts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll-weather swimming pool\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e70,000 sq. ft. modern clubhouse\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDedicated spaces for yoga, indoor games, and fitness\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChildrenâ€™s play zones\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA serene temple complex with a Chhath Puja ghat\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e100% power backup\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVastu-compliant apartment layouts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMoreover, the buildings will be equipped with the latest fire-safety technology and smart infrastructure, offering peace of mind along with luxury.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocation That Keeps You Connected\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in South-West Patnaâ€™s Khagaul region, this tower enjoys excellent connectivity:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4 km from Danapur Railway Station 13 km from Patna Airport Surrounded by reputed schools, hospitals, and markets\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4 km from Danapur Railway Station\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e13 km from Patna Airport\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSurrounded by reputed schools, hospitals, and markets\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether youâ€™re commuting for work or sending your child to school, everything is just minutes away.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompletion Timeline \u0026 Investment Potential\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe project is expected to be ready before 2030, giving investors and homebuyers ample time to plan. Apartments will range from 3 to 5 BHKs, including duplex options. With the involvement of top architects and a premium location, this residential complex offers high appreciation potential in the years to come.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ“Œ Donâ€™t miss out on this historic shift in Biharâ€™s housing landscape.ðŸ“¢ Stay updated on more such transformative developments across Biharâ€”follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 11k+ global community today!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ—£ï¸ #BiharSay is Biharâ€™s leading apolitical digital media platform, spotlighting stories that redefine the stateâ€”from culture and business to changemakers and infrastructure. Follow us for stories that matter.\u003c/p\u003e",
