        "title":  "Bihar e-Sanjeevani Surpasses 129% Target",
        "summary":  "à¤¬à¤¿à¤¹à¤¾à¤° à¤•à¥‡ à¤—à¤¾à¤‚à¤µà¥‹à¤‚ à¤®à¥‡à¤‚ à¤†à¤¯à¤¾ à¤Ÿà¥‡à¤²à¥€à¤®à¥‡à¤¡à¤¿à¤¸à¤¿à¤¨ à¤•à¥à¤°à¤¾à¤‚à¤¤à¤¿! Patna, Gopalganj \u0026 Arwal Transform Rural Healthcare with Daily 30K+ Consultationsâ€ When Villages Call, Doctor...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eà¤¬à¤¿à¤¹à¤¾à¤° à¤•à¥‡ à¤—à¤¾à¤‚à¤µà¥‹à¤‚ à¤®à¥‡à¤‚ à¤†à¤¯à¤¾ à¤Ÿà¥‡à¤²à¥€à¤®à¥‡à¤¡à¤¿à¤¸à¤¿à¤¨ à¤•à¥à¤°à¤¾à¤‚à¤¤à¤¿! Patna, Gopalganj \u0026 Arwal Transform Rural Healthcare with Daily 30K+ Consultationsâ€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen Villages Call, Doctors Now Answer Instantly â€“ Welcome to Biharâ€™s Telemedicine Revolution!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine youâ€™re in a remote village with no doctor in sightâ€”but with a click, a screen lights up, and a specialist appears. This is no longer imagination. This is Biharâ€™s new rural reality. Thanks to an expanding telemedicine network, thousands of people across the state are now receiving medical consultations from the comfort of their own communities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery day, over 30,000 people in Bihar benefit from real-time online doctor consultations under the government-backed E-Sanjeevani platform. What was once a luxury is now becoming a necessity for many in rural districts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGopalganj, Patna \u0026 Arwal: Leading the Digital Health Charge\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn May 2025, three districts rose to the topâ€”Gopalganj, Patna, and Arwal.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGopalganj: Achieved 129% of its teleconsultation target, making it the most efficient district. Patna: Met 100% of its set goals. Arwal: Followed closely, fulfilling 99% of its target.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGopalganj: Achieved 129% of its teleconsultation target, making it the most efficient district.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePatna: Met 100% of its set goals.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArwal: Followed closely, fulfilling 99% of its target.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis achievement is not just statistical. In Gopalganj, people now consider the service a lifesaver. Villagers say that instead of travelling miles or postponing treatment, they now walk to their local Spoke Hub, get connected instantly, and receive proper medical adviceâ€”sometimes even prescriptions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Powers This Telemedicine Ecosystem?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo enable this level of service, the Bihar Health Department has deployed serious infrastructure:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e40 Telemedicine Hubs across the state. 1,238 doctors providing regular teleconsultations. Over 12,000 ANMs (Auxiliary Nurse Midwives) supporting frontline operations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e40 Telemedicine Hubs across the state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1,238 doctors providing regular teleconsultations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver 12,000 ANMs (Auxiliary Nurse Midwives) supporting frontline operations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach hub is designed to handle 75 consultations per day, while every spoke centre is expected to serve at least 5 patients daily. And itâ€™s working.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut the success doesnâ€™t come without active governance. Health officials closely monitor hub performances. Non-responsive doctors or missing logins are flagged and followed up with.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReal Stories, Real Impact\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePeople arenâ€™t just using the serviceâ€”theyâ€™re trusting it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom chronic patients in Patnaâ€™s outskirts to expectant mothers in Arwal, individuals now feel more connected to quality care. The digital divide is narrowing. And for thousands of Biharâ€™s rural families, healthcare no longer means delay.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis shift has been driven in part by Chief Minister Nitish Kumarâ€™s vision for equitable healthcare in every corner of the state. With targeted health outreach and innovative technology adoption, Bihar is redefining grassroots medical access.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ’¥ Want to track more such positive transformations from Bihar?Be part of the movement thatâ€™s reshaping Biharâ€™s story. Follow www.biharsay.com â€” the leading apolitical storytelling platform from Bihar, spotlighting culture, grassroots change, business, and healthcare evolution.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin our 11k+ community across the globe. Letâ€™s bring the best of Bihar to the world.\u003c/p\u003e",
