        "content":  "\u003cp\u003e120 Nagar Nigam, 1 Big Change: Biharâ€™s Power Shift Will Hit Your Bill But Brighten Your Life!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œà¤¶à¤¹à¤° à¤•à¤¾ à¤Ÿà¥ˆà¤— à¤®à¤¿à¤²à¥‡à¤—à¤¾ à¤¤à¥‹ à¤¬à¤¿à¤œà¤²à¥€ à¤•à¤¾ à¤à¤Ÿà¤•à¤¾ à¤­à¥€!â€But with that shock comes round-the-clock electricity and brand-new services youâ€™ve never had before. Hereâ€™s what Biharâ€™s urban push means for youâ€”rupees, rules, and real reforms.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œà¤¶à¤¹à¤° à¤•à¤¾ à¤Ÿà¥ˆà¤— à¤®à¤¿à¤²à¥‡à¤—à¤¾ à¤¤à¥‹ à¤¬à¤¿à¤œà¤²à¥€ à¤•à¤¾ à¤à¤Ÿà¤•à¤¾ à¤­à¥€!â€But with that shock comes round-the-clock electricity and brand-new services youâ€™ve never had before. Hereâ€™s what Biharâ€™s urban push means for youâ€”rupees, rules, and real reforms.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e120 New Urban Local Bodies = Urban Power Tariff for Thousands\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar has recently declared 120 new Nagar Nigams, Parishads, and Panchayats. That means a lot more people will now fall under urban electricity billing, even if theyâ€™re still adjusting to this new identity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEarlier, these areas paid rural power rates, but now, as per the updated policy by the state electricity company, the moment your area is declared an urban body, youâ€™ll be charged urban power tariffsâ€”which are at least â‚¹1.67 more per unit.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut what do you get in return?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLetâ€™s break it down\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Changes for You? From Bills to Benefits\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow that your area is officially urban, your electricity bill will increase, sureâ€”but thatâ€™s not the full story.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHereâ€™s what you gain in return:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e24Ã—7 power supply as per city-grade standards. Transformer replacement within 24 hours if it fails. A dedicated control room, reachable any time for power complaints. Fast redressal of electricity issuesâ€”no more waiting days for fixes. Access to urban-standard customer service and support.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e24Ã—7 power supply as per city-grade standards.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTransformer replacement within 24 hours if it fails.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA dedicated control room, reachable any time for power complaints.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFast redressal of electricity issuesâ€”no more waiting days for fixes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccess to urban-standard customer service and support.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClearly, this isnâ€™t just a change in rateâ€”itâ€™s a change in service mindset.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHolding Tax, Electricity, and Urban Governance: The Bigger Picture\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver the past 2-3 years, the Bihar government has rapidly reclassified many regions. While Urban Development Department quickly begins collecting holding tax and other municipal levies, the power department has lagged behind in practical implementation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDespite official paperwork indicating urban status, many feeders still supply electricity based on rural categorization. Thatâ€™s now being correctedâ€”with clear software upgrades and feeder realignments underway.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo, yesâ€”this is not just about money. Itâ€™s about integrating you into the urban framework completelyâ€”infra, services, taxes, and technology included.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Now? And What Next?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe shift isnâ€™t randomâ€”itâ€™s part of Biharâ€™s larger vision to modernize infrastructure and equalize service standards across its geography. With the increase in urban local bodies, the state hopes to offer consistent, reliable, and fair utility services, regardless of the pin code.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo, while you may grumble over the â‚¹1.67 spike per unit, the round-the-clock electricity, rapid transformer replacement, and city-level grievance redressal could change your daily life dramatically.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThatâ€™s what this reform really promises: not just more billing, but better living.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ“¢ Donâ€™t Miss Out on Whatâ€™s Changing in Your Town\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant to keep track of what else is transforming in Biharâ€”from your local road to your power line?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Follow www.biharsay.com for verified updates, grassroots stories, and development that matters.ðŸ“² Be a part of our growing 11K+ community worldwide that believes Bihar deserves better headlines.\u003c/p\u003e",
