        "id":  "quickkshop-bihar-brothers-eco-friendly-footwear-brand-wins-national-climate-award",
        "title":  "Quickkshop: Bihar Brothersâ€™ Eco-Friendly Footwear Brand Wins National Climate Award",
        "summary":  "Walking Green: Quickkshopâ€™s Footwear Revolution from Bihar to the World Quickkshop, a sustainable footwear brand founded by brothers Ashit Singh and Aadarsh Singh, is rewriting the script of eco-conscious livingâ€”one slipper at...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eWalking Green: Quickkshopâ€™s Footwear Revolution from Bihar to the World\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuickkshop, a sustainable footwear brand founded by brothers Ashit Singh and Aadarsh Singh, is rewriting the script of eco-conscious livingâ€”one slipper at a time. Originally from Sonpur, Chapra in Bihar, the duo shifted to Noida, where they launched this brand with a mission: make footwear that treads lightly on the planet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBorn in Bihar, Built for the Planet\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBacked only by their bootstrapped savings and a vision, Ashit (the elder) and Aadarsh (the younger) began Quickkshop under their parent company, Araa Internet Pvt. Ltd. Unlike conventional footwear brands, they focused on biodegradable materials like rice straw, bamboo straw, and korai grass.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImportantly, their innovation recently earned them the â€œOutlook Planet C3 â€“ Climate, Circularity \u0026 Community Awardâ€, placing them among Indiaâ€™s top climate-conscious innovators.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBridging the Gap Between E-Commerce and Eco-Commerce\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNot only does Quickkshop operate online, but their hybrid model also blends digital access with an in-store experience. With their offline retail model, Quickkshop 99, customers can explore affordable, eco-conscious products in person before buying.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEverything is priced ending in â€˜9â€™, keeping budgets in check while offering essentials from toys to kitchenware. Moreover, this seamless fusion of retail formats enhances trust and accessibility.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Science of Use-and-Decompose Footwear\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo, what makes Quickkshop truly revolutionary?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTheir slippers and flip-flops start decomposing within 2â€“3 days of use. These products are non-waterproof, allowing them to absorb moisture and break down naturally. No special disposal methods are requiredâ€”just use them and let nature take care of the rest.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs a result, these slippers are now widely used in luxury resorts, Ayurvedic hospitals, and by eco-conscious travelers who care deeply about sustainability.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTrusted by Global Hospitality Giants\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBecause of their green vision, Quickkshopâ€™s biodegradable slippers are now a preferred product for luxury chains like Oberoi Hotels (Dubai \u0026 UAE) and CGH Earth (South India). Bulk orders from these giants range from 10,000 to 25,000 pieces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition, direct customers can shop Quickkshop footwear on Amazon, Flipkart, JioMart, and even quick-delivery platforms like Blinkit.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHealing Feet and the Earth\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese natural slippers donâ€™t just degradeâ€”they heal. Rooted in Ayurvedic principles, their natural fibers help regulate body temperature and promote balance. Therefore, the brandâ€™s focus on health, harmony, and environment makes their products a hit among alternative healing centers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFuture-Ready, Demand-Driven\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuickkshop keeps its inventory lean and scalable. For online buyers, they stock small batches of 1,000â€“1,500 units, while fulfilling massive B2B demands from hotels and hospitals.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBecause of this adaptability, their ability to scale sustainably shows that green businesses can grow without compromising values.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe story of Ashit and Aadarsh Singh is more than a startup taleâ€”itâ€™s a call to action for young Indians, especially from small towns, to think big, act responsibly, and walk green.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Follow more such inspiring, apolitical and homegrown innovations on www.biharsay.com and become part of our growing 11,000+ strong global community reshaping Biharâ€™s digital identity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Say is Biharâ€™s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, bringing to light stories that matterâ€”from grassroots change to startup revolutions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin us. Share the story. Spark the change.\u003c/p\u003e",
