        "id":  "new-4-lane-in-bihar-to-connect-bhagalpur-to-jharkhand",
        "title":  "New 4-Lane in Bihar to Connect Bhagalpur to Jharkhand",
        "summary":  "7 Villages. 1 Game-Changing Road. How This New Four-Lane Is Quietly Transforming Biharâ€™s Future A New Lifeline: Biharâ€™s Fast-Tracked Four-Lane to Connect Bhagalpur to Jharkhand â€œà¤¬à¤¦à¤²à¤¾à¤µ à¤•à¥€ à¤¶à¥à¤°à¥à¤†à¤¤ à¤¸à...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003e7 Villages. 1 Game-Changing Road. How This New Four-Lane Is Quietly Transforming Biharâ€™s Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA New Lifeline: Biharâ€™s Fast-Tracked Four-Lane to Connect Bhagalpur to Jharkhand\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œà¤¬à¤¦à¤²à¤¾à¤µ à¤•à¥€ à¤¶à¥à¤°à¥à¤†à¤¤ à¤¸à¤¡à¤¼à¤•à¥‹à¤‚ à¤¸à¥‡ à¤¹à¥‹à¤¤à¥€ à¤¹à¥ˆâ€â€”and in Bihar, this transformation is happening one highway at a time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA new four-lane highway is on the horizon, and itâ€™s not just about asphaltâ€”itâ€™s about accessibility, commerce, and a faster route to progress. This upcoming stretch will directly connect Bhagalpur in Bihar to Hansdiha in Jharkhand. That means faster travel, smoother logistics, and a big push toward rural development.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLand Acquisition in Full Swing: 406 Landowners Impacted\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo turn this vision into reality, land acquisition is already in motion. In Banka district, the process is gathering pace between Aliganj Bypass Thana and Dhakamod, covering Km 117 to 134â€”a total of 40.072 hectares.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs per the recent gazette notification, the government will acquire private land from 406 landowners across 7 villages in the Chandan and Katoria blocks. This also includes government plots, fallow lands, residential properties, and even a Kali temple.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe affected residents have been granted a 21-day window from the gazette release date to file objections. They can submit their responses in writing to the local land acquisition office, after which the designated authority will handle the redressal.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Road Really Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is more than just another infrastructure project. Hereâ€™s what it brings to the table:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoosted Connectivity: Travel between Bihar and Jharkhand will become smoother and faster. Business Growth: Enhanced logistics will uplift trade, agriculture, and small businesses. Local Development: Better roads bring better access to schools, hospitals, and jobs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoosted Connectivity: Travel between Bihar and Jharkhand will become smoother and faster.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBusiness Growth: Enhanced logistics will uplift trade, agriculture, and small businesses.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocal Development: Better roads bring better access to schools, hospitals, and jobs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis four-lane isnâ€™t just laying concreteâ€”itâ€™s laying the groundwork for sustainable growth. Once the acquisition is finalized, construction will commence swiftly, turning this blueprint into a lifeline.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e7 Villages Set to Witness Major Change\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe seven villages in Chandan and Katoria blocks now find themselves on the map of development. While change often comes with resistance, this transformation promises new opportunities for the generations to come.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ’¬ Want to stay ahead with such future-defining Bihar updates?Join the community of over 11,000 followers from across the world who trust www.biharsay.com for non-political, inspiring, and transformational stories from the real Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Follow Bihar Say â€” Biharâ€™s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, reshaping the stateâ€™s image through real stories of development, culture, and courage.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸŽ§ Also explore BiharCast, our flagship podcast series featuring grassroots changemakers and untold tales from Biharâ€™s heartlands.\u003c/p\u003e",
