        "title":  "No More Inverters at Home? Biharâ€™s Gov. Battery System Promises 4 Hours of Backup During Power Cuts!",
        "summary":  "à¤…à¤¬ à¤‡à¤¨à¥à¤µà¤°à¥à¤Ÿà¤° à¤•à¥€ à¤›à¥à¤Ÿà¥à¤Ÿà¥€! Biharâ€™s Game-Changing Power Backup: 500 MWh Battery Storage to Light Up 15 Citiesâ€ Now, No More Inverters at Home! Bihar Powers Ahead with Grid-Scale Battery Storage S...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eà¤…à¤¬ à¤‡à¤¨à¥à¤µà¤°à¥à¤Ÿà¤° à¤•à¥€ à¤›à¥à¤Ÿà¥à¤Ÿà¥€! Biharâ€™s Game-Changing Power Backup: 500 MWh Battery Storage to Light Up 15 Citiesâ€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow, No More Inverters at Home! Bihar Powers Ahead with Grid-Scale Battery Storage System\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eà¤•à¥à¤¯à¤¾ à¤†à¤ªà¤¨à¥‡ à¤•à¤­à¥€ à¤¸à¥‹à¤šà¤¾ à¤¹à¥ˆ à¤•à¤¿ à¤¬à¤¿à¤œà¤²à¥€ à¤œà¤¾à¤¨à¥‡ à¤ªà¤° à¤†à¤ªà¤•à¤¾ à¤ªà¥‚à¤°à¤¾ à¤¶à¤¹à¤° à¤¬à¤¿à¤¨à¤¾ à¤‡à¤¨à¥à¤µà¤°à¥à¤Ÿà¤° à¤•à¥‡ à¤°à¥‹à¤¶à¤¨ à¤°à¤¹à¥‡\u0027hat future is hereâ€”and itâ€™s being built in Bihar. While the rest of India still depends on home inverters, Bihar is leaping ahead with a revolutionary grid-scale battery energy storage system (BESS) that promises uninterrupted electricity for up to four hours during power cuts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar to Strengthen 15 Sub-Grid Stations with 125 MW of Battery Backup\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJust like your home inverter kicks in during a blackout, Biharâ€™s new storage system will do the sameâ€”but for entire towns.As per the official announcement, 15 sub-grid stations across Bihar will be equipped with battery storage units of 5 to 20 MW capacity, adding up to a total of 125 MW, with a storage capacity of 500 MWh.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is not just an infrastructure upgradeâ€”itâ€™s a smart energy revolution.By storing surplus power and releasing it during demand peaks or outages, this project ensures grid stability and energy security.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMassive Funding and Central Approval: â‚¹135 Crores for a 500 MWh Clean Energy Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ministry of New and Renewable Energy (MNRE) has approved this ambitious plan under the Viability Gap Funding (VGF) scheme.The Central Government has sanctioned â‚¹135 crores, covering â‚¹27 lakhs per MWh or 30% of the capital cost, whichever is lower.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe execution responsibility lies with Bihar State Power Generation Company Limited (BSPGCL). This ensures transparency and state accountability for timely deployment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters: Energy Storage is the Future of Reliable Electricity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDuring Biharâ€™s scorching summers, power demand surges beyond control. This grid-scale BESS offers a solution:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStore power when demand is low. Release power instantly when needed. No noise, no diesel, no local inverter hassle. Support the integration of solar and renewable energy in the future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStore power when demand is low.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRelease power instantly when needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo noise, no diesel, no local inverter hassle.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSupport the integration of solar and renewable energy in the future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is not just about backupâ€”itâ€™s about building resilience into Biharâ€™s power grid.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTargeted Cities \u0026 Strategic Impact\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis smart grid system will be implemented in 15 key cities (names to be confirmed in official documents), each equipped with intelligent energy buffers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach sub-grid station will handle 5 to 20 MW, depending on city size and power demand. The overall 500 MWh backup will keep essential services, homes, and businesses running smoothly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat This Means for Biharâ€™s Energy Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith this move, Bihar is not just catching upâ€”itâ€™s setting a benchmark.From urban centers to tier-2 towns, energy reliability means more productivity, safety, and progress.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd guess what? If implemented efficiently, you may soon no longer need that bulky inverter at home.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more such powerful updates that redefine Biharâ€™s future, follow www.biharsay.com and join our 11K+ strong global community.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Say is your apolitical voice, telling the most impactful and unheard stories of Biharâ€”from grassroots transformation to visionary infrastructure.\u003c/p\u003e",
