        "title":  "Eklavya State Residential Sports Trials Begin in Bihar",
        "summary":  "Biharâ€™s Eklavya Sports Trials Spark Dreams for Future Stars Biharâ€™s Bold Step for Young Athletes â€œThis is more than a trialâ€”itâ€™s a chance to rewrite futures through sports.â€ Bihar has launched the Eklavya State Residen...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Eklavya Sports Trials Spark Dreams for Future Stars\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Bold Step for Young Athletes\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œThis is more than a trialâ€”itâ€™s a chance to rewrite futures through sports.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar has launched the Eklavya State Residential Sports Training Centre trials, aiming to discover hidden talent among children aged 12 to 14 years. This initiative, part of the Mukhyamantri Khel Vikas Yojana, is not just about selecting playersâ€”itâ€™s about empowering them for life.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYoung athletes registering for the trials arenâ€™t just competingâ€”theyâ€™re chasing a dream. Through rigorous physical and skill-based evaluation, the state aims to select raw talent and train them into national champions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMunger Trials: Real Talent, Real Passion\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe latest trial took place at Sheetalpur Ground in Munger. A total of 152 players, including 22 girls and 130 boys, participated with unmatched enthusiasm.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery sprint, every kick, every pass revealed how Biharâ€™s sports scene is changing. The children came not just from cities, but also remote villagesâ€”carrying ambition, hunger, and grit.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese trials are happening across multiple districts and will cover 18 different sports disciplines, including football, wrestling, athletics, and kabaddi.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow the Selection Process Works\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRavindran Shankaran, Director General and CEO of Bihar State Sports Authority, explained that selection will be based on physical fitness and game skills. Points will be awarded in both categories, and top scorers will be selected.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis process ensures that talent and effort, not privilege, decide the outcome. The government is providing everything necessaryâ€”residential stay, nutritious food, structured training, and education.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCoaches Who Shape Confidence and Champions\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery selected player will train under qualified, experienced coaches. These mentors sharpen sporting skills while instilling values such as discipline, teamwork, and leadership.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe coaching curriculum focuses on both physical performance and character development. Players will learn how to win with humility and lose with resilience.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Makes This Initiative Unique\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEklavya centers in Bihar do more than just train athletes. They create an environment where young individuals grow into balanced, confident personalities. With access to free education, healthcare, meals, and mentoring, players can focus entirely on performance and learning.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe early-stage selection gives children enough time to evolve into medal-winning athletes. Biharâ€™s efforts aim to build a strong bench of future-ready sports leaders who can make their mark on national and international platforms.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the Movement Thatâ€™s Changing Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis initiative reflects Biharâ€™s firm belief in its youth. By recognizing talent early and nurturing it with full support, the state is investing in long-term success.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you are a parent, coach, or sports enthusiast, now is the time to act. Encourage participation, share the information, and be part of Biharâ€™s sports transformation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow www.biharsay.com for the latest trial schedules, athlete journeys, and inspiring grassroots stories. Join our 11K+ global community that believes in the power of real stories and collective change.\u003c/p\u003e",
