        "id":  "50-subsidy-on-maize-paddy-seeds-for-bihar-farmers",
        "title":  "50% Subsidy on Maize \u0026 Paddy Seeds for Bihar Farmers",
        "summary":  "A Golden Opportunity for Farmers in Bihar ðŸŒ¾ Imagine buying top-quality maize and paddy seeds at almost half the priceâ€”sounds like a dream? Itâ€™s not. Itâ€™s happening right now in Biharâ€™s Nawada district. In a significant ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eA Golden Opportunity for Farmers in Bihar ðŸŒ¾\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine buying top-quality maize and paddy seeds at almost half the priceâ€”sounds like a dream? Itâ€™s not. Itâ€™s happening right now in Biharâ€™s Nawada district.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a significant stride towards agricultural upliftment, 42 farmers in Rajouli block gathered this week at the e-Kisan Bhavan, where they received high-yield maize and paddy seeds at subsidized rates. The smiles on their faces said it allâ€”this initiative isnâ€™t just a distribution drive; itâ€™s a promise for a better yield, better income, and a better tomorrow.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubsidy That Makes a Real Difference\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFarmers in Sirdaula, Narhat, Akbarpur, and Govindpur blocks are already benefiting from the scheme. Hereâ€™s how:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMaize Seeds (8 kg packet): â‚¹1055 Paddy Seeds (3 kg): Just â‚¹10 per kg Subsidy Rate: 50%\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMaize Seeds (8 kg packet): â‚¹1055\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePaddy Seeds (3 kg): Just â‚¹10 per kg\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubsidy Rate: 50%\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor small and medium-scale farmers, this isnâ€™t just supportâ€”itâ€™s a game-changer. With a drastic cut in input costs, profits are likely to increase, making farming more sustainable and rewarding.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBacked by the Agriculture Department\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis impactful initiative is not a one-time affair. Dhyananjay Kumar, the in-charge Agriculture Officer, shared that every year, seed distribution is planned as per crop season and regional requirements. The vision? To empower more farmers, boost local produce, and reduce reliance on unpredictable market prices.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo ensure last-mile delivery, Sariyo Enterprises has been assigned the seed supply chainâ€”a strategic step to eliminate logistical hurdles.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFarmers Feel Heard, Valued, and Hopeful\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt the seed distribution site, the atmosphere was electric. Farmers who received the packets spoke with optimism. â€œFinally, we are not just farmingâ€”we are planning for progress,â€ one of them said. Their faith in the system has been restored, and they believe that with consistent support, their yield will not just improve, but thrive.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is not just newsâ€”itâ€™s a quiet revolution brewing in Biharâ€™s soil.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ’¡ Want more such inspiring and real stories from the heart of Bihar?Follow www.biharsay.com for daily updates and be part of the 11k+ global community that believes in Biharâ€™s rise.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Say is Biharâ€™s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, reshaping the stateâ€™s image through grassroots impact, cultural pride, and entrepreneurial inspiration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom viral podcasts like BiharCast to top-performing stories on DailyHunt, we are Biharâ€™s digital voice.\u003c/p\u003e",
