        "id":  "bihar-sugarcane-mechanization-scheme-subsidy-portal-launched-for-farmers",
        "title":  "Bihar Sugarcane Mechanization Scheme Subsidy Portal Launched for Farmers",
        "summary":  "à¤…à¤¬ à¤•à¤¿à¤¸à¤¾à¤¨ à¤¨à¤¹à¥€à¤‚ à¤–à¤°à¥€à¤¦à¥‡à¤‚à¤—à¥‡ à¤¥à¤•à¤¾à¤¨, à¤®à¤¶à¥€à¤¨ à¤šà¤²à¤¾à¤à¤—à¤¾ à¤—à¤¨à¥à¤¨à¥‡ à¤•à¤¾ à¤®à¥ˆà¤¦à¤¾à¤¨!â€ Bihar Launches Sugarcane Mechanization Scheme Portal: Modern Tools, Maximum Yiel...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eà¤…à¤¬ à¤•à¤¿à¤¸à¤¾à¤¨ à¤¨à¤¹à¥€à¤‚ à¤–à¤°à¥€à¤¦à¥‡à¤‚à¤—à¥‡ à¤¥à¤•à¤¾à¤¨, à¤®à¤¶à¥€à¤¨ à¤šà¤²à¤¾à¤à¤—à¤¾ à¤—à¤¨à¥à¤¨à¥‡ à¤•à¤¾ à¤®à¥ˆà¤¦à¤¾à¤¨!â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Launches Sugarcane Mechanization Scheme Portal: Modern Tools, Maximum Yields\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTech Meets Tradition: A New Era for Sugarcane Farmers in Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s sugarcane farmers just received a much-needed boost. The state government has launched a dedicated online portal under the Sugarcane Mechanization Scheme, allowing farmers to apply for subsidies on 33 modern agricultural tools.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis forward-looking move by the Department of Sugarcane Industries promises to ease labor, improve productivity, and cut costs in sugarcane farming. Importantly, it puts Biharâ€™s sugarcane sector on a tech-driven track.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnder the â‚¹10 crore initiative, farmers can apply for up to three tools each. The selection process will take place via an online lottery system, ensuring transparency. Once selected, farmers must purchase tools only through the portal, directly from approved vendors.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow the Scheme Will Empower Farmers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe scheme has a clear aimâ€”to introduce modern equipment at subsidized rates to help farmers reduce dependency on manual labor. As farming becomes more competitive, access to reliable tools can make a huge difference in output and income.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe portal is open to registered farmers with a valid 13-digit DBT ID. Applications can be submitted at https://ccs.bihar.gov.in or https://sugarcanemech.bihar.gov.in.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFarmers selected through the lottery system will receive a letter of approval. They must purchase the listed tools within 14 days, directly from vendors listed on the portal.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Kind of Equipment Is Covered?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe scheme covers tools that span the entire crop cycleâ€”from land preparation to harvesting. This includes:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePower tillers Seeders and planters Fertilizer applicators Sprayers Mechanical harvesters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePower tillers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeeders and planters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFertilizer applicators\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSprayers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMechanical harvesters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition to individual benefits, the scheme also includes provisions for group-based machinery banks. This will ensure shared access to expensive tools, especially for marginal farmers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScientific Farming, Real Returns\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis scheme isnâ€™t just about machinesâ€”itâ€™s about mindset change. With this, Biharâ€™s sugarcane sector is moving toward precision agriculture, where every stepâ€”from sowing to sprayingâ€”is based on efficiency.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs pest control becomes more targeted and planting more accurate, the expected outcome is higher yields with fewer losses. For farmers, this means better margins, more time saved, and less physical exhaustion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe government hopes that through mechanization, not only will costs drop, but farmers will also be motivated to adopt sustainable and scientific methods of farming.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhoâ€™s Behind the Launch?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe scheme was launched by the stateâ€™s Sugarcane Industry Department. Present at the event were senior officials including:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eB. Karthikeyan Dhanji (Secretary) Anil Kumar Jha (Sugarcane Commissioner) Mahendra Pratap Singh (Joint Director) Jay Prakash Narayan Singh (Joint Commissioner) Sanjay Kumar (Senior Technical Director, NIC)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eB. Karthikeyan Dhanji (Secretary)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnil Kumar Jha (Sugarcane Commissioner)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMahendra Pratap Singh (Joint Director)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJay Prakash Narayan Singh (Joint Commissioner)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSanjay Kumar (Senior Technical Director, NIC)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTheir coordinated effort reflects the intent to digitize and modernize the farm sector at the grassroots level.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant to stay updated with Biharâ€™s changing agricultural landscape?ðŸ‘‰ Join the 11,000+ readers at www.biharsay.com â€” Biharâ€™s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe bring stories of development, innovation, and everyday changemakersâ€”without noise, without bias.Follow us for deep dives into Biharâ€™s progress, from farms to factories, from soil to startup.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸŽ™ Check out our exclusive series BiharCast for interviews, insights, and inspirationâ€”from the heart of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e",
