        "title":  "Bihar Assembly\u0027s First Digital Museum Set to Open on 1.74 Acres",
        "summary":  "â€œBiharâ€™s First-Ever Digital Assembly Museum to Rise on 1.74 Acres â€“ A Landmark Tribute to 100 Years of Political Legacyâ€ â€œEk Museum, Jo Batayega Bihar Ki Rajneeti Ki Kahani â€“ Now, Digitally!â€ In a groundbreaking move...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eâ€œBiharâ€™s First-Ever Digital Assembly Museum to Rise on 1.74 Acres â€“ A Landmark Tribute to 100 Years of Political Legacyâ€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œEk Museum, Jo Batayega Bihar Ki Rajneeti Ki Kahani â€“ Now, Digitally!â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a groundbreaking move to preserve its rich political legacy, Bihar is building something historic â€” and digital. A Digital Assembly Museum will soon rise on 1.74 acres of land, right at the heart of the Bihar Vidhan Sabha campus. With a sanctioned cost of â‚¹48.76 crore, this is not just another museum. Itâ€™s a digital time machine that will bring alive 100 years of Biharâ€™s legislative history.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet that sink in. One museum. One place. A century of governance, debates, leadership, and change â€” all under one interactive digital roof.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhatâ€™s Being Built and Whoâ€™s Behind It?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe responsibility to build this state-of-the-art facility has been handed over to the Building Construction Department. Under the guidance of Vidhansabha Speaker and Secretary Kumar Ravi, the project has already moved past the tender phase. Construction is all set to begin shortly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe building itself will be ground plus one floor and fully equipped with modern tech and immersive digital displays. Itâ€™s designed to digitally archive Biharâ€™s chief ministers, legislative speakers, and all MLAs. Every major legislative decision, landmark bill, and political milestone will be digitally presented, creating a legacy that speaks across generations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Will You See Inside?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHereâ€™s what makes this museum special:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFive Digital Galleries showcasing different timelines and political personalities. An auditorium with 356-seat capacity, fitted with advanced AV tech. A media gallery to host 50 people, designed to help journalists and researchers. A conference hall for 50 individuals, perfect for seminars and youth programs. Digital archives narrating Biharâ€™s democratic journey with touchscreens, voice guides, and visuals.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFive Digital Galleries showcasing different timelines and political personalities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAn auditorium with 356-seat capacity, fitted with advanced AV tech.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA media gallery to host 50 people, designed to help journalists and researchers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA conference hall for 50 individuals, perfect for seminars and youth programs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDigital archives narrating Biharâ€™s democratic journey with touchscreens, voice guides, and visuals.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach gallery will be a portal into Biharâ€™s democratic evolution â€” from the very first Assembly session to the transformative decisions of today.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy It Matters for Biharâ€™s Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isnâ€™t just about preserving the past. Itâ€™s about inspiring the next generation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBy turning legislative history into an interactive experience, Bihar is embracing the future while honoring its roots. Students, researchers, civil society, and curious citizens will finally get a space that is both informative and inspirational. Itâ€™s not just historyâ€”itâ€™s heritage that you can touch, see, hear, and learn from.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd in a time when misinformation often drowns out facts, digitally preserving verified records is a masterstroke. Bihar is setting an example that other states may soon follow.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhatâ€™s Next?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstruction will begin shortly. Once complete, this digital museum will become a landmark â€” a physical and intellectual destination for everyone interested in Biharâ€™s political identity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ“£ Be the first to know how it evolves.Follow www.biharsay.com for regular updates, and become part of our growing 11k+ community worldwide!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ’¡ Bihar Say is Biharâ€™s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, reshaping how the world sees Bihar â€” through impactful stories on culture, business, and grassroots change. With partnerships across platforms like DailyHunt, viral series like BiharCast, and unmatched digital storytelling, weâ€™re the voice Bihar deserves.\u003c/p\u003e",
