        "id":  "patnas-3d-bapu-tower-draws-52000-visitors",
        "title":  "Patnaâ€™s 3D Bapu Tower Draws 52,000+ Visitors",
        "summary":  "A museum you donâ€™t just walk throughâ€”you feel it, see it, and live it. Welcome to Bapu Tower, Patnaâ€™s copper-clad marvel telling Gandhiâ€™s story like never before. Architecture That Inspires Located in Patnaâ€™s Gardanibagh...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eA museum you donâ€™t just walk throughâ€”you feel it, see it, and live it. Welcome to Bapu Tower, Patnaâ€™s copper-clad marvel telling Gandhiâ€™s story like never before.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArchitecture That Inspires\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in Patnaâ€™s Gardanibagh area, Bapu Tower is not just a monumentâ€”itâ€™s a living narrative built in metal and memory. The standout feature? Its conical structure wrapped in 42,000 kg of copper, designed to naturally oxidize and change hues over time. This evolving faÃ§ade makes it a visual spectacle, admired by architects and tourists alike.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe site features two main buildings:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA six-storey rectangular structure housing research facilities, a museum lounge, an auditorium, and more. A five-storey conical tower that captures the imagination with digital installations and 3D galleries.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA six-storey rectangular structure housing research facilities, a museum lounge, an auditorium, and more.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA five-storey conical tower that captures the imagination with digital installations and 3D galleries.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDigital Meets Traditional Storytelling\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat makes Bapu Tower special is its ability to blend heritage with innovation. Gandhiâ€™s life isnâ€™t displayed in dusty glass frames here. Instead, visitors experience:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpiraling digital galleries with murals, holograms, and motion-based exhibits. 360Â° rotating theatre screens offering immersive storytelling. Touch-based, bilingual displays (Hindi \u0026 English) that guide visitors through historic milestones.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpiraling digital galleries with murals, holograms, and motion-based exhibits.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e360Â° rotating theatre screens offering immersive storytelling.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTouch-based, bilingual displays (Hindi \u0026 English) that guide visitors through historic milestones.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis modern format helps younger audiences connect with Gandhiâ€™s philosophies in a format they understand and enjoy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for Everyone\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInclusivity is at the heart of Bapu Tower. The premises offer:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWheelchair-accessible paths Separate entry and facilities for differently-abled individuals Green zones and thoughtful seating to relax after the tour\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWheelchair-accessible paths\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeparate entry and facilities for differently-abled individuals\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGreen zones and thoughtful seating to relax after the tour\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA gift shop and cafÃ© add comfort to the visit, while the surrounding gardens provide a peaceful escape in the middle of the city.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLighting Up the City\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs the sun sets, Bapu Tower lights up in spectacular shades, thanks to facade lighting that reflects off the copper like molten gold. Along with nearby upgraded buildings like Vikas Bhawan and Visvesvaraya Bhawan, this zone now glows with architectural prideâ€”adding to Patnaâ€™s evolving skyline.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver 52,000 Visitorsâ€”and Growing\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSince its launch, Bapu Tower has seen over 52,000+ footfalls from tourists, families, students, and architecture lovers.So whatâ€™s drawing the crowds?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImmersive storytelling with a tech twist Photogenic copper-clad structure Rich cultural, educational experience in one place Peaceful, thoughtfully designed space in the heart of the city\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImmersive storytelling with a tech twist\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePhotogenic copper-clad structure\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRich cultural, educational experience in one place\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePeaceful, thoughtfully designed space in the heart of the city\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe growing buzz shows how a well-executed blend of culture and design can redefine public spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Milestone in Biharâ€™s Modern Infrastructure\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bihar Building Construction Department has reimagined what civic architecture can be. From the advanced Bapu Exam Centre with 25,000 capacity to new district complexes and tech-enabled administrative buildings, the state is moving from functional to futuristic.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBapu Tower is its flagship cultural landmarkâ€”proving that public buildings can be aesthetic, educational, and globally admired.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ“¢ Be Part of Biharâ€™s New Narrative\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is more than a museum. Itâ€™s Biharâ€™s statement to the worldâ€”a symbol of where tradition meets tomorrow.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ”— For more inspiring stories like this, follow www.biharsay.comðŸŽ§ Join 11,000+ global followers discovering untold stories through our articles, videos, and flagship podcast, BiharCast.ðŸ“² Be part of the platform reshaping how the world sees Biharâ€”one story at a time.\u003c/p\u003e",
