        "title":  "Bihar Idea Festival Portal Launched for Startups \u0026 Students",
        "summary":  "Bihar Wants Your Ideasâ€”Are You Ready to Step Up? From village classrooms to city cafÃ©s, innovation lives everywhere in Bihar. And now, the state government wants to hear from you. On July 14, Biharâ€™s Industries Minister Nitis...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar Wants Your Ideasâ€”Are You Ready to Step Up?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom village classrooms to city cafÃ©s, innovation lives everywhere in Bihar. And now, the state government wants to hear from you.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn July 14, Biharâ€™s Industries Minister Nitish Mishra unveiled the Bihar Idea Festivalâ€”a new digital platform designed for students, entrepreneurs, and startups. It allows anyone with a bold idea to share their vision and help shape the stateâ€™s industrial future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is more than just a portal. Itâ€™s a signal that Bihar is ready to listen, support, and scale ideas that can transform lives.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Is the Bihar Idea Festival?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bihar Idea Festival is a first-of-its-kind initiative by the Department of Industries, in association with JEEViKA and other partners. Its mission is to collect more than 10,000 innovative ideas from all 38 districts of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInstead of chasing innovation in urban centres alone, the portal focuses on grassroots entrepreneurship. It invites solutions for local challengesâ€”from sustainable farming to health tech, from education tools to rural business models.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf youâ€™ve ever thought, â€œThis idea could change something,â€ now is the time to act.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApply Now: https://form.jotform.com/251672542430452\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScan the QR code to register via WhatsApp wa.me/919742956009\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Will You Get if Your Idea Is Selected?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSelected participants wonâ€™t just receive applauseâ€”theyâ€™ll get real support. This includes:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTechnical mentorship Business training Consultation with experts Resources to build and scale\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTechnical mentorship\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBusiness training\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConsultation with experts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResources to build and scale\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMoreover, top entries will win a wild card opportunity to pitch for seed funding of â‚¹10 lakh under the Bihar Startup Policy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThat means you can go from idea to funded prototype without moving out of your home district.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Happens Next?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe program begins July 24 with awareness campaigns across districts. These campaigns will help local changemakers understand how to submit their ideas and participate. It will lead up to a two-day grand event in Patna in the last week of August.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccording to Mihir Kumar Singh, Additional Chief Secretary (Industries), this is part of a larger push to make Biharâ€™s startup environment more inclusive and accessible. The focus is not only on innovation but on innovation that solves real problems.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Is a Big Deal for Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor decades, bright minds from Bihar have migrated to other states, seeking platforms to express their ideas. This portal changes that narrative. Now, the government is bringing the platform home, inviting innovation from every corner of the state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImportantly, it represents a shift in how policy engages with peopleâ€”from top-down direction to bottom-up participation. With the right support, even small ideas from rural Bihar can become engines of growth.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTake the First Step Today\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDonâ€™t wait for the perfect moment. If you have an ideaâ€”big or smallâ€”submit it now. The Bihar Idea Festival gives you a rare opportunity to access resources, visibility, and funding without leaving your state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Follow www.biharsay.com for daily updates and detailed guides on how to participate.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin our growing community of 12,000+ global followers, committed to reshaping Biharâ€™s identity through stories of real change.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTags:#biharSay #Nitish Mishra Bihar government initiatives Bihar Idea Festival Bihar Startups Entrepreneurship in Bihar Jeevika Mihir Kumar Singh Startup Bihar\u003c/p\u003e",
