        "id":  "125-units-free-electricity-for-1-6-crore-bihar-families",
        "title":  "125 Units Free Electricity for 1.6 Crore Bihar Families",
        "summary":  "Bihar Lights Up: 125 Units of Free Electricity Brings Real Relief to Households When saving light means saving life â€” Biharâ€™s electricity bills just got a lot lighter. Imagine a home where families no longer dread the monthly ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar Lights Up: 125 Units of Free Electricity Brings Real Relief to Households\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen saving light means saving life â€” Biharâ€™s electricity bills just got a lot lighter.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine a home where families no longer dread the monthly power bill. A home where children can study under proper lighting, small businesses can work beyond sunset, and the elderly can enjoy a fan on a hot summer night â€” without thinking twice about the cost. Thatâ€™s the new reality taking shape in Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA free electricity scheme offering 125 units per month is now being implemented for over 1.6 crore households, marking a major leap in everyday affordability and energy inclusion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat the Scheme Offers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor every eligible household, 125 units of electricity will now be provided at zero cost. This benefit directly reduces utility expenses for crores of people â€” especially those who need it most.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHereâ€™s how it helps:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSaves â‚¹400â€“â‚¹600 per month, depending on usage Applies across both urban and rural areas Integrated with current electricity billing systems Automatically adjusts bills, making it user-friendly\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSaves â‚¹400â€“â‚¹600 per month, depending on usage\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApplies across both urban and rural areas\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIntegrated with current electricity billing systems\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAutomatically adjusts bills, making it user-friendly\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis initiative makes Bihar one of the few states offering universal energy relief at this scale.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy It Matters to Real People\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAffordable electricity isnâ€™t a luxury â€” itâ€™s a necessity. For lower and middle-income families, even small savings on utilities can shift household budgets.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis move brings many advantages:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStudents can study longer without dim lanterns or mobile flashlights Women entrepreneurs running sewing or food businesses get better work hours Health and hygiene improve in homes that can run coolers or water pumps more consistently Senior citizens no longer compromise on comfort\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStudents can study longer without dim lanterns or mobile flashlights\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWomen entrepreneurs running sewing or food businesses get better work hours\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHealth and hygiene improve in homes that can run coolers or water pumps more consistently\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSenior citizens no longer compromise on comfort\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore importantly, this scheme is about more than just savings â€” itâ€™s about dignity and access to a better quality of life.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow It Will Work\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe power benefit will be delivered through automatic billing adjustments, without requiring separate applications for most users. Once consumption is verified to stay within the 125-unit cap, the amount will be deducted automatically from the monthly bill.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis method:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReduces administrative delays Keeps the system transparent Helps even less-literate citizens benefit easily\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReduces administrative delays\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKeeps the system transparent\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHelps even less-literate citizens benefit easily\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMoreover, local electricity offices will assist with any billing queries. The approach is simple, inclusive, and citizen-first.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLong-Term Impact: Small Change, Big Difference\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile free electricity reduces bills instantly, it also brings long-term benefits. As more families start using stable energy:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFormal electricity connections will increase Illegal tapping and power theft may decline Trust in public infrastructure grows\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFormal electricity connections will increase\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIllegal tapping and power theft may decline\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTrust in public infrastructure grows\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEven small-scale rural enterprises benefit. A tailor who uses a sewing machine, or a shopkeeper with a freezer, now saves operational costs. Over time, that becomes income retained â€” or reinvested.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd letâ€™s not forget the emotional impact â€” fewer fights over electricity costs, fewer dark nights, and more peace of mind.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant More Stories That Matter?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen a simple policy reaches the doorstep of a common citizen, it becomes more than a headline â€” it becomes hope. If youâ€™re someone who values real change over political noise, follow www.biharsay.com.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet regular, apolitical updates about grassroots transformation, rural innovation, culture, and business â€” all from Biharâ€™s most trusted independent media voice.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin over 11,000 readers across the globe who are helping reshape Biharâ€™s digital identity.Bihar Say is where stories meet substance.\u003c/p\u003e",
