        "id":  "4-new-amrit-bharat-express-trains-transform-bihars-rail-map",
        "title":  "4 New Amrit Bharat Express Trains Transform Biharâ€™s Rail Map",
        "summary":  "â€œPatna Se Dilli Tak, Now Travel Smart!â€ | 4 New Amrit Bharat Express Trains Transform Biharâ€™s Rail Map New Tracks, New Hope: Bihar Gets 4 New Amrit Bharat Express Trains Fast, affordable, and built for Bharat â€” thatâ€™s th...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eâ€œPatna Se Dilli Tak, Now Travel Smart!â€ | 4 New Amrit Bharat Express Trains Transform Biharâ€™s Rail Map\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNew Tracks, New Hope: Bihar Gets 4 New Amrit Bharat Express Trains\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFast, affordable, and built for Bharat â€” thatâ€™s the new promise on rails.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a major leap for rail connectivity and comfort, four new Amrit Bharat Express trains have been launched in Bihar, offering passengers a fresh, upgraded travel experience. Designed with the common traveller in mind, these trains aim to bridge distances while ensuring comfort and accessibility for cities often left behind.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHere Are the Four New Routes You Should Know\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach route has been carefully planned to serve key regions in Bihar and nearby states:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRajendra Nagar Terminal (Patna) to New Delhi Bapudham Motihari to Delhi (Anand Vihar Terminal) Darbhanga to Lucknow (Gomti Nagar) Malda Town to Lucknow (Gomti Nagar) via Bhagalpur\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRajendra Nagar Terminal (Patna) to New Delhi\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBapudham Motihari to Delhi (Anand Vihar Terminal)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDarbhanga to Lucknow (Gomti Nagar)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMalda Town to Lucknow (Gomti Nagar) via Bhagalpur\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese routes will not only benefit regular passengers but also help students, job seekers, and business travellers looking for dependable rail options.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters: More Than Just New Trains\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe launch of these trains is part of an ongoing effort to modernise Indiaâ€™s vast rail network. With Bihar being a crucial hub of mobility in eastern India, the Amrit Bharat Express ensures:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLower fares Reliable service Comfort-focused coaches Wider access to tier-2 and tier-3 towns\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLower fares\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReliable service\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComfort-focused coaches\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWider access to tier-2 and tier-3 towns\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhatâ€™s Inside the Amrit Bharat Express?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese trains are configured to cater to real needsâ€”more seats, more safety, and better amenities:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e8 Sleeper Coaches for budget-friendly overnight travel 11 General Coaches to serve maximum passengers 2 Luggage-cum-brake Vans for better safety and storage 1 Pantry Car for onboard meals\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e8 Sleeper Coaches for budget-friendly overnight travel\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e11 General Coaches to serve maximum passengers\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2 Luggage-cum-brake Vans for better safety and storage\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 Pantry Car for onboard meals\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eItâ€™s a balance of affordability and functionalityâ€”perfect for long-distance routes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTrain Schedule: Rajendra Nagarâ€“New Delhi Route\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom July 31, 2025, Train No. 22361/22362 will begin daily service:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e22361: Departs Rajendra Nagar Terminal at 7:45 PM â†’ Arrives New Delhi at 1:10 PM next day 22362: Departs New Delhi at 7:10 PM â†’ Arrives Rajendra Nagar Terminal at 11:45 AM next day (from August 1)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e22361: Departs Rajendra Nagar Terminal at 7:45 PM â†’ Arrives New Delhi at 1:10 PM next day\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e22362: Departs New Delhi at 7:10 PM â†’ Arrives Rajendra Nagar Terminal at 11:45 AM next day (from August 1)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEarlier, a special service on July 18 marked the routeâ€™s launch, running from Patna to Delhi and back over two days.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Commuters Are Excited\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePeople across Biharâ€”especially in cities like Motihari, Darbhanga, and Bhagalpurâ€”have long awaited a reliable, economical rail option. These new trains finally offer that, with:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBetter night-travel options Daily frequency Wider seating capacity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBetter night-travel options\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDaily frequency\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWider seating capacity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor students traveling to Delhi for exams, or for families visiting relatives in Lucknowâ€”this is a major upgrade.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNot Just Trains, But a Movement\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isnâ€™t just a new serviceâ€”itâ€™s a step towards equal transport access. These trains offer a fair chance for small-town passengers to connect with big-city opportunities. That too, without burning a hole in their pockets.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs Biharâ€™s mobility story evolves, itâ€™s these quiet, structural improvements that leave the biggest impact.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ’¡ Want to stay updated on Biharâ€™s real progress stories?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Head over to www.biharsay.com and become part of our 11K+ global community.We spotlight Biharâ€™s changemakers, untold stories, and all the big and small steps shaping the stateâ€™s future.\u003c/p\u003e",
