        "title":  "Built in Bihar, Serving PSUs \u0026 Governments: How Hansa Sinha Redefined HR and Events",
        "summary":  "From 0 to 52,000 Students: How One Woman Turned Setback Into a Startup Powerhouse in Bihar â€œNo one stood by me, so I decided to stand for myself.â€ Thatâ€™s not just a statement. Itâ€™s a decision that changed the course of Han...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eFrom 0 to 52,000 Students: How One Woman Turned Setback Into a Startup Powerhouse in Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œNo one stood by me, so I decided to stand for myself.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThatâ€™s not just a statement. Itâ€™s a decision that changed the course of Hansa Sinhaâ€™s lifeâ€”and of Biharâ€™s startup story.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom a determined student of Mass Communication in Patna to a resilient entrepreneur building ventures in HR, IT, and creative consulting, Hansaâ€™s journey reflects the grit that Bihar breeds, even when the system leaves you behind.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMeet Hansa Sinha: Founder of Genesys Consulting and Creative Imprints\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn 2011, Hansa Sinha co-founded Genesys Consulting with Parimal Madhup, following a bitter fallout from a government recruitment project.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOriginally part of a distributed assignment between the two, the local team withdrew support midway and the head office failed to intervene. Hansa found herself stranded. But instead of folding, she forged ahead.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThat turning point gave birth to Genesys Consultingâ€”a Patna-based firm that today offers top-tier HR, IT, and project consulting services across corporates, PSUs, government departments, and NGOs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e52,000 Students, 38 Districts, 1 Unshakable Team\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGenesys Consulting didnâ€™t just survive adversityâ€”it turned into a benchmark for large-scale delivery.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe company executed a statewide OMR-based aptitude test for 52,000 students across Bihar, handling everything from operations to result generation and certification. The project spanned six months and proved that young entrepreneurs from Bihar could deliver at scale.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow active in Jharkhand as well, Genesys continues to blend process precision with people-centric execution.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom Consulting to Creativity: The Birth of Creative Imprints\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile leading Genesys, Hansa caught the attention of a senior IAS officer in Bihar, who saw a spark beyond numbers and systems. â€œHe asked me if I could build something more visual, something with soul,â€ she remembers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThat encouragement led to her second ventureâ€”Creative Imprints, a creative branding and event management company.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn one of her earliest projects, Hansa transformed a government event stage into a celestial-themed experienceâ€”complete with stars, planets, and galaxies. It was a bold concept that won hearts, headlines, and awards.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBy 2018, Creative Imprints had already:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned the stateâ€™s most prestigious event, Bihar Diwas Managed visual themes for Shiksha Diwas Built Republic Day and Independence Day tableaus Delivered innovative installations for public celebrations in Patna\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned the stateâ€™s most prestigious event, Bihar Diwas\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eManaged visual themes for Shiksha Diwas\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt Republic Day and Independence Day tableaus\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDelivered innovative installations for public celebrations in Patna\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Lies Ahead: New Offices, Bigger Dreams\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs Creative Imprints completed 5 years in 2018, Hansa began planning major changesâ€”team expansion, service diversification, and office upgrades.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHer journey underscores something crucial: that true growth doesnâ€™t just mean starting a company. It means rebuilding every time youâ€™re told â€œyou canâ€™t.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom a solo warrior abandoned in a project, Hansa has become the force behind two high-impact ventures reshaping Biharâ€™s professional and creative landscape.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet Hansaâ€™s Story Spark Your Own\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf youâ€™re stuck, sidelined, or simply waiting for a signâ€”this is it. Hansaâ€™s path wasnâ€™t paved in support or privilege. She carved it herself, with courage and purpose.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘£ Walk that path. And follow www.biharsay.com for 59 more stories like hers. Join the 12,000+ strong community celebrating Biharâ€™s growing entrepreneurial pulse.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTags:#Patna Bihar Diwas Bihar Startups Creative Imprints Genesys Consulting government project Bihar Hansa Sinha startup story women entrepreneurs\u003c/p\u003e",
