        "id":  "npa-expert-com-the-patna-startup-that-helped-150-businesses-survive",
        "title":  "NPA Expert.com: The Patna Startup That Helped 150+ Businesses Survive",
        "summary":  "The Untold Story of NPA Expert.com: How One Startup Turned 150+ Rejections into Real Funding A failed loan doesnâ€™t just end a dreamâ€”it can shake a life. Thatâ€™s what Raushan Kumar saw, again and again, in the bylanes of Patna...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eThe Untold Story of NPA Expert.com: How One Startup Turned 150+ Rejections into Real Funding\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA failed loan doesnâ€™t just end a dreamâ€”it can shake a life.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThatâ€™s what Raushan Kumar saw, again and again, in the bylanes of Patna. Promising entrepreneursâ€”tailors, traders, school owners, techniciansâ€”trying to grow, only to be told: â€œYour CIBIL score is too lowâ€ or â€œYour file isnâ€™t complete.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut instead of turning away, Raushan leaned in. In 2021, he founded NPA Expert.com, a one-of-a-kind platform built to help people who had been left behind by banks, bureaucracy, and broken systems.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Real Problem: Not Laziness, but Lack of Access\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAcross Indiaâ€”and especially in Biharâ€”micro and small business owners face harsh realities:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLoan rejections due to missing or incorrect documentation. Little to no awareness of funding schemes available to them. Low credit scores from past struggles, closing doors on their future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLoan rejections due to missing or incorrect documentation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLittle to no awareness of funding schemes available to them.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLow credit scores from past struggles, closing doors on their future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWorse, no one explains why a file is rejected. No one offers alternatives. As a result, dreamers with real potential walk away discouragedâ€”and often permanently damaged.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is where NPA Expert.com steps inâ€”not just as a fixer, but as a bridge. Their team helps rebuild trust between lenders and borrowers. But more importantly, they give people the knowledge, tools, and guidance to re-approach the systemâ€”with confidence.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Founder Who Didnâ€™t Walk Away\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBorn and raised in Patna, Raushan Kumar saw the frustration and pain around financial exclusion up close. With a background in business, law, and finance, he knew the system wasnâ€™t designed for everyoneâ€”but believed it could be improved from within.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThat belief led him to launch NPA Expert.com in 2021. But this wasnâ€™t a startup born in air-conditioned boardrooms. It began in conversationsâ€”late-night calls with clients facing property auctions, families afraid to answer bank calls, young entrepreneurs watching years of work collapse after a single loan rejection.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRaushan built a team of lawyers, financial experts, and documentation specialistsâ€”all committed to saving not just paperwork, but livelihoods.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHe didnâ€™t want to make headlines. He wanted to make sure no one was denied a chance just because they didnâ€™t know where to begin.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat NPA Expert.com Doesâ€”And Why It Works\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe approach is simple but powerful:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThey help businesses correct and complete loan documentation. They educate borrowers about government schemes theyâ€™re eligible for. They negotiate directly with banks and NBFCs to get better terms. They guide those with low CIBIL scores toward the right funding paths.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThey help businesses correct and complete loan documentation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThey educate borrowers about government schemes theyâ€™re eligible for.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThey negotiate directly with banks and NBFCs to get better terms.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThey guide those with low CIBIL scores toward the right funding paths.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd when clients fall behind on payments, they donâ€™t leave them in the dark. Instead, they help prevent NPA status, restructure loans, or protect assets from auctions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isnâ€™t just financial consultancyâ€”itâ€™s intervention. Itâ€™s advocacy. And for many, itâ€™s the only reason their business still exists.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e150+ Success Stories. One Mission: Second Chances\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn just four years, NPA Expert.com has helped over 150 clients across Bihar and other states. These arenâ€™t just â€œfunded projectsâ€â€”theyâ€™re families, employees, and communities saved from collapse.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThereâ€™s the grocery shop that was days away from losing its rented space.The private tutor who wanted to start a school but kept getting rejected.The printing press that avoided auction because someone helped renegotiate their loan.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese stories donâ€™t make news. But they change lives. And they restore something even more valuable than creditâ€”dignity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeyond Banking: A New Model for Financial Justice in Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe success of NPA Expert.com isnâ€™t about profits. Itâ€™s about a new kind of leadershipâ€”where founders step up not to disrupt, but to repair.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eToday, Raushan and his team operate from Patna but are connected with investors, banks, and chambers of commerce across India. They continue to expandâ€”not just geographically, but in impact. Their model proves that when you give people the right help at the right time, the system can work.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd in a country where millions still fear the banking system, thatâ€™s a revolution in itself.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhatâ€™s Nextâ€”and How You Can Be Part of It\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you believe in building a Bihar that supports every small business owner, every struggling dreamer, every honest fighterâ€”then stories like NPA Expert.com matter.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow their journey. Learn what theyâ€™re doing. Share it with someone who might need a second chance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Join the movement: www.biharsay.comðŸ‘‰ Be part of the 12,000+ global community spotlighting Biharâ€™s most impactful startups\u003c/p\u003e",
