        "title":  "â€œMera Vidyalayaâ€ Is Biharâ€™s Answer to EdTech Monopoly",
        "summary":  "â€œMera Vidyalayaâ€ â€” A â‚¹13,000 Revolution Transforming Small Schools Across Bihar â€œSapna tha ek digital school ka, aur â€˜Mera Vidyalayaâ€™ ne us sapne ko haqiqat bana diya.â€For countless school owners in Biharâ€™s small...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eâ€œMera Vidyalayaâ€ â€” A â‚¹13,000 Revolution Transforming Small Schools Across Bihar\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œSapna tha ek digital school ka, aur â€˜Mera Vidyalayaâ€™ ne us sapne ko haqiqat bana diya.â€For countless school owners in Biharâ€™s small towns and rural belts, this statement resonates with deep emotion and hard-earned progress.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a land where limited budgets often curb educational growth, one innovation is quietly rewriting the rules. â€œMera Vidyalayaâ€, a made-in-Bihar, AI-powered School Management System, is proving that cutting-edge technology doesnâ€™t need a cutting-edge price.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Birth of a Dream: Kamran Akhtarâ€™s Mission to Empower Schools\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBack in 2021, when the ed-tech buzz was sweeping metros, Kamran Akhtar saw a very different reality in Biharâ€™s small private schools. Paper registers, unpaid fees, scattered records, and zero automationâ€”most schools were miles away from becoming digital.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a background in software development and a heart rooted in Bihar, Kamran didnâ€™t just build another app. He created a purpose-driven solution. And the result? â€œMera Vidyalayaâ€â€”a school ERP system priced at â‚¹13,000 that rivals the features of systems costing â‚¹60,000â€“â‚¹70,000.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut more than affordability, it was the simplicity, local language interface, and offline accessibility that made it truly accessible to small institutions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom Startup Bihar to School Heroes: The Power of Government Backing\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œMera Vidyalayaâ€ isnâ€™t a lone success. It is part of a larger ecosystem powered by Startup Bihar, a flagship initiative by the Department of Industries, Government of Bihar. The scheme offers mentorship, funding, and recognition to grassroots innovators like Kamran.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn his interview, Kamran shares how initial capital support and validation from the Department became a turning point. It helped him scale operations, hire a small team, and reach over 200+ schools within months of launch.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHis words echo the dreams of thousands:â€œBihar gave me the idea, Startup Bihar gave me the wings.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBreaking the Urban-Only Tech Barrier: Making Biharâ€™s Schools Smart\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSmart classrooms are often a luxury in Tier-1 cities, but Kamran flipped the script. With â€œMera Vidyalaya,â€ even schools in Araria, Buxar, or Sitamarhi can now:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTrack student performance and attendance in real-time Automate fee collections and send SMS notifications Manage staff records, exams, results, and schedules Generate reports for audits and compliance with a click\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTrack student performance and attendance in real-time\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAutomate fee collections and send SMS notifications\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eManage staff records, exams, results, and schedules\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGenerate reports for audits and compliance with a click\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isnâ€™t just digitization. Itâ€™s democratization of technology for the education sector.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd the impact is visible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSmall schools report 40% reduction in manual work, 25% faster fee recovery, and improved parental trust through transparency.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore Than Software: A Movement That Reflects Biharâ€™s New Startup Spirit\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œMera Vidyalayaâ€ isnâ€™t just about code. Itâ€™s a vision of inclusive growth, a startup story that captures the resilience of Biharâ€™s youth. In a state often stereotyped for brain-drain, innovations like these are proof that the brains are building right here, right now.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom dusty towns to government podiums, the ripple of this change is being felt. And Kamranâ€™s story is inspiring many others to solve local problems with local minds.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ What You Can Do Next\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin us in celebrating such grassroots innovation from Bihar.âœ¨ Visit www.biharsay.com to explore more inspiring stories in our â€œ60 Days â€“ 60 Startups from Biharâ€ series.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe part of a growing 12,000+ global community that believes Bihar isnâ€™t behindâ€”itâ€™s just getting started.\u003c/p\u003e",
