        "summary":  "â€œà¤…à¤¬ à¤®à¥à¤‚à¤—à¥‡à¤° à¤¬à¤¨à¥‡à¤—à¤¾ à¤•à¤®à¤¾à¤ˆ à¤•à¤¾ à¤°à¤¾à¤¸à¥à¤¤à¤¾! Biharâ€™s Next Big Transport Hub Gets 16 New Routesâ€ Munger Set to Become Biharâ€™s New Transport \u0026 Commerce Hub with 16 Notified Routes Bihar ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eâ€œà¤…à¤¬ à¤®à¥à¤‚à¤—à¥‡à¤° à¤¬à¤¨à¥‡à¤—à¤¾ à¤•à¤®à¤¾à¤ˆ à¤•à¤¾ à¤°à¤¾à¤¸à¥à¤¤à¤¾! Biharâ€™s Next Big Transport Hub Gets 16 New Routesâ€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMunger Set to Become Biharâ€™s New Transport \u0026 Commerce Hub with 16 Notified Routes\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar is on the move â€” and Munger is leading the way! With 16 new transport routes officially notified, this historic city is stepping into a bold new identity â€” as Eastern Biharâ€™s Transport and Economic Nerve Centre.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMunger Gears Up for Unmatched Connectivity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor years, the lack of formal transport routes hampered direct movement from Munger to many important cities.But not anymore.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks to the Bihar Transport Department, 16 key routes connecting Darbhanga, Muzaffarpur, Katihar, Jaynagar, and more have now been officially notified.This means easier permits for buses and goods carriers, smoother operations, and fewer delays for transporters and commuters.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore importantly, it means real business and real jobs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom Paper to Progress: What This Means on Ground\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isnâ€™t just a notification â€” itâ€™s transformation on wheels.Mungerâ€™s vegetables, fish, grains, and local products can now reach high-demand markets faster. And essential raw materials can arrive seamlessly from other districts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe result?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocal industries get the boost they need. New income channels open up for drivers, helpers, logistics operators, and entrepreneurs. Mungerâ€™s agro-trade ecosystem grows stronger than ever.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocal industries get the boost they need.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNew income channels open up for drivers, helpers, logistics operators, and entrepreneurs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMungerâ€™s agro-trade ecosystem grows stronger than ever.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe opportunity is massive â€” and it starts with this push for connectivity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Munger Will Shine on Biharâ€™s Logistics Map\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMunger is no longer just a commissionerâ€™s town. Itâ€™s turning into a strategic trade zone. With the new inter-district routes, it links seamlessly to some of Biharâ€™s largest economic centers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis transformation creates a hub-and-spoke network for both people and products. Over time, itâ€™s expected to turn Munger into the go-to junction for trade, logistics, and commerce in the region.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd yes, itâ€™s not just about trucks and traffic â€” itâ€™s about dreams on the move.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸŒ Want to stay ahead with real development updates, not just headlines?Follow www.biharsay.com for powerful grassroots stories and become a part of our 12,000-strong global family.At Bihar Say, we donâ€™t just cover Bihar. We represent its spirit, struggle, and success â€” without political filters.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸŽ™ Tune in to #BiharCast, our exclusive podcast and video series, spotlighting unheard changemakers from every corner of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e",
