        "summary":  "Bihar to Host 2025 Asia Rugby U-20 in Rajgir | â€˜Ashokâ€™ Mascot \u0026 Logo Unveiled Bihar Enters the Global Rugby Arena Bihar is set to create history by hosting the Asia Rugby Under-20 Championship 2025 in Rajgir. The tournament wi...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar to Host 2025 Asia Rugby U-20 in Rajgir | â€˜Ashokâ€™ Mascot \u0026 Logo Unveiled\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar Enters the Global Rugby Arena\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar is set to create history by hosting the Asia Rugby Under-20 Championship 2025 in Rajgir. The tournament will mark the first-ever international rugby event in the state, turning Rajgir into a hub of energy, culture, and sporting excellence.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn preparation, the official mascot â€˜Ashokâ€™ and the event logo have been unveiled, adding excitement to this historic sporting chapter. The event will not only promote rugby but also showcase Biharâ€™s world-class sports infrastructure to a global audience.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNine Nations Compete in Rajgir\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe championship will witness nine international teams battling for glory:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndia, China, UAE, Hong Kong, Kazakhstan, Uzbekistan, Sri Lanka, Malaysia, and Nepal.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndia, China, UAE, Hong Kong, Kazakhstan, Uzbekistan, Sri Lanka, Malaysia, and Nepal.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTeams will arrive in Rajgir by August 7, followed by a grand opening ceremony on August 8 at the Kabaddi Hall of Rajgir Sports Complex. The matches will take place on August 9-10, offering two days of high-speed rugby action.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMoreover, all players will stay in Rajgir, allowing them to experience Biharâ€™s cultural heritage while competing at the highest level.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMeet â€˜Ashokâ€™ â€“ Biharâ€™s Symbol of Speed and Strength\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe tournamentâ€™s mascot, â€˜Ashokâ€™, is a fast, alert, and agile rabbit representing the spirit of rugby.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHis armor and shield symbolize confidence and readiness. The rugby ball in his hand reflects the new battlefield of sports. Inspired by Emperor Ashoka, he conveys leadership, courage, and determination.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHis armor and shield symbolize confidence and readiness.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe rugby ball in his hand reflects the new battlefield of sports.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInspired by Emperor Ashoka, he conveys leadership, courage, and determination.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis mascot is more than a design; itâ€™s a message of ambition for Biharâ€™s youth and a symbol of sporting pride.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Logo That Reflects Biharâ€™s Soul\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe official logo of the Asia Rugby U-20 Championship 2025 uses blue, green, and earthy tones to celebrate nature, heritage, and energy. Its modern style adds an international feel, while the symbolism connects it to Biharâ€™s rich cultural roots.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith Rugby India and international teams recognizing Biharâ€™s efforts, the tournament marks a new era for sports in the state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe Part of Biharâ€™s Sporting Journey\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Asia Rugby Under-20 Championship 2025 in Rajgir is more than a tournamentâ€”itâ€™s a celebration of youth, skill, and global sportsmanship.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ”¥ Stay updated and join our 11k+ community! Follow www.biharsay.com for exclusive coverage, stories, and behind-the-scenes action.\u003c/p\u003e",
