        "title":  "Biharâ€™s Second-Largest Cricket Stadium to Open Soon in Bihar",
        "summary":  "Biharâ€™s Second-Largest Cricket Stadium Comes Up in Bihar â€“ Rajgir Gears Up for Inauguration Biharâ€™s Sporting Aspirations Finally Find a Grand Stage Cricket has always stirred emotions in Bihar, but the lack of world-class in...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Second-Largest Cricket Stadium Comes Up in Bihar â€“ Rajgir Gears Up for Inauguration\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Sporting Aspirations Finally Find a Grand Stage\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCricket has always stirred emotions in Bihar, but the lack of world-class infrastructure often dimmed the spotlight. Thatâ€™s about to change. The newly constructed Rajgir International Cricket Stadium in Nalanda is now nearing its grand inauguration, and it promises to transform Biharâ€™s sporting landscape.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt to seat over 40,000 spectators, this stadium is now Indiaâ€™s second-largest cricket arenaâ€”next only to the Narendra Modi Stadium in Gujarat. More than just a sports facility, it symbolizes Biharâ€™s rising confidence and commitment to building platforms that can support national and international talent.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ‚¹1131 Crore Approved by Nitish Cabinet Fuels Biharâ€™s Biggest Stadium\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnder the leadership of Chief Minister Nitish Kumar, the state cabinet approved a massive â‚¹1131 crore budget for the Rajgir Sports Academy. A major share of this funding went into creating the cricket stadium.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile the core structure is already complete, workers are finalizing interior setups, seating zones, and tech installations. Officials are preparing to inaugurate the stadium in September 2025, setting the stage for a new era in Biharâ€™s cricket journey.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Pitch Thatâ€™s Rooted in Bihar: Red and Black Soil from Mokama\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis stadiumâ€™s pitch isnâ€™t just a surfaceâ€”itâ€™s a story. Crafted using red and black soil from Mokama, the pitch promises bounce, durability, and excitement. These materials, locally sourced, match the specifications used in top-tier grounds across the country.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Board of Control for Cricket in India (BCCI) has served as a benchmark for construction, ensuring the stadium can host major domestic and international matches. Every inch of this facility reflects both modern standards and regional pride.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Rajgir? A Historic Town Now Becomes a Sports Destination\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRajgir, already known for its rich cultural and historical roots, now finds itself on the sporting map of India. Located just a few hours from Patna and Gaya, Rajgir is well-connected and easy to reach. This strategic location strengthens its chances of becoming a central venue for national tournaments, training camps, and even IPL practice sessions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBy choosing Rajgir, the government has merged tourism with sports, giving visitors new reasons to explore the town and boosting local business in the process.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore Than Just Cricket: A Foundation for Biharâ€™s Youth\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis stadium brings more than cheersâ€”it brings opportunities. Local youth can now access top-class training infrastructure without leaving the state. Coaches, athletes, and sportspersons will find a new home in Rajgirâ€™s integrated sports ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe project is expected to create jobs, increase tourism, and open up new revenue streams. Schools and academies across the state will find inspiration in the facility, encouraging more kids to pursue sports seriously.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhatâ€™s Next?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs the finishing work wraps up, preparations for a grand September inauguration are underway. The stadium will soon welcome athletes, cricket lovers, and curious visitors from across India. Government officials are coordinating with sports bodies to finalize match schedules and hosting possibilities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its global standards, this venue could soon be the home ground for Biharâ€™s future Ranji players, womenâ€™s league matches, and youth tournaments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow Bihar Say for Exclusive Sports \u0026 Infrastructure Updates\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Rajgir International Cricket Stadium is just the beginning of Biharâ€™s sports transformation. To stay updated on its inauguration, player stories, pitch reports, and everything related to this massive development, keep following www.biharsay.com.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe part of our global 11,000+ community that trusts Bihar Say for real stories, honest reporting, and grassroots coverage. Weâ€™re not just covering Biharâ€”weâ€™re reshaping how the world sees it.\u003c/p\u003e",
