        "id":  "sumant-sinha-founder-of-renew-power-and-bihars-green-energy-billionaire",
        "title":  "Sumant Sinha â€“ Founder of ReNew Power and Biharâ€™s Green Energy Billionaire",
        "summary":  "â€œSumant Sinha of ReNew Power â€“ Biharâ€™s â‚¹3,000 Crore Green Energy Visionaryâ€ â€œBihar has always produced leaders â€” but in todayâ€™s era, one man from the state is powering not just homes, but Indiaâ€™s clean energy fut...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eâ€œSumant Sinha of ReNew Power â€“ Biharâ€™s â‚¹3,000 Crore Green Energy Visionaryâ€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eâ€œBihar has always produced leaders â€” but in todayâ€™s era, one man from the state is powering not just homes, but Indiaâ€™s clean energy future: Sumant Sinha.â€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWho is Sumant Sinha?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBorn into a family known for public service, Sumant Sinha is the son of Yashwant Sinha, Indiaâ€™s former Finance Secretary and Union Minister. Unlike his father, who chose politics and administration, Sumant carved a different path. He entered the corporate world with a focus on energy, finance, and business leadership.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEducated at IIT Delhi and Columbia University, Sumant developed a rare mix of technical knowledge and financial expertise. This combination later became the backbone of his success in the renewable energy industry.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBefore starting his own venture, he held senior positions at Aditya Birla Group and Suzlon Energy, gaining both global exposure and sectoral insight. However, it was his entrepreneurial leap that changed everything.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReNew Power â€“ Sumant Sinhaâ€™s Green Revolution\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn 2011, Sumant Sinha founded ReNew Power with a clear mission: to make renewable energy mainstream in India. At a time when many companies still relied on coal and oil, his idea looked risky. But his vision was strong â€” India needed clean power for sustainable growth.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eToday, ReNew Power has grown into Indiaâ€™s largest renewable energy company. With projects in solar and wind power across states, it has become a household name in sustainability. Under Sumantâ€™s leadership, the company attracted global investors and established itself as a pioneer in Indiaâ€™s fight against climate change.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSumant Sinhaâ€™s Net Worth and Lifestyle\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith his wealth crossing â‚¹3,000 crore, Sumant ranks among the richest green business leaders from Bihar. But unlike many billionaires, his lifestyle reflects his values. He is often seen in premium electric vehicles, choosing eco-friendly options even in his personal life.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis balance of business success and personal responsibility has earned him respect not just in corporate circles, but also among climate advocates worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFamily Roots and Bihar Connection\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeing the son of Yashwant Sinha gave Sumant exposure to leadership early on. But instead of politics, he found his calling in energy. His journey is a reminder that Biharâ€™s sons and daughters can achieve greatness in modern, global industries.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHe proudly represents Bihar in global forums, redefining the narrative of a state often known only for migration or underdevelopment. Through his story, Bihar gains a new identity â€” one of innovation and sustainability.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReNew Power and Indiaâ€™s Clean Energy Future\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnder Sumant Sinha, ReNew Power is not only a company but also a model for Indiaâ€™s green growth. It has reduced carbon emissions by millions of tonnes, created thousands of jobs, and set global benchmarks.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs the world moves toward net-zero goals, leaders like Sumant prove that business growth and climate action can go hand in hand. His journey inspires young entrepreneurs to dream big while staying responsible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Want to read more about global leaders from Bihar like Sumant Sinha and companies like ReNew Power that are reshaping the world? Follow www.biharsay.com now. Be part of our 12k+ strong global community and join Biharâ€™s digital voice for culture, business, and change.\u003c/p\u003e",
