        "title":  "IndiGo launches Ranchiâ€“Purnia flights, operating three days a week",
        "summary":  "Tired of long, exhausting journeys between Ranchi and Purnia? Your wait is finally over. With the launch of IndiGo Airlinesâ€™ new Ranchiâ€“Purnia air service, travel will now take just hours instead of an entire day. Starting Sep...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eTired of long, exhausting journeys between Ranchi and Purnia? Your wait is finally over. With the launch of IndiGo Airlinesâ€™ new Ranchiâ€“Purnia air service, travel will now take just hours instead of an entire day. Starting September 17, 2025, flights will operate three days a weekâ€”Monday, Wednesday, and Fridayâ€”offering comfort, speed, and connectivity that the region has long been waiting for.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNew Flight Schedule: Ranchi to Purnia via Kolkata\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndiGo has carefully planned this route in two legs:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRanchi Departure: 7:40 AM â†’ Reaches Kolkata Kolkata to Purnia: Arrival at 1:40 PM Return Flight: 2:30 PM from Purnia â†’ Reaches Ranchi at 8:45 PM via Kolkata\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRanchi Departure: 7:40 AM â†’ Reaches Kolkata\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKolkata to Purnia: Arrival at 1:40 PM\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReturn Flight: 2:30 PM from Purnia â†’ Reaches Ranchi at 8:45 PM via Kolkata\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis schedule allows same-day travel in both directions, something never possible before.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters: Relief from Long Train and Bus Rides\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUntil now, the only direct connectivity between Ranchi and Purnia was the Ranchiâ€“Purnia Court Express train. For everyone else, the long and tiring bus journey was the only option. This new service brings speed, comfort, and convenience, saving hours for students, professionals, and families.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBenefits Beyond Ranchi and Purnia\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis flight will not only connect two cities but also open opportunities for nearby districts like Deoghar, Bhagalpur, Katihar, Godda, Sahibganj, and Jamshedpur. People from these regions can now reach major cities faster, boosting trade, education, and healthcare access.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBusiness Impact: Traders and entrepreneurs can now attend meetings and move goods with ease. Educational Edge: Students and teachers gain faster access to institutions in Ranchi, Kolkata, and beyond.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBusiness Impact: Traders and entrepreneurs can now attend meetings and move goods with ease.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEducational Edge: Students and teachers gain faster access to institutions in Ranchi, Kolkata, and beyond.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasier Access to Healthcare\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerhaps the biggest relief comes for patients and families. Ranchi and Kolkata have some of the regionâ€™s best hospitals. With this flight, patients from Purnia and nearby districts can reach specialized care in hours, not days. In many cases, this time difference can save lives.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoosting Tourism and Cultural Exchange\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe service will also encourage tourism. Visitors can now easily explore:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRanchiâ€™s waterfalls and scenic beauty Deogharâ€™s religious significance Bhagalpur and Katiharâ€™s historic landmarks\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRanchiâ€™s waterfalls and scenic beauty\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeogharâ€™s religious significance\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBhagalpur and Katiharâ€™s historic landmarks\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt the same time, people from Jharkhand can travel swiftly to explore Seemanchalâ€™s culture and natural beauty.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndiGoâ€™s Initiative: Strengthening Regional Connectivity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis launch by IndiGo Airlines (@IndiGo6E) is a crucial step under the UDAN scheme, which aims to connect smaller cities to Indiaâ€™s air travel map. For Seemanchal and Jharkhand, it is more than a flightâ€”it is a bridge to opportunity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor years, locals demanded better connectivity. Now, with this direct link, Ranchi and Purnia stand closer than ever.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Want to stay updated with more such Bihar news and development stories?Follow www.biharsay.com and join our growing 12k+ worldwide community.Be part of Biharâ€™s leading apolitical storytelling platformâ€”reshaping the stateâ€™s image through stories of culture, business, and grassroots change.\u003c/p\u003e",
