        "title":  "Land Acquisition for Vikramshila Central University Begins",
        "summary":  "â€œBhagalpurâ€™s Vikramshila Set to Shine Again: Land Acquisition for Central University Begins Near Ancient Siteâ€ A New Dawn for Bhagalpurâ€™s Vikramshila History and higher education are coming together in Bhagalpur, where lan...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eâ€œBhagalpurâ€™s Vikramshila Set to Shine Again: Land Acquisition for Central University Begins Near Ancient Siteâ€\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA New Dawn for Bhagalpurâ€™s Vikramshila\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHistory and higher education are coming together in Bhagalpur, where land acquisition has begun for the proposed Vikramshila Central University. The new campus will rise near the Vikramshila excavation site, one of Biharâ€™s most significant cultural and archaeological treasures.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith survey work already underway, this development is being seen as a turning point for both the regionâ€™s academic aspirations and its historic pride.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLand Acquisition and Survey Work Underway\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Land Acquisition Department has started publishing the list of landholders. Authorities have earmarked around 215 acres of land for the project.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e92 acres in Antichak 84 acres in Malakpur 28 acres of Bihar government land\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e92 acres in Antichak\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e84 acres in Malakpur\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e28 acres of Bihar government land\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMuch of this land is currently agricultural, featuring lush mango orchards. Some huts stand on government land, but most of the plots remain suitable for institutional use.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOfficials confirmed that survey work is proceeding under Section 19(1) of the Land Acquisition Act. After publishing the list of landholders, a 60-day claim and objection period will follow. Subsequently, valuation notices will be issued, and payments will be made to eligible landowners.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Committee to Decide Land Value\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo ensure fairness, the Education Department has already proposed acquiring 4.29 acres close to the excavation site. A six-member committee will soon be formed to determine the landâ€™s value.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEarlier, a notification under Section 11(1) was issued on June 14. Following that, claims and objections were invited from tenants. Importantly, the projectâ€™s social costs and benefits were reviewed by a technical expert committee.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This University Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe establishment of Vikramshila Central University will do more than just create another academic hub. It will reconnect modern Bihar with its ancient legacy of learning, once nurtured by the Vikramshila Mahavihara.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBhagalpur has long carried the pride of hosting one of Indiaâ€™s great centers of Buddhist education. With the new Central University planned near the excavation site, the region could soon witness a revival of its reputation as a seat of knowledge and culture.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Want to stay ahead with more such updates on Biharâ€™s growth, culture, and stories of change?Follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our growing 12k+ worldwide community.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTags:Bhagalpur education news Bhagalpur News Bihar campus development bihar say Bihar universities Central University in Bihar Vikramshila Central University Vikramshila excavation site\u003c/p\u003e",
