        "id":  "iit-patna-student-ishani-sharma-b-tech-ai-graduate-joins-google-as-a-software-engineer",
        "title":  "IIT Patna student Ishani Sharma, B.Tech AI graduate, joins Google as a Software Engineer",
        "summary":  "What if choosing AI over traditional Computer Science could land you at Google? Thatâ€™s exactly what happened with Ishani Sharma, who has become an inspiring example of ambition, smart choices, and opportunity. Ishani Sharma: Fro...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eWhat if choosing AI over traditional Computer Science could land you at Google? Thatâ€™s exactly what happened with Ishani Sharma, who has become an inspiring example of ambition, smart choices, and opportunity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIshani Sharma: From IIT Patna to Google\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLanding a position at Google is a dream for many. For Ishani Sharma, that dream is now reality! She recently shared on her LinkedIn post, â€œLevel unlocked: Googler! So excited to share that Iâ€™ve joined Google as a Software Engineer!â€ âœ¨\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIshaniâ€™s journey began with a B.Tech in Artificial Intelligence at IIT Patna in 2021. During her studies, she completed internships at Google as a STEP and SWE Intern, gaining deep insights into problem-solving, large-scale projects, and collaborative innovation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy B.Tech AI Is a Game-Changer\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTraditionally, Computer Science has been the most preferred branch for engineering students. However, with Artificial Intelligence (AI) shaping industries, the demand for B.Tech AI graduates is rapidly growing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTop tech companies like Google, Amazon, and Flipkart are increasingly recruiting AI specialists. Ishaniâ€™s journey proves that bold decisions, specialized skills, and persistence can outperform conventional paths.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIIT Patnaâ€™s Rising Placement Power\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIIT Patna has been making waves with its strong placement record. Recently, the institute highlighted students securing opportunities in global companies like Google, Amazon, and Flipkart.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIshaniâ€™s success showcases how IIT Patna is nurturing engineers capable of competing globally.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSkills That Took Ishani to Google\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn her LinkedIn, Ishani highlights skills like Hadoop, Operating Systems, Exploratory Data Analysis, and Problem Solving. Combined with her internship experience, these skills helped her land a full-time role at Google.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHer post also mentions her excitement about the new Ananta Office and the opportunity to work on challenging projects with some of the brightest minds in the industry.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGoogle Career Milestone\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom a STEP and SWE intern to a full-time Software Engineer at Google, Ishaniâ€™s story is a powerful example of ambition meeting opportunity. Her journey proves that mastering technical skills and embracing innovation opens doors to global careers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Want more inspiring stories of top students and career journeys? Follow www.biharsay.com for regular updates and become part of our 12k+ global community.Bihar Say is Biharâ€™s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, reshaping the stateâ€™s image through impactful stories on culture, business, and grassroots change.\u003c/p\u003e",
