        "title":  "Makhana Mahotsav 2025 to be Held in Patna on October 4 and 5",
        "summary":  "Bihar Makhana Mahotsav 2025: Patna Set to Celebrate the Global Rise of Biharâ€™s Superfood on Oct 4-5 Biharâ€™s Superfood is Taking Center Stage Imagine a festival where farmers, entrepreneurs, startups, policymakers, and research...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eBihar Makhana Mahotsav 2025: Patna Set to Celebrate the Global Rise of Biharâ€™s Superfood on Oct 4-5\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiharâ€™s Superfood is Taking Center Stage\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine a festival where farmers, entrepreneurs, startups, policymakers, and researchers gather under one roofâ€”all to celebrate a humble seed that has transformed into a global superfood. Thatâ€™s exactly what Bihar is preparing for with the Makhana Mahotsav 2025, happening on October 4 and 5 at Gyan Bhawan, Patna.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Festival of Growth and Opportunity\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Directorate of Horticulture, Bihar, led by Director Abhishek Kumar, announced that this yearâ€™s event will not only honor the cultural roots of Makhana but also showcase its booming future. With increasing health awareness worldwide, Makhana has gained recognition as a superfood, making this festival more relevant each year.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe event will feature sessions on:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMechanization of Makhana cultivation B2B business conferences Export support by APEDA Processing and value addition opportunities\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMechanization of Makhana cultivation\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eB2B business conferences\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExport support by APEDA\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProcessing and value addition opportunities\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor farmers and entrepreneurs, this isnâ€™t just a festivalâ€”itâ€™s a chance to unlock new business opportunities and expand their markets.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Decade of Remarkable Progress\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks to schemes like the Makhana Development Plan, Biharâ€™s Makhana sector has seen remarkable growth over the past decade. Cultivation areas expanded by 171%, while Makhana pop production rose by 152%.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, supportive policies such as the Bihar Industrial Investment Promotion Package (BIIPP), PM-FME Scheme, and other state-led initiatives have boosted the industry. This rapid progress has firmly placed Bihar on the global map for Makhana trade.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYouth and Women Leading the Change\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs global demand continues to rise, Biharâ€™s youth and women are driving innovation in the sector. Many have launched startups and small-scale enterprises focused on Makhana processing, packaging, and exports. Their ventures have not only created jobs locally but also strengthened Biharâ€™s presence in international markets.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe recent Makhana Board notification has further opened doors for entrepreneurs, ensuring that the industry continues to evolve with speed and impact.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Festival for Every Bihari\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDirector Abhishek Kumar emphasized that the Mahotsav will be an exciting and educational experience. Visitors will explore new technologies, marketing strategies, and global opportunities tied to Makhana. Above all, the event is a celebration of Biharâ€™s prideâ€”transforming a traditional food into a global brand.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo, if you are in Bihar, donâ€™t miss this chance to witness history being made at the Makhana Mahotsav 2025 in Patna.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ For more stories like this, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 11k+ global community. Bihar Say is Biharâ€™s leading apolitical storytelling platform, reshaping the stateâ€™s image with impactful stories on culture, business, and grassroots change.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTags:Abhishek Kumar Bihar Horticulture APEDA Makhana Bihar Industrial Investment Promotion Package Bihar Makhana Mahotsav 2025 Bihar Startup Makhana Bihar superfood Makhana Export Bihar Makhana Festival Patna\u003c/p\u003e",
