        "id":  "pm-modi-lays-the-foundation-for-iit-patnas-rs-644-crore-expansion",
        "title":  "PM Modi lays the foundation for IIT-Patnaâ€™s Rs 644 crore expansion",
        "summary":  "A Landmark Moment for Biharâ€™s Education When Prime Minister Narendra Modi laid the foundation stone for IIT-Patnaâ€™s Rs 644 crore expansion project, it wasnâ€™t just about bricks and mortar. It was about dreams, opportunities, ...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eA Landmark Moment for Biharâ€™s Education\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen Prime Minister Narendra Modi laid the foundation stone for IIT-Patnaâ€™s Rs 644 crore expansion project, it wasnâ€™t just about bricks and mortar. It was about dreams, opportunities, and positioning Bihar as a global knowledge hub. The event, held via videoconference from Jharsuguda, Odisha, brought national attention to Patnaâ€™s growing role in Indiaâ€™s education and innovation journey.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat the Rs 644 Crore Expansion Means\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis third phase of IIT-Patnaâ€™s development covers 1,26,000 square metres of modern infrastructure. Funded through the Higher Education Financing Agency, the project promises:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA state-of-the-art research park and advanced central research facilities. Innovative academic buildings designed to nurture entrepreneurship. Hostels for 2,000 male and 500 female students. An international hostel with 250 seats. Studio apartments for married scholars. Modern residential quarters for faculty and staff.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA state-of-the-art research park and advanced central research facilities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInnovative academic buildings designed to nurture entrepreneurship.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHostels for 2,000 male and 500 female students.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAn international hostel with 250 seats.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStudio apartments for married scholars.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eModern residential quarters for faculty and staff.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach facility has been planned to match global standards, giving Biharâ€™s youth the resources they deserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVoices That Inspire Change\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnion ministers Dharmendra Pradhan and Giriraj Singh, alongside leaders like Ravi Shankar Prasad, Nitin Nabin, and Sunil Kumar, graced the local event at Urja Stadium in Patna. Their presence underscored the importance of this milestone for Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIIT-Patna director Prof. T N Singh expressed gratitude to the Prime Minister. He called the project a turning point that would elevate the instituteâ€™s capacity for research, entrepreneurship, and global collaboration. â€œThis project strengthens IIT-Patnaâ€™s journey towards becoming a global hub of innovation,â€ he affirmed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy This Matters for Bihar and Beyond\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBihar has long carried the image of resilience. Now, with projects like IIT-Patnaâ€™s expansion, the state is emerging as a symbol of aspiration. Modern hostels, international-standard labs, and facilities for both students and faculty will transform Patna into an educational magnet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFurthermore, this expansion fuels Indiaâ€™s larger ambition to lead in knowledge-based economies. It reflects a vision where states like Bihar stand shoulder-to-shoulder with global education giants.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eðŸ‘‰ Want to stay updated on Biharâ€™s transformation? Follow www.biharsay.com for more inspiring stories. Join over 12,000 followers worldwide and be part of Biharâ€™s fastest-growing apolitical digital community reshaping the stateâ€™s global image!\u003c/p\u003e",
