        "id":  "indian-railways-introduces-aadhaar-linked-booking-ahead-of-diwali-chhath-2025-rush",
        "title":  "Indian Railways Introduces Aadhaar-Linked Booking Ahead of Diwali \u0026 Chhath 2025 Rush",
        "summary":  "This Diwali and Chhath, say goodbye to booking stress! Indian Railways is rolling out Aadhaar-linked ticket bookings to help millions secure seats effortlessly. Aadhaar-Linked Booking: Priority for Early Birds From October 1, 2025...",
        "content":  "\u003cp\u003eThis Diwali and Chhath, say goodbye to booking stress! Indian Railways is rolling out Aadhaar-linked ticket bookings to help millions secure seats effortlessly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAadhaar-Linked Booking: Priority for Early Birds\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom October 1, 2025, passengers with Aadhaar linked to their IRCTC accounts will enjoy a 15-minute priority booking window. AC class tickets can be booked between 10:00 am and 10:15 am, while non-AC classes open between 11:00 am and 11:15 am.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMeanwhile, travellers without Aadhaar linkage can still book tickets after this window. This step ensures smoother bookings and reduces last-minute chaos.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBooking Window and Festival Travel Period\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe new system covers journeys between October 3 and December 2, 2025. Passengers can plan both onward and return journeys in advance, securing their spots during peak festive season.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndian Railways has also introduced special trains connecting Bihar and eastern Uttar Pradesh cities such as Patna, Gaya, Bhagalpur, Buxar, Varanasi, Mau, Lucknow, and Motihari. These measures aim to ease travel pressure during Diwali and Chhath Puja.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Linking Aadhaar Matters\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOfficials advise passengers to link their Aadhaar well ahead of time. Doing so guarantees priority access during peak booking hours. This simple step could save hours of waiting and ensure families reunite stress-free during festivals.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTickets can be booked through the official IRCTC website or mobile app. Transition words like furthermore, meanwhile, and thus enhance clarity and keep travellers informed about these new rules.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTips for a Smooth Festive Travel\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLink your Aadhaar to your IRCTC account immediately. Note the specific 15-minute booking window for AC and non-AC classes. Book both onward and return tickets early to avoid last-minute rush. Check special trains connecting key destinations in Bihar and eastern UP. Keep payment details ready for faster checkout.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLink your Aadhaar to your IRCTC account immediately.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNote the specific 15-minute booking window for AC and non-AC classes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBook both onward and return tickets early to avoid last-minute rush.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCheck special trains connecting key destinations in Bihar and eastern UP.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKeep payment details ready for faster checkout.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese small steps can make a huge difference during high-demand festive travel.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay Updated and Be Part of the Community\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndian Railwaysâ€™ Aadhaar-linked booking is a game-changer for Diwali and Chhath travel. Stay ahead, plan your trips early, and avoid festival travel chaos.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more such regular updates, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 12k+ global community! Bihar Say is Biharâ€™s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, reshaping the stateâ€™s image through impactful stories on culture, business, and grassroots change.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the conversation, explore BiharCast, and discover untold stories, changemakers, and rising voices from the heart of Bihar.\u003c/p\u003e",
